longdesc opinion) regarding this character. At the moment only the fonts
longdesc TeX Gyre Bonum, TeX Gyre Schola, TeX Gyre Pagella, and the
longdesc Latin Modern fonts are supported. The other fonts in the TeX
longdesc Gyre bundle do not need this support.
