name aidisclose
shortdesc Generate disclosure statements and checklists for the use of generative AI
longdesc This package provides a standardized, transparent way to
longdesc declare the use of generative artificial intelligence (AI)
longdesc tools in academic, technical, and professional documents. It
longdesc implements an extension of the GAIDeT (Generative AI Delegation
longdesc Taxonomy), letting authors mark which tasks were delegated to
longdesc AI, list the tools used (or state that none were), add optional
longdesc numbered or unnumbered comments, and automatically typeset a
longdesc formatted disclosure section or chapter with a task-based
longdesc checklist. Configuration uses a key-value interface, and
longdesc citations for the taxonomy and the package can be managed
longdesc automatically. The package detects the document language
longdesc through babel or polyglossia and ships translations for
longdesc fourteen languages, falling back to English. A companion web
longdesc generator/configurator is available at https://aidisclose.org.
catalogue-contact-home https://aidisclose.org
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/joaomlourenco/aidisclose
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/aidisclose
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics form-fillin
catalogue-version 1.12.0

name aiplans
shortdesc A TikZ-based library for drawing POCL plans
longdesc This TikZ library is designed for generating diagrams related
longdesc to Automated Planning, a subdiscipline of Artificial
longdesc Intelligence. It allows users to define a domain model for
longdesc actions, similar to PDDL and HDDL used in hierarchical
longdesc planning. The package is useful for researchers and students to
longdesc create diagrams that represent sequential action sequences or
longdesc partially ordered plans, including causal links and ordering
longdesc constraints (e.g., POCL plans). It is particularly suited for
longdesc presentations and scientific publications.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/YikaiGe/tikz-aiplans/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/YikaiGe/tikz-aiplans
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/aiplans
