catalogue-ctan /fonts/arsenal
catalogue-license ofl lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics font font-body font-cyrillic font-otf font-sans font-supp tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.1

name arsenal-math
shortdesc Arsenal Math OpenType fonts
longdesc Arsenal Math is a math companion font for the Arsenal text
longdesc font. It is based on KpMath-Sans, with Latin characters,
longdesc numerals and a few symbols from the Arsenal font. XeTeX or
longdesc LuaTeX is required to use these OpenType math fonts.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://gitlab.com/rit-fonts/arsenal-math/-/work_items
catalogue-contact-repository https://gitlab.com/rit-fonts/arsenal-math
