name arydshln
shortdesc Draw dash-lines in array/tabular
longdesc The package is to draw dash-lines in array/tabular
longdesc environments. Horizontal lines are drawn by \hdashline and
longdesc \cdashline while vertical ones can be specified as a part of
longdesc the preamble using :. The shape of dash-lines may be controlled
longdesc through style parameters or optional arguments. The package is
longdesc compatible with array, colortab, longtable, and colortbl.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/arydshln
catalogue-license lppl1
catalogue-topics alignment-supp tagged-pdf-incompatible
