name autotype
shortdesc A LuaLaTeX package for automatic language-specific typography
longdesc autotype is a LuaLaTeX package for automatic language-specific
longdesc typography. Currently, only the German language is supported
longdesc (old and new orthography). The package makes it possible to
longdesc suppress ligatures at word boundaries, to activate a
longdesc hyphenation algorithm that prefers hyphenation points at word
longdesc boundaries (weighted hyphenation), to enable irregular
longdesc hyphenations like backen - bak-ken, Schiffahrt - Schiff-fahrt
longdesc of traditional German orthography, and to insert long s for
longdesc blackletter typesetting.
catalogue-also ligtype selnolig
catalogue-contact-bugs https://codeberg.org/wehr/autotype/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://codeberg.org/wehr/autotype
catalogue-contact-support mailto:trennmuster@dante.de
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/latex/autotype
catalogue-license lppl1.3 mit other-free
catalogue-topics font-supp german hyphenation luatex typesetting
catalogue-version 0.6

