longdesc Awesome Boxes is all about drawing admonition blocks around
longdesc text to inform or alert readers about something particular. The
longdesc specific aim of this package is to use FontAwesome icons to
longdesc ease the illustration of these blocks. The package depends on
longdesc fontawesome5, xcolor, array and xparse.
