name babel-greek
shortdesc Babel support for the Greek language and script
longdesc The bundle provides comprehensive support for the Greek
longdesc language and script via the Babel system. Document authors can
longdesc select between the monotonic (single-diacritic), polytonic
longdesc (multiple-diacritic), and ancient orthography of the Greek
longdesc language. Included are the packages grmath for Greek function
longdesc names in mathematics, and athnum for Attic numerals.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://codeberg.org/milde/greek-tex/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://codeberg.org/milde/greek-tex
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/babel-contrib/greek
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics greek multilingual-addon tagged-pdf-partially
catalogue-version 1.15

name babel-hebrew
shortdesc Babel support for Hebrew
longdesc The package provides the language definition file for support
longdesc of Hebrew in babel. Macros to control the use of text direction
longdesc control of TeX--XeT and e-TeX are provided (and may be used
longdesc elsewhere). Some shortcuts are defined, as well as translations
longdesc to Hebrew of standard LaTeX names. For questions, bug reports,
longdesc or support, please open an issue in the repository. Note: the
longdesc package is in maintenance mode. Bugs will be fixed, but no new
longdesc features will be added. The .ldf file is only compatible with
longdesc pdfLaTeX or LaTeX. Even then, for documents containing more
longdesc than a short text in Hebrew, it is strongly recommended to use
longdesc LuaTeX (with babel's .ini file or polyglossia). For short texts
longdesc with pdfTeX, use the .ini file. Consult the documentation of
longdesc babel for better settings for Hebrew.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://codeberg.org/Udi-Fogiel/babel-hebrew/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://codeberg.org/Udi-Fogiel/babel-hebrew
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/babel-contrib/hebrew
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics hebrew
catalogue-version 2.5

