name babel-malagasy
shortdesc Malagasy captions for the babel language system
longdesc This package completes Malagasy (BCP 47 tag mg) support in the
longdesc babel system for LaTeX. Modern babel already ships CLDR-derived
longdesc date/month/weekday data for Malagasy, but its standard captions
longdesc (Chapter, Contents, Figure, etc.) are shipped empty. This
longdesc package fills them in with reviewed Malagasy terms via babel's
longdesc own documented \setlocalecaption mechanism.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/babel-contrib/babel-malagasy
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics malagasy multilingual-addon
