name babelbib
shortdesc Multilingual bibliographies
longdesc This package enables the user to generate multilingual
longdesc bibliographies in cooperation with babel. Two approaches are
longdesc possible: Each citation may be written in another language, or
longdesc the whole bibliography can be typeset in a language chosen by
longdesc the user. In addition, the package supports commands to change
longdesc the typography of the bibliographies.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/TeX-Live/babelbib/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/TeX-Live/babelbib
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/TeX-Live/babelbib.git
catalogue-ctan /biblio/bibtex/contrib/babelbib
catalogue-license lppl1
catalogue-topics bibtex-supp multilingual
catalogue-version 1.34

name babelbidi
shortdesc An extension to babel's bidirectional support
longdesc This package extends Babel's bidirectional support by fixing
longdesc direction-sensitive behaviour and providing interfaces for
longdesc explicit text direction, language selection, and font
longdesc configuration, including glyph fallback with LuaTeX. It
longdesc supports languages available through Babel and works with
longdesc LuaTeX (recommended), XeTeX, or pdfTeX, with either an LTR or
longdesc RTL main language.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/gambi-shah/babelbidi/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/gambi-shah/babelbidi
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/babelbidi
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics bidi multilingual

name background
shortdesc Placement of background material on pages of a document
longdesc The package offers the placement of background material on the
longdesc pages of a document. The user can control many aspects
longdesc (contents, position, color, opacity) of the background material
longdesc that will be displayed; all placement and attribute settings
longdesc are controlled by setting key values. The package makes use of
longdesc the everypage package, and uses pgf/tikz for attribute control.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/background
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics background decoration tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 2.1

name backnaur
shortdesc Typeset Backus Naur Form definitions
longdesc The package typesets Backus-Naur Form (BNF) definitions. It
longdesc prints formatted lists of productions, with numbers if
longdesc required. It can also print in-line BNF expressions using math
longdesc mode.
catalogue-also simplebnf
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/backnaur
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics formal-spec
catalogue-version 3.1

name baekmuk
shortdesc Korean TrueType fonts from Baekmuk
longdesc This bundle consists of four Korean fonts: batang.ttf: serif
longdesc dotum.ttf: sans-serif gulim.ttf: sans-serif (rounded)
longdesc hline.ttf: headline These fonts were originally retrieved from
longdesc http://kldp.net/baekmuk/ and are no longer maintained.
catalogue-ctan /fonts/baekmuk
catalogue-license other-free
catalogue-topics font font-cjk font-ttf korean
catalogue-version 2.2.1

name bagpipe
shortdesc Support for typesetting bagpipe music
longdesc Typesetting bagpipe music in MusixTeX is needlessly tedious.
longdesc This package provides specialized and re-defined macros to
longdesc simplify this task.
catalogue-ctan /macros/generic/bagpipe
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics music
catalogue-version 3.02

