shortdesc Metafont source and macros for the Baha'i nine-pointed star
longdesc This package provides a Metafont-based implementation of the
longdesc Baha'i nine-pointed star [?] for usage in LaTeX documents,
longdesc while still providing proper copy behavior with the official
longdesc Unicode codepoints and supporting the usage of the character
longdesc directly.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/LaPingvino/latex-bahaistar/issues
