name beamercolortheme-chalkboard
shortdesc A chalkboard-inspired dark green color theme for Beamer
longdesc Chalkboard provides a dark green background with warm off-white
longdesc text and yellow, blue, and pink accents for Beamer
longdesc presentations. It defines colors for titles, palettes,
longdesc projected items, and standard, alert, and example blocks. It
longdesc also selects rounded blocks and a rounded title page without
longdesc shadows and makes projected item labels bold. Load it after
longdesc your main theme using \usecolortheme{chalkboard}. Documentation
longdesc and a self-contained example are included. No additional fonts
longdesc or external images are required.
