longdesc This beamer theme is inspired by West Lake, a famous freshwater
longdesc lake in Hangzhou, China, and Westlake University. Interfaces
longdesc are provided for customizing theme color, logo, badge, etc.
catalogue-contact-development https://github.com/Westlake-TUG
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/Westlake-TUG/beamertheme-westlake
