name beamerthemeamurmaple
shortdesc A new modern beamer theme
longdesc This Beamer theme is a suitable theme for my use of Beamer in
longdesc applied mathematics research. It meets my needs in my work.
longdesc However, if you like this theme, and if you want to ask for or
longdesc make improvements, don't hesitate to write to me!
