name biblatex-apa-zh
shortdesc APA 7 citation rendering for Traditional Chinese prose
longdesc This package extends biblatex-apa with support for Traditional
longdesc Chinese citation and bibliography formatting according to APA
longdesc 7. The package provides: full-width Chinese punctuation for
longdesc citations in Traditional Chinese text; entry-specific name
longdesc strings and bibliography punctuation based on the langid field;
longdesc mixed Chinese and Western entries within a single bibliography;
longdesc separate control of the language of citation text and the
longdesc language of individual bibliography entries; operation without
longdesc babel or polyglossia, making it suitable for xeCJK documents.
longdesc The provided formatting follows Traditional Chinese academic
longdesc conventions used in Taiwan. Simplified Chinese conventions are
longdesc not supported. A test suite for checking the rendered output is
longdesc included.
