name biblatex-chicago
shortdesc Chicago style files for BibLaTeX
longdesc This is a BibLaTeX style that implements the Chicago
longdesc author-date and notes with bibliography style specifications
longdesc given in the Chicago Manual of Style, 17th edition (with
longdesc continuing support for the 16th edition, too). The style
longdesc implements entry types for citing audio-visual materials, among
longdesc many others. The package was previously known as
longdesc biblatex-chicago-notes-df.
