longdesc The bundle offers two styles - philosophy-classic and
longdesc philosophy-modern - that facilitate the production of two
longdesc different kinds of bibliography, based on the authoryear style,
longdesc with options and features to manage the information about the
longdesc translation of foreign texts or their reprints. Though the
longdesc package's default settings are based on the conventions used in
longdesc Italian publications, these styles can be used with every
longdesc language recognized by babel, possibly with some simple
longdesc redefinitions.
