name biblatex-sbl
shortdesc Society of Biblical Literature (SBL) style files for BibLaTeX
longdesc The package provides BibLaTeX support for citations in the
longdesc format specified by the second edition of the Society of
longdesc Biblical Literature Handbook of Style, the SBLHS Student
longdesc Supplement and updates published in the SBLHS blog. Highlights
longdesc include: Full support for every example in the SBL Handbook of
longdesc Style 2nd ed., SBLHS Student Supplement and SBLHS blog.
longdesc Documentation showing how to set up and cite bib entries for
longdesc every supported example. Advanced handling of first and
longdesc subsequent citations in running text and footnotes. Support for
longdesc a variety of types of reprints. Comprehensive support for
longdesc abbreviations, including citing reference works, ancient works
longdesc and general abbreviations. Support for citing ancient works by
longdesc both source division and text collection page, including
longdesc indicating the translator if needed. German translation
longdesc strings.
