name biblatex-subseries
shortdesc Manages subseries with BibLaTeX
longdesc Some publishers organize book series with subseries. In this
longdesc case, two numbers are associated with one volume: the number
longdesc inside the series and the number inside the subseries. That is
longdesc the case of the series Corpus Scriptorium Christianorum
longdesc Orientalium published by Peeters. This package provides new
longdesc fields to manage such system.
catalogue-contact-repository https://git.framasoft.org/maieul/biblatex-subseries
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/biblatex-contrib/biblatex-subseries
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics biblatex
catalogue-version 1.2.0

