name bibleref-mouth
shortdesc Consistent formatting of Bible references
longdesc The package allows Bible references to be formatted in a
longdesc consistent way. It is similar to the bibleref package, except
longdesc that the formatting macros are all purely expandable - that is,
longdesc they are all implemented in TeX's mouth. This means that they
longdesc can be used in any expandable context, such as an argument to a
longdesc \url command.
catalogue-also bibleref
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/bibleref-mouth
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics theology
