name bigfoot
shortdesc Footnotes for critical editions
longdesc The package aims to provide a one-stop solution to requirements
longdesc for footnotes. It offers: Multiple footnote apparatus superior
longdesc to that of manyfoot Footnotes can be formatted in separate
longdesc paragraphs, or be run into a single paragraph (this choice may
longdesc be selected per footnote series); Things you might have
longdesc expected (such as \verb-like material in footnotes, and colour
longdesc selections over page breaks) now work. Note that the majority
longdesc of the bigfoot package's interface is identical to that of
longdesc manyfoot; users should seek information from that package's
longdesc documentation. The bigfoot bundle also provides the perpage and
longdesc suffix packages.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/bigfoot
catalogue-license gpl2
catalogue-topics footnote tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 2.1

name bigintcalc
