catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/biochemistry-colors
catalogue-license lppl gpl
catalogue-topics colour
catalogue-version 1.00

name biocon
shortdesc Typesetting biological species names
longdesc The biocon-biological conventions-package aids the typesetting
longdesc of some biological conventions. At the moment, it makes a good
longdesc job of typesetting species names (and ranks below the species
longdesc level). A distinction is made between the Plant, Fungi,
longdesc Animalia and Bacteria kingdoms. There are default settings for
longdesc the way species names are typeset, but they can be customized.
longdesc Different default styles are used in different situations.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/biocon
catalogue-license gpl
catalogue-topics biology

name biolett-bst
shortdesc A BibTeX style for the journal Biology Letters
longdesc This package provides a BibTeX style (.bst) file for the
longdesc journal Biology Letters published by the Royal Society. This
longdesc style was produced independently and hence has no formal
longdesc approval from the Royal Society.
catalogue-ctan /biblio/bibtex/contrib/biolett-bst
