name blindtext
shortdesc Producing blind text for testing
longdesc The package provides the commands \blindtext and \Blindtext for
longdesc creating blind text useful in testing new classes and packages,
longdesc and \blinddocument, \Blinddocument for creating an entire
longdesc random document with sections, lists, mathematics, etc. The
longdesc package supports three languages, english, (n)german and latin;
longdesc the latin option provides a short lorem ipsum (for a fuller
longdesc lorem ipsum text, see the lipsum package).
