name booktabs
shortdesc Publication quality tables in LaTeX
longdesc The package enhances the quality of tables in LaTeX, providing
longdesc extra commands as well as behind-the-scenes optimisation.
longdesc Guidelines are given as to what constitutes a good table in
longdesc this context. From version 1.61, the package offers longtable
longdesc compatibility.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/booktabs
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics table table-rule tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.61803398

name booktabs-de
shortdesc German version of booktabs
longdesc This is a translation of the booktabs.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/booktabs-de
catalogue-license gpl
catalogue-topics german-doc translation
catalogue-version 1.61803

name booktabs-fr
shortdesc French translation of booktabs documentation
longdesc The translation comes from a collection provided by Benjamin
longdesc Bayart.
catalogue-ctan /info/translations/booktabs/fr
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics french-doc translation
catalogue-version 1.00

name booktabstabular
shortdesc Automatic application of the booktabs style
longdesc This package provides wrapper environments around tabular and
longdesc tabular* that insert \toprule at the beginning, \bottomrule at
longdesc the end, and locally remap the legacy \hline and \cline
longdesc commands to their booktabs equivalents \midrule and \cmidrule.
longdesc It also provides commands to temporarily override the standard
longdesc tabular and tabular* environments so that existing documents
longdesc can opt into this behaviour without rewriting each table.
catalogue-contact-repository https://gitlab.com/M0M097/booktabstabular
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/booktabstabular
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics table-rule
catalogue-version 1.1.2

name boolexpr
shortdesc A boolean expression evaluator and a switch command
longdesc The \boolexpr macro evaluates boolean expressions in a purely
longdesc expandable way. \boolexpr{ A \OR B \AND C } expands to 0 if the
longdesc logical expression is TRUE. A, B, C may be: numeric expressions
longdesc such as: x=y, x<>y, x>y or x<y; boolean switches: \iftrue
longdesc 0\else 1\fi; conditionals: \ifcsname whatsit\endcsname 0\else
longdesc 1\fi; another \boolexpr: \boolexpr{ D \OR E \AND F }: \boolexpr
longdesc may be used with \ifcase: \ifcase\boolexpr{ A \OR B \AND C }
longdesc What to do if true \else What to do if false \fi The \switch
longdesc command (which is also expandable) has the form: \switch
longdesc \case{<boolean expression>} ... \case{<boolean expression>} ...
longdesc ... \otherwise ... \endswitch
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/boolexpr
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics macro-supp
catalogue-version 3.14

name boondox
shortdesc Mathematical alphabets derived from the STIX fonts
longdesc The package contains a number of PostScript fonts derived from
longdesc the STIX OpenType fonts that may be used in maths mode in
longdesc regular and bold weights for calligraphic, fraktur and
longdesc double-struck alphabets. Virtual fonts with metrics suitable
longdesc for maths mode are provided, as are LaTeX support files.
catalogue-ctan /fonts/boondox
catalogue-license ofl lppl1.1
catalogue-topics font font-maths font-type1 tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.02d

name bootstrapicons
shortdesc Icons from the framework Bootstrap
longdesc The package provides over 2,000 icons from the frontend
longdesc framework Bootstrap. Note: this is NOT an official package from
longdesc Bootstrap.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/BenSt099/bootstrapicons/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/BenSt099/bootstrapicons
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/bootstrapicons
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics graphics-symb logo
catalogue-version 1.1

name bophook
shortdesc Provides an At-Begin-Page hook
longdesc Using the \AtBeginPage hook, you can add material in the
longdesc background of a page. \PageLayout can be used to give page
longdesc makeup commands to be executed on every page (e.g., depending
longdesc on the page style).
catalogue-also everyshi
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/bophook
catalogue-license lppl1.2
catalogue-topics defer-stuff
catalogue-version 0.02

name borceux
shortdesc Diagram macros by Francois Borceux
longdesc The macros support the construction of diagrams, such as those
longdesc that appear in category theory texts. The user gives the list
longdesc of vertices and arrows to be included, just as when composing a
longdesc matrix, and the program takes care of computing the dimensions
longdesc of the arrows and realizing the pagesetting. All the user has
longdesc to do about the arrows is to specify their type (monomorphism,
longdesc pair of adjoint arrows, etc.) and their direction (north,
longdesc south-east, etc.); 12 types and 32 directions are available.
catalogue-ctan /macros/generic/diagrams/borceux
catalogue-license other-free
catalogue-topics diagram-comm

name bosisio
shortdesc A collection of packages by Francesco Bosisio
longdesc A collection of packages containing: accenti dblfont; envmath;
longdesc evenpage; graphfig; mathcmd; quotes; and sobolev.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/bosisio
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics collection

name boustrophedon
shortdesc A LaTeX package for boustrophedon typography
longdesc This package typesets text in boustrophedon style, alternating
longdesc the writing direction on each line. Have you ever wondered why
longdesc most Western languages are written left-to-right, while many
longdesc Middle Eastern languages are written right-to-left? Both
longdesc conventions may seem arbitrary today - but this was not always
longdesc the case. In one of the earliest fully developed alphabets, the
longdesc Archaic Greek alphabet (from alpha and beta, hence alphabet),
longdesc writing was often performed boustrophedon, meaning as the ox
longdesc turns in ploughing. Text was written left-to-right on one line,
longdesc then right-to-left on the next, with both the direction of the
longdesc text and the letterforms themselves mirrored accordingly. This
longdesc method creates a continuous flow of reading, as the reader does
longdesc not need to jump back to the start of each new line, but
longdesc instead follows the text in a natural back-and-forth motion.
longdesc Reading takes some getting used to, but after a while it
longdesc becomes surprisingly natural.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/arishadj/latex-boustrophedon/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/arishadj/latex-boustrophedon
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/boustrophedon
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics bidi
catalogue-version 1.1.0

name boxedminipage
shortdesc Framed minipages of a specified total width (text and frame combined)
longdesc The package essentially just wraps a minipage within an \fbox.
longdesc However, while
longdesc \fbox{\begin{minipage}{\linewidth}...\end{minipage}} juts out
longdesc into the margin, \begin{boxedminipage}...\end{boxedminipage}
longdesc does not. Instead, it subtracts the frame's dimensions from the
longdesc specified dimensions of the minipage before typesetting the
longdesc minipage. Note: The package was formerly known as
longdesc boxedminipage2e and now replaces Mario Wolczko's earlier
longdesc boxedminipage package.
catalogue-alias boxedminipage2e
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/boxedminipage
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics boxing tagged-pdf-partially
catalogue-version 1.1

name boxhandler
shortdesc Flexible Captioning and Deferred Box/List Printing
longdesc The package allows the user to optimise presentation of LaTeX
longdesc tables and figures. Boxhandler will lay out table and figure
longdesc captions with a variety of stylistic appearances, and will also
longdesc allow figures and tables to be wrapped in a manner consistent
longdesc with many business and government documents. For a document
longdesc that might appear in different venues with different
longdesc formatting, boxhandler permits the creation of a LaTeX source
longdesc document that can, with a single-line change in the source
longdesc code, produce an output that has very different layout from the
longdesc baseline configuration, not only in terms of caption style, but
longdesc more importantly in terms of the locations where figures,
longdesc tables and lists appear (or not) in the document. Deferral
longdesc routines also allow one to keep all figure and table data in a
longdesc separate source file, while nonetheless producing a document
longdesc with figures and tables appearing in the desired location.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/boxhandler
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics caption defer-stuff float
catalogue-version 1.30

name bpchem
shortdesc Typeset chemical names, formulae, etc.
longdesc The package provides support for typesetting simple chemical
longdesc formulae, those long IUPAC compound names, and some chemical
longdesc idioms. It also supports the labelling of compounds and
longdesc reference to labelled compounds.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/bpchem
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics chemistry
catalogue-version 1.1

name bpolynomial
shortdesc Drawing polynomial functions of up to order 3
longdesc This MetaPost package helps plotting polynomial and root
longdesc functions up to order three. The package provides macros to
longdesc calculate Bezier curves exactly matching a given constant,
longdesc linear, quadratic or cubic polynomial, or square or cubic root
longdesc function. In addition, tangents on all functions and
longdesc derivatives of polynomials can be calculated.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/metapost/contrib/macros/bpolynomial
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics graphics-plotfn
catalogue-version 0.5

name br-lex
shortdesc A Class for Typesetting Brazilian legal texts
longdesc This class implements rules to typeset Brazilian legal texts.
longdesc Its purpose is to be an easy-to-use implementation for the
longdesc end-user.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/br-lex
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics class legal

name bracealign
shortdesc Align braces under and over math expressions
longdesc A LaTeX package to align braces under and over math
longdesc expressions. A new environment called bracealign is provided,
longdesc inside which braces and brackets drawn with the commands
longdesc \underbrace, \overbrace, \underbracket, \overbracket,
longdesc \underparen or \overparenare vertically aligned. The package
longdesc also allows adding support for new commands.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/julienlabbe/latex-packages/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/julienlabbe/latex-packages
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/bracealign
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics maths paren-mgmt tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.0

name bracketkey
shortdesc Produce bracketed identification keys
longdesc The package provides an environment bracketkey for use when
longdesc producing lists of species.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/bracketkey
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics biology
catalogue-version 1.0

name braids
shortdesc Draw braid diagrams with PGF/TikZ
longdesc The package enables drawing of braid diagrams with PGF/TikZ
longdesc using a simple syntax. The braid itself is specified by giving
longdesc a word in the braid group, and there are many options for
longdesc styling the strands and for drawing floors.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/loopspace/braids/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/loopspace/braids
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/braids
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics diagram graphics maths pgf-tikz tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 2.3

name braille
shortdesc Support for braille
longdesc This package allows the user to produce Braille documents on
longdesc paper for the blind without knowing Braille (which can take
longdesc years to learn). Python scripts grade1.py and grade2.py convert
longdesc ordinary text to grade 1 and 2 Braille tags; then, the LaTeX
longdesc package takes the tags and prints out corresponding Braille
longdesc symbols.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/braille
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics spec-alphabet

name braket
shortdesc Dirac bra-ket and set notations
longdesc Provides macros to typeset bra-ket notation, as well as set
longdesc specifiers, with a single (|) or a double (|| or (\|) vertical
longdesc bar specifier in between two bracketed parts. Each macro comes
longdesc in a fixed-size version and an expanding version. If the
longdesc package finds itself operating under e-tex, it uses the
longdesc extended primitive \middle for more reliable results
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/braket
catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics maths physics tagged-pdf

name brandeis-dissertation
shortdesc Class for Brandeis University dissertations
longdesc The class will enable the user to typeset a dissertation which
longdesc adheres to the formatting guidelines of Brandeis University
longdesc Graduate School of Arts and Sciences (GSAS).
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/brandeis-dissertation
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics dissertation
catalogue-version 3.14

name brandeis-problemset
shortdesc Document class for COSI Problem sets at Brandeis University (Waltham, MA)
longdesc Brandeis University's computer science (COSI) courses often
longdesc assign problem sets which require fairly rigorous formatting.
longdesc This document class, which extends article, provides a simple
longdesc way to typeset these problem sets in LaTeX. Although the class
longdesc is compatible with all LaTeX flavors, XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX are
longdesc recommended for fontspec support.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/9999years/brandeis-problemset/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/9999years/brandeis-problemset
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/brandeis-problemset
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics class exercise
catalogue-version 0.5.5

name brandeis-thesis
shortdesc A class for Brandeis University M.A. theses
longdesc brandeis-thesis.cls provides the structures and formatting
longdesc information for an M.A. thesis for the Brandeis University
longdesc Graduate School of Arts and Sciences.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/brandeis-thesis
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics class dissertation
catalogue-version 3.3

name brandstyler
shortdesc Automatic brand style implementation
longdesc brandstyler automatically adapts the style of a LaTeX document
longdesc to that of a specific organisation. It is also compatible with
longdesc beamer, able to change the style of many beamerthemes. It
longdesc currently supports the adaption of fonts and colours.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/JesseStraat/brandstyler
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/brandstyler
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics typesetting
catalogue-version 1.0

name breakcites
shortdesc Ensure that multiple citations may break at line end
longdesc Makes a very minor change to the operation of the \cite
longdesc command. Note that the change is not necessary in unmodified
longdesc LaTeX; however, there remain packages that restore the
longdesc undesirable behaviour of the command as provided in LaTeX 2.09.
longdesc (Note that neither cite nor natbib make this mistake.)
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/breakcites
catalogue-license other-free
catalogue-topics cite-supp tagged-pdf

name breakurl
shortdesc Line-breakable \url-like links in hyperref when compiling via dvips/ps2pdf
longdesc This package provides a command much like hyperref's \url that
longdesc typesets a URL using a typewriter-like font. However, if the
longdesc dvips driver is being used, the original \url doesn't allow
longdesc line breaks in the middle of the created link: the link comes
longdesc in one atomic piece. This package allows such line breaks in
longdesc the generated links.
catalogue-also hyperref
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/breakurl
catalogue-license lppl1.2
catalogue-topics hyper tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 1.40

name bredzenie
shortdesc A Polish version of lorem ipsum... in the form of a LaTeX package
longdesc This is a polish version of the classic pseudo-Latin lorem
longdesc ipsum dolor sit amet.... It provides access to several
longdesc paragraphs of pseudo-Polish generated with Hidden Markov Models
longdesc and Recurrent Neural Networks trained on a corpus of Polish.
catalogue-alias polishlipsum
catalogue-also lipsum
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/bredzenie
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics dummy-gen
catalogue-version 1.0

name breqn
shortdesc Automatic line breaking of displayed equations
longdesc The package provides solutions to a number of common
longdesc difficulties in writing displayed equations and getting
longdesc high-quality output. For example, it is a well-known
longdesc inconvenience that if an equation must be broken into more than
longdesc one line, left...right constructs cannot span lines. The breqn
longdesc package makes them work as one would expect whether or not
longdesc there is an intervening line break. The single most ambitious
longdesc goal of the package, however, is to support automatic
longdesc linebreaking of displayed equations. Such linebreaking cannot
longdesc be done without substantial changes under the hood in the way
longdesc formulae are processed; the code must be watched carefully,
longdesc keeping an eye on possible glitches. The bundle also contains
longdesc the flexisym and mathstyle packages, which are both designated
longdesc as support for breqn.
catalogue-contact-home https://wspr.io/breqn/
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/wspr/breqn
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/breqn
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics maths tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.98l

name bropd
shortdesc Simplified brackets and differentials in LaTeX
longdesc The package simplifies the process of writing differential
longdesc operators and brackets in LaTeX. The commands facilitate the
longdesc easy manipulation of equations involving brackets and allow
longdesc partial differentials to be expressed in an alternate form.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/bropd
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics maths
catalogue-version 1.2

name broydensolve
shortdesc Solve a system of equations with Broyden's good method
longdesc This package implements Broyden's good method to solve a system
longdesc of equations. It is also possible to use coordinates defined by
longdesc TikZ as known and unknown variables.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/broydensolve
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics graphics pgf-tikz tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 2.0

name brushscr
shortdesc A handwriting script font
longdesc The BrushScript font simulates hand-written characters; it is
longdesc distributed in Adobe Type 1 format (but is available in italic
longdesc shape only). The package includes the files needed by LaTeX in
longdesc order to use that font. The file AAA_readme.tex fully describes
longdesc the package and sample.tex illustrates its use.
catalogue-ctan /fonts/brushscr
catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics font font-calligraphic font-type1

name bubblesort
shortdesc Bubble sorts a list
longdesc This package sorts a list of TeX items {item 1}...{item k} in
longdesc increasing order where increasing is determined by a comparator
longdesc macro. By default it sorts real numbers with the usual meaning
longdesc of increasing but some other examples are discussed in the
longdesc documentation. A second macro is included which sorts one list
longdesc and applies the same permutation to a second list.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/bubblesort
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics list macro-sort
catalogue-version 1.0

name buctthesis
shortdesc Beijing University of Chemical Technology thesis template
longdesc This package provides a LaTeX class and template for Beijing
longdesc University of Chemical Technology, supporting bachelor, master,
longdesc and doctor theses.
catalogue-contact-announce https://github.com/the-ccsn/BUCTthesis/releases
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/the-ccsn/BUCTthesis/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/the-ccsn/BUCTthesis
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/the-ccsn/BUCTthesis/tree/master
catalogue-ctan /macros/xetex/latex/buctthesis
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics chinese class dissertation doc-templ xetex
catalogue-version 2.0

name bullcntr
shortdesc Display list item counter as regular pattern of bullets
longdesc The bullcntr package defines the command bullcntr, which may be
longdesc thought of as an analogue of the \fnsymbol command: like the
longdesc latter, it displays the value of a counter lying between 1 and
longdesc 9, but uses, for the purpose, a regular pattern of bullets.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/bullcntr
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics numbers
catalogue-version 0.04

name bundledoc
shortdesc Bundle together all the files needed to build a LaTeX document
longdesc The bundledoc package is a post-processor for the snapshot
longdesc package that bundles together all the classes, packages and
longdesc files needed to build a given LaTeX document. It reads the .dep
longdesc file that snapshot produces, finds each of the files mentioned
longdesc therein, and archives them into a single .tar.gz (or .zip, or
longdesc whatever) file, suitable for moving across systems,
longdesc transmitting to a colleague, etc. A script, arlatex, provides
longdesc an alternative archiving mechanism, creating a single LaTeX
longdesc file that contains all of the ancillary files of a LaTeX
longdesc document, together with the document itself, using the
longdesc filecontents* environment.
catalogue-ctan /support/bundledoc
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics archival bundle
catalogue-version 3.7

