name catechis
shortdesc Macros for typesetting catechisms
longdesc The macros include: format for question-and-answer; comments on
longdesc answers; lengthier explanations of answers; citations. The
longdesc formatting of all the macros is highly (and simply)
longdesc customizable.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/catechis
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics theology
catalogue-version 2.6

name catoptions
shortdesc Preserving and recalling standard catcodes
longdesc The package changes package loading internals so that all
longdesc subsequently loaded packages can rely on normal/standard
longdesc catcodes of all ASCII characters. The package defines canonical
longdesc control sequences to represent all the visible ASCII
longdesc characters. It also provides robust option parsing mechanisms
longdesc (XDeclareOption, XExecuteOptions and XProcessOptions, which
longdesc will be used by \documentclass if the package has already been
longdesc loaded). The package also provides a range of other TeX
longdesc programming tools.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/davidcarlisle/catoptions/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/davidcarlisle/catoptions
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/catoptions
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics keyval macro-supp
catalogue-version 0.2.7i

