catalogue-ctan /language/churchslavonic
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics churchslavonic multilingual-addon
catalogue-version 0.2.4

name chuushaku
shortdesc Flexible book notes in Japanese
longdesc This style file is designed for compiling book notes in
longdesc Japanese as part of the body text. (Chuushaku means booknotes
longdesc in Japanese.) The remember picture feature automatically
longdesc calculates coordinates, eliminating the need for manual
longdesc adjustment of note positions. The main packages used in
longdesc chuushaku.sty are TikZ, amsmath, framed, and calc.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/chuushaku
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics japanese notes
catalogue-version 1.0.1

name ciad-beamertheme
shortdesc A beamer theme for creating modern presentations
longdesc The CIAD Beamer Theme, class and packages constitute a
longdesc comprehensive LaTeX presentation theme designed according to
longdesc the guidelines and recommandations of the Connaissance et
longdesc Intelligence Artificielle Distribuees (CIAD UR 7533) research
longdesc laboratory at the Universite de Technologie Belfort Montbeliard
longdesc and Universite Bourgogne Europe in France. It provides a
longdesc professional, visually consistent presentation style with an
longdesc extensive set of high-level commands that emulate the ease of
longdesc use found in PowerPoint's Smart Objects and other graphical
longdesc layout tools. This Beamer Theme, class and packages could be
longdesc easily extended and adapted to reach the requirements and
longdesc recommandations of your own institution. ciad-beamertheme is
longdesc part of the larger project TeX-templates.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/gallandarakhneorg/tex-templates/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://www.arakhne.org/latex/tex-templates
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/gallandarakhneorg/tex-templates
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/beamer-contrib/themes/ciad-beamertheme
catalogue-license lgpl3
catalogue-topics class pgf-tikz presentation std-conform
catalogue-version 20260907

name cidarticle
shortdesc A class for submissions to the Commentarii informaticae didacticae (CID)
longdesc The cidarticle bundle is used for writing articles to be
longdesc published in the Commentarii informaticae didacticae (CID). The
longdesc LaTeX class file is based on the class used for the Lecture
longdesc Notes in Informatics (LNI) (https://github.com/gi-ev/LNI).
