name cistercian
shortdesc Display cistercian numerals
longdesc A TikZ-based package to display cistercian numerals. After
longdesc loading the package, the macro \cistercian{<number>} can be
longdesc used to display cistercian numerals. The numerals can be
longdesc customised via TikZ options.
