name cite
shortdesc Improved citation handling in LaTeX
longdesc The package supports compressed, sorted lists of numerical
longdesc citations, and also deals with various punctuation and other
longdesc issues of representation, including comprehensive management of
longdesc break points. The package is compatible with both hyperref and
longdesc backref. The package is (unsurprisingly) part of the cite
longdesc bundle of the author's citation-related packages.
catalogue-also natbib
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/cite
catalogue-license other-free
catalogue-topics cite-supp tagged-pdf-partially
catalogue-version 5.5

name citeall
shortdesc Cite all entries of a bbl created with BibLaTeX
longdesc This small package allows to cite all entries of a bbl-file
longdesc created with BibLaTeX (v1.9).
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/biblatex-contrib/citeall
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics biblatex tagged-pdf
