name context
shortdesc The ConTeXt macro package
longdesc A full featured, parameter driven macro package, which fully
longdesc supports advanced interactive documents. See the ConTeXt Wiki
longdesc for more information. This content on CTAN is packaged
longdesc independently of the ConTeXt project, so if you have a problem
longdesc with ConTeXt itself, it is best to report it to the official
longdesc ntg-context@ntg.nl mailing list. If you notice that ConTeXt is
longdesc mispackaged in TeX Live or CTAN, then please open a new issue
longdesc on GitHub, email the public ntg-context@ntg.nl or
longdesc tex-live@tug.org mailing lists, or email me privately at
longdesc tex@maxchernoff.ca. Pull requests are also gladly accepted.
catalogue-alias context-legacy context-nonfree luametatex
catalogue-contact-home https://www.pragma-ade.nl/
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/contextgarden/context
catalogue-contact-support https://mailman.ntg.nl/archives/list/ntg-context@ntg.nl/
catalogue-ctan /macros/context/base
catalogue-license other-free
catalogue-topics context format
catalogue-version 2026-09-10 10:02 A

