name csquotes
shortdesc Context sensitive quotation facilities
longdesc This package provides advanced facilities for inline and
longdesc display quotations. It is designed for a wide range of tasks
longdesc ranging from the most simple applications to the more complex
longdesc demands of formal quotations. The facilities include commands,
longdesc environments, and user-definable smart quotes which dynamically
longdesc adjust to their context. Quotation marks are switched
longdesc automatically if quotations are nested and they can be adjusted
longdesc to the current language if the babel package is available.
longdesc There are additional facilities designed to cope with the more
longdesc specific demands of academic writing, especially in the
longdesc humanities and the social sciences. All quote styles as well as
longdesc the optional active quotes are freely configurable. The package
longdesc is dependent on e-TeX, and requires the author's etoolbox
longdesc package.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/josephwright/csquotes/issues
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/csquotes
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics etex quote-marks tagged-pdf-partially
catalogue-version 5.2p

