catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics float tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.0a

name dbshow
shortdesc A package to store and display data with custom filters, orders, and styles
longdesc The package provides four core functions: data storage and
longdesc display data filtering data sorting data display All data is
longdesc saved once and then you can display these data with custom
longdesc filters, orders and styles. The package can be used, for
longdesc example, to record and display something you'd like to review,
longdesc maybe the question you always answered incorrectly or some
longdesc forgettable knowledge. But obviously, the package is much more
longdesc powerful and extensible for more interesting tasks depending on
longdesc the individual.
