name dfg-crc
shortdesc Create DFG Collaborative Research Centre proposals and CVs
longdesc The dfg-crc LuaLaTeX class supports preparation of
longdesc Collaborative Research Centre proposals and CV sections for the
longdesc German Research Foundation (Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft,
longdesc DFG). Structured metadata drives project and person references,
longdesc project heads, staff and funding tables, proposal-wide totals,
longdesc collaboration plots, Gantt charts, and reusable project
longdesc templates. The bundle is an independent, unofficial template
longdesc and is not published, endorsed, or maintained by the DFG.
catalogue-contact-repository https://gitlab.git.nrw/rpdm/projects-and-services/dfg-crc-template
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/latex/dfg-crc
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
