shortdesc armhf-linux files of diadia

name diadia.i386-freebsd
shortdesc i386-freebsd files of diadia

name diadia.i386-linux
shortdesc i386-linux files of diadia

name diadia.i386-netbsd
shortdesc i386-netbsd files of diadia

name diadia.universal-darwin
shortdesc universal-darwin files of diadia

