name ducksay
shortdesc Draw ASCII art of animals saying a specified message
longdesc The package draws ASCII art of animals saying a specified
longdesc message. The following macros are available: \ducksay
longdesc \duckthink \DefaultAnimal \AddAnimal \DucksayOptions Multi-line
longdesc messages are now fully supported. The package comes with two
longdesc versions, choosable with the version key.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/Skillmon/ltx_ducksay/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/Skillmon/ltx_ducksay
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/ducksay
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics amusements games graphics tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 2.8

name duckuments
shortdesc Create duckified dummy content
longdesc The package provides facilities to create duckified dummy
longdesc contents. It was inspired by the question Getting ducks in
longdesc example images on TeX Stack Exchange. The following macros are
longdesc available: \duckument[key=val] - print a short duckument
longdesc \blindduck[key=val] - print a paragraph
longdesc \ducklist(*){environment} - create a list of type environment
longdesc \ducklistlist(*){environment} - create nested lists
longdesc \duckitemize - ducklist{itemize} \duckenumerate -
longdesc ducklist{enumerate} \duckdescription - ducklist{description}
longdesc \duckumentsCreateExampleFile \duckumentsDrawRandomDucks The
longdesc package works with pdfTeX, LuaTeX, and XeTeX.
catalogue-also lipsum tikzducks
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/Skillmon/ltx_duckuments
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/duckuments
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics dummy-gen macro-supp tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 0.5

name duerer
shortdesc Computer Duerer fonts
longdesc These fonts are designed for titling use, and consist of
longdesc capital roman letters only. Together with the normal set of
longdesc base shapes, the family also offers an informal shape. The
longdesc distribution is as Metafont source. LaTeX support is available
longdesc in the duerer-latex bundle.
catalogue-also duerer-latex
catalogue-ctan /fonts/duerer
catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics font font-mf

