shortdesc LaTeX support for the Duerer fonts
longdesc LaTeX support for Hoenig's Computer Duerer fonts, using their
longdesc standard fontname names.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/duerer-latex
catalogue-license gpl
catalogue-topics font-supp tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.1

