name eigo
shortdesc Comprehensive tools for creating Go (Weiqi/Baduk) game diagrams in LaTeX
longdesc The eigo package provides comprehensive tools for creating Go
longdesc (Weiqi/Baduk) game diagrams in LaTeX documents. Developed with
longdesc AI assistance, it offers multiple stone colors with full RGB
longdesc customization, automatic numbering systems with alternating
longdesc colors, geometric transformations (rotations, mirrors),
longdesc flexible board display options with enhanced 2pt borders for
longdesc publication quality, symbol placement, and full LuaLaTeX
longdesc compatibility. The package supports seven stone colors, border
longdesc display, extended size presets with validation, and advanced
longdesc features for game analysis and problem presentation.
