name emojinames
shortdesc Semantic emoji macros for LuaLaTeX
longdesc This package provides semantic, self-documenting commands for
longdesc inserting color emoji into LuaLaTeX documents. Instead of
longdesc pasting raw Unicode emoji, authors write stable keys such as
longdesc \emoji{status-ok1}, \emoji{gis-select1} or \emoji{flag-de}.
longdesc Over 2400 keys - organized into categories such as status,
longdesc logging, GIS, development, UI, flags, and many semantic alias
longdesc families - are mapped onto the Twemoji Mozilla color font via
longdesc the HarfBuzz renderer. A complete PDF reference listing every
longdesc key is included. LuaLaTeX is required.
catalogue-contact-announce https://github.com/Nyphur84/emojinames-latex/releases
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/Nyphur84/emojinames-latex/issues
