name endfloat
shortdesc Move floats to the end, leaving markers where they belong
longdesc Place all floats on pages by themselves at the end of the
longdesc document, optionally leaving markers like [Figure 3 about here]
longdesc in the text near to where the figure (or table) would normally
longdesc have occurred. Float types figure and table are recognised by
