name eoldef
shortdesc Define commands which absorb the whole source line as arguments
longdesc This macro allows you to define commands that take the entire
longdesc source line as arguments. Usage: \eoldef <control sequence>
longdesc <parameter text> { <replacement text>} defines a control
longdesc sequence that is delimited by the end-of-line in addition to
longdesc the specified parameter text. For instance, \eoldef\test#1:#2{}
longdesc and \test abc:def will give #1 = abc, #2 = def. \eolgdef is the
longdesc \global variant to \eoldef. Like \verb|...|, \eoldef'd commands
longdesc may generally not be used as part of another command's argument
longdesc as it changes catcodes. However, if you must use it in
longdesc environments where catcodes are frozen, you may follow the
longdesc command with a braced argument, eg. \test{#1:#2} using the
longdesc previous example. This package may be used in plain TeX or
longdesc LaTeX by \input{eoldef}.
catalogue-also optex
catalogue-ctan /macros/generic/eoldef
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics etex macro-def
catalogue-version 1.1

name epcqrcode
shortdesc Generate valid EPC QR codes
longdesc This package is a wrapper for the qrcode package. It can be
longdesc used to generate valid EPC QR codes by providing syntax and
longdesc validity checks, e.g. verifying the correctness of the IBAN.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/epcqrcode/epcqrcode/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/epcqrcode/epcqrcode
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/epcqrcode
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics qrcode
catalogue-version 1.2

name epigrafica
shortdesc A Greek and Latin font
longdesc Epigrafica is forked from the development of the MgOpen font
longdesc Cosmetica, which is a similar design to Optima and includes
longdesc Greek. Development has been supported by the Laboratory of
longdesc Digital Typography and Mathematical Software, of the Department
longdesc of Mathematics of the University of the Aegean, Greece.
catalogue-contact-home https://myria.math.aegean.gr/labs/dt/
catalogue-ctan /fonts/greek/epigrafica
catalogue-license gpl
catalogue-topics font font-greek font-sans font-type1
