longdesc compiled under the ltxdoc class).
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/fcltxdoc
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics doc-supp
catalogue-version 1.0

name fcolumn
shortdesc Typesetting financial tables
longdesc In financial reports, text and currency amounts are regularly
longdesc put in one table, e.g., a year balance or a profit-and-loss
longdesc overview. This package provides the settings for automatically
longdesc typesetting such columns, including the sum line (preceded by a
longdesc rule of the correct width) using the specifier f.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/fcolumn
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics table tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.5

name fddiagram
shortdesc Automatic Functional Dependency diagrams from a plain-text list
longdesc This package typesets Functional Dependency (FD) diagrams, as
longdesc commonly used when teaching or checking relational database
longdesc normalisation, directly from a plain-text list of dependencies
longdesc in the form left-hand side - right-hand side. The attribute
longdesc universe, its ordering, and the layout of each dependency's
longdesc diagram are derived automatically: no manual coordinates or
longdesc column ordering are required. Options, settable either when the
longdesc package is loaded or per diagram, control spacing, colours,
longdesc arrow style, label alignment, and optional dotted or dashed
longdesc guide lines connecting each mark back to its attribute. The
longdesc package requires TikZ, xparse and l3keys2e, all part of any
longdesc current TeX distribution. O pacote fddiagram tipografa
longdesc diagramas de Dependencias Funcionais (DFs), comumente usados no
longdesc ensino e na verificacao de normalizacao de esquemas
longdesc relacionais, diretamente a partir de uma lista textual no
longdesc formato lado esquerdo - lado direito. O universo de atributos,
longdesc sua ordem e o layout de cada regua sao calculados
longdesc automaticamente, sem necessidade de coordenadas ou ordenacao
longdesc manual. Opcoes, configuraveis tanto no carregamento do pacote
longdesc quanto por diagrama, controlam espacamento, cores, estilo de
longdesc seta, alinhamento dos rotulos e linhas-guia tracejadas ou
longdesc pontilhadas ligando cada marca ao respectivo atributo. O pacote
longdesc depende de TikZ, xparse e l3keys2e, presentes em qualquer
longdesc distribuicao TeX atual.
catalogue-contact-announce https://github.com/Smarzaro/fddiagram/releases
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/Smarzaro/fddiagram/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/Smarzaro/fddiagram
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/fddiagram
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics diagram graphics pgf-tikz
catalogue-version 0.3

