catalogue-version 4.10.4

name fenetrecas
shortdesc Commands for CAS-like windows (Xcas or Geogebra) in TikZ
longdesc This package provides some commands (in French) to display,
longdesc with TikZ, windows like Xcas or Geogebra :
longdesc \begin{CalculFormelGeogebra} and \LigneCalculsGeogebra ;
longdesc \begin{CalculFormelXcas} and \LigneCalculsXcas.
