longdesc foreground of every (or the current) page at absolute
longdesc positions. In this way, you can check the page layout
longdesc dimensions. You can also draw various rulers in the text. The
longdesc fgruler package requires the services of the following
longdesc packages: kvoptions, etoolbox, xcolor, graphicx, eso-pic.
