name figbas
shortdesc Mini-fonts for figured-bass notation in music
longdesc This package consists of three mini-fonts (and associated
longdesc metrics) of conventional ligatures for the figured-bass
longdesc notations 2+, 4+, 5+, 6+ and 9+ in music manuscripts. The fonts
longdesc are usable with Computer Modern Roman and Sans, and
