name fontawesome5
shortdesc Font Awesome 5 with LaTeX support
longdesc This package provides LaTeX support for the included Font
longdesc Awesome 5 Free icon set. These icons were designed by Fort
longdesc Awesome and released under the SIL OFL 1.1 license. The
longdesc commercial Pro version is also supported, if it is installed
longdesc and XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX is used.
catalogue-also fontawesome
catalogue-ctan /fonts/fontawesome5
catalogue-license ofl lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics font font-otf font-supp-symbol font-symbol font-type1 tagged-pdf-partially
catalogue-version 5.15.4

name fontawesome6
shortdesc Font Awesome 6 with LaTeX support
longdesc This package provides LaTeX support for the included Font
longdesc Awesome 6 Free icon set. These icons were designed by Fort
longdesc Awesome and released under the SIL OFL 1.1 license. The
longdesc commercial Pro version is also supported, if it is installed
longdesc and XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX is used. For this font you need a paid
longdesc license, for more information visit Fort Awesome Pro. More
longdesc information about Font Awesome is available at Fort Awesome. To
longdesc use an icon after the package is loaded, just enter the name of
longdesc the icon in CamelCase prefixed with \fa, for example
longdesc \faAddressBook for the address-book icon. The TeX files are
longdesc derived from the Font Awesome 5 package, are maintained by
longdesc Daniel Nagel and are released under the LaTeX Project Public
longdesc License version 1.3c. All included fonts are provided by Fort
longdesc Awesome under the SIL OFL 1.1 license. This package is not an
longdesc official Fort Awesome project. For bug reports, please open an
longdesc issue at https://github.com/braniii/fontawesome.
catalogue-also fontawesome5 fontawesome
catalogue-contact-announce https://github.com/braniii/fontawesome/releases
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/braniii/fontawesome/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/braniii/fontawesome
catalogue-ctan /fonts/fontawesome6
catalogue-license ofl lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics font font-otf font-supp-symbol font-symbol font-type1 tagged-pdf-partially
catalogue-version 6.7.2-5

name fontawesome7
shortdesc Font Awesome 7 with LaTeX support
longdesc This package provides LaTeX support for the included Font
longdesc Awesome 7 Free icon set. These icons were designed by Fort
longdesc Awesome and released under the SIL OFL 1.1 license. The
longdesc commercial Pro version has only preliminary alpha support for
longdesc now, if it is installed and XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX is used. For
longdesc this font you need a paid license, for more information visit
longdesc Fort Awesome Pro. More information about Font Awesome is
longdesc available at Fort Awesome. To use an icon after the package is
longdesc loaded, just enter the name of the icon in CamelCase prefixed
longdesc with \fa, for example \faAddressBook for the address-book icon.
longdesc The TeX files are derived from the Font Awesome 5 package, are
longdesc maintained by Daniel Nagel and are released under the LaTeX
longdesc Project Public License version 1.3c. All included fonts are
longdesc provided by Fort Awesome under the SIL OFL 1.1 license. This
longdesc package is not an official Fort Awesome project. For bug
longdesc reports, please open an issue at
longdesc https://github.com/braniii/fontawesome.
catalogue-also fontawesome5 fontawesome
catalogue-contact-announce https://github.com/braniii/fontawesome/releases
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/braniii/fontawesome/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/braniii/fontawesome
catalogue-ctan /fonts/fontawesome7
