name fonts-arundina
shortdesc DejaVu-compatible Thai fonts
longdesc Arundina is a set of DejaVu-compatible Thai fonts from the
longdesc Software Industry Promotion Agency (Public Organization) of
longdesc Thailand (otherwise known as SIPA). Serif, sans-serif and
longdesc monospace type faces are included, with LaTeX support files.
