longdesc quality fonts supporting Mathematics.
catalogue-also fontsetup-nonfree
catalogue-ctan /macros/unicodetex/latex/fontsetup
catalogue-license gpl3
catalogue-topics font-sel font-supp luatex maths tagged-pdf xetex
catalogue-version 2.6.0

name fontsize
shortdesc A small package to set arbitrary sizes for the main font of the document
longdesc The package allows you to set arbitrary sizes for the main font
longdesc of the document, through the fontsize=<size> option.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/fontsize
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics font-supp-misc tagged-pdf
