name frege
shortdesc Typeset fregean Begriffsschrift
longdesc The package defines a number of new commands for typesetting
longdesc fregean Begriffsschrift in LaTeX. It is loosely based on the
longdesc package begriff, and offers a number of improvements including
longdesc better relative lengths of the content stroke with respect to
longdesc other strokes, content strokes that point at the middle of
longdesc lines rather than the bottom, a greater width for the assertion
longdesc stroke as compared to the content stroke, a more intuitive
longdesc structure for the conditional, greater care taken to allow for
longdesc the linewidth in the spacing of formulas.
catalogue-also bguq begriff grundgesetze
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/frege
catalogue-license gpl
catalogue-topics logic maths
catalogue-version 1.3

name frenchmath
