name fretplot
shortdesc Create scale and chord diagrams for guitar-like instruments
longdesc This LuaLaTeX package provides batch generation of scale and
longdesc chord diagrams for plucked string instruments, such as the
longdesc guitar. Flexible and Automated: Highly customizable and
longdesc automatable via simple, powerful file formats for describing
longdesc fretboard diagrams. Easily generate batches of diagrams.
longdesc Attractive Defaults: Comes with sensible, visually appealing
longdesc default settings. Music Theory Aware: Includes easy-to-use
longdesc LaTeX macros that understand music theory. Render guitar scale
longdesc diagrams by specifying the musical scale or scale type via
longdesc built-in macros or directly via degree, pitch class, or
longdesc interval formulae.
