name functional
shortdesc An intuitive functional programming interface for LaTeX2
longdesc This package provides an intuitive functional programming
longdesc interface for LaTeX2, which is an alternative choice to expl3
longdesc or LuaTeX, if you want to do programming in LaTeX. Although
longdesc there are functions in LaTeX3 programming layer (expl3), the
longdesc evaluation of them is from outside to inside. With this
longdesc package, the evaluation of functions is from inside to outside,
longdesc which is the same as other programming languages such as Lua.
longdesc In this way, it is rather easy to debug code too.
