name gbt7714
shortdesc A BibTeX implementation of China National Standard GB/T 7714
longdesc The package provides a comprehensive and configurable BibTeX
longdesc implementation of the Chinese National Standard GB/T 7714,
longdesc Information and documentation-rules for bibliographic
longdesc references and citations to information resources. The BibTeX
longdesc styles included in the package support both numeric and
longdesc author-year citation systems, and are fully compatible with the
longdesc natbib package for advanced citation commands and formatting.
longdesc These styles are designed to automatically detect the language
longdesc (Chinese or English) of each bibliographic entry and apply the
longdesc appropriate localization. Additionally, the package exposes a
longdesc range of configuration options, allowing users to easily adapt
longdesc the output to the requirements of specific academic journals or
longdesc institutions.
catalogue-contact-announce https://github.com/zepinglee/gbt7714-bibtex-style/releases
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/zepinglee/gbt7714-bibtex-style/issues
