name gbt9704
shortdesc A LaTeX class for the Chinese official GB/T 9704-2012 document format
longdesc This package provides a LaTeX document class for typesetting
longdesc documents according to the Chinese national standard GB/T
longdesc 9704-2012 (Format of official documents of party and government
longdesc organs). It supports red headers, hierarchical section titles,
longdesc attachments, signatures, copy-to lists, issuing information,
longdesc and other standard components required by the standard. The
longdesc class is built on the memoir document class and requires
longdesc XeLaTeX with the CTeX bundle.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/songwupei/gbt9704-latex
catalogue-ctan /macros/xetex/latex/gbt9704
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics chinese class letter std-conform
catalogue-version 0.1.4

name gcard
shortdesc Arrange text on a sheet to fold into a greeting card
longdesc The package provides a simple means of producing greeting
longdesc cards. It arranges four panels onto a single sheet so that when
longdesc the sheet is folded twice the four panels are arranged as front
longdesc cover, inside left and right pages, and back cover. It uses the
longdesc textpos package for placement on the sheet and the graphicx
longdesc package for the necessary rotation. The four panels are set in
longdesc minipages for formatting by the user.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/gcard
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics graphics-use letter

name gchords
shortdesc Typeset guitar chords
longdesc A LaTeX package for typesetting of guitar chord diagrams,
longdesc including options for chord names, finger numbers and
longdesc typesetting above lyrics. The bundle also includes a TCL script
longdesc (chordbox.tcl) that provides a graphical application which
longdesc creates LaTeX files that use gchords.sty.
