catalogue-ctan /language/japanese/gckanbun
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics chinese japanese
catalogue-version 2.6.0

name geist-font
shortdesc LaTeX support for the Geist and Geist Mono typefaces
longdesc The package provides LaTeX support for Geist and Geist Mono,
longdesc the sans-serif and monospaced typeface families designed by
longdesc Vercel and released under the SIL Open Font License. Both
longdesc families are covered in all nine weights, from Thin to Black,
longdesc each with a matching italic. The package works with pdfLaTeX,
longdesc XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX. Under XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX the OpenType
longdesc fonts are used directly through fontspec. Under pdfLaTeX the
longdesc package uses Type1 fonts and metrics generated from the
longdesc OpenType originals with autoinst, since pdfTeX cannot subset
longdesc CFF-flavoured OpenType. Both paths declare the same font series
longdesc names, so a document selects the same face whichever engine
longdesc builds it. Fonts are provided in the OT1, T1 and TS1 encodings.
catalogue-contact-announce https://github.com/anjos/geist-font-latex/releases
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/anjos/geist-font-latex/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/anjos/geist-font-latex
catalogue-ctan /fonts/geist-font
catalogue-license ofl lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics font font-mono font-otf font-sans font-supp font-t1enc font-type1 tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.0

name gelasio
shortdesc LaTeX support for the Gelasio family of fonts
longdesc This package provides (pdf)LaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX support
longdesc for the Gelasio family of fonts designed by Eben Sorkin to be
longdesc metric-compatible with Georgia in its Regular and Bold weights.
longdesc Medium and SemiBold weights have been added.
catalogue-contact-development https://github.com/SorkinType/Gelasio
catalogue-ctan /fonts/gelasio
catalogue-license ofl lppl
catalogue-topics font font-body font-otf font-proportional font-serif font-type1 tagged-pdf

name gelasiomath
shortdesc Math and small cap additions to Gelasio fonts
longdesc The package offers math support for the gelasio package, using
longdesc symbols from newtxmath, Roman math letters from Gelasio and
longdesc Greek math letters based on XCharter Greek. Also added small
longdesc caps based on XCharter small caps and other minor features to
longdesc Gelasio.
catalogue-ctan /fonts/gelasiomath
catalogue-license ofl lppl1.3
catalogue-topics font font-maths tagged-pdf-partially
catalogue-version 1.01

name gender
shortdesc Macros for gender-neutral text in inflected languages
longdesc Many languages - like German or French - use masculine and
longdesc feminine grammatical genders. There are many ideas how to
longdesc promote gender neutrality in those languages. The gender
longdesc package uses alternately masculine and feminine forms. It is
longdesc also possible to use just one form out of a template.
catalogue-also he-she eemeir
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/gender
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics linguistic typesetting
catalogue-version 1.0

name gene-logic
shortdesc Typeset logic formulae, etc.
longdesc The package provides a facility to typeset certain logic
longdesc formulae. It provides an environment like eqnarray, a
longdesc newtheorem-like environment (NewTheorem), and several macros.
