shortdesc Support Gentium fonts for LuaLaTeX and XeLaTeX
longdesc This package supports the free TrueType Gentium fonts from the
longdesc gentium-sil package and defines missing typefaces. All font
longdesc features are available via special macros. The package works
longdesc only for LuaLaTeX/XeLaTeX.
