name gentium-sil
shortdesc A complete Greek font with Latin and Cyrillic, too
longdesc This is a redistribution of the original Gentium and
longdesc GentiumBook release from SIL, not altered in any way. Gentium
longdesc is a typeface family designed to enable the diverse ethnic
longdesc groups around the world who use the Latin, Cyrillic and Greek
longdesc scripts to produce readable, high-quality publications. The
longdesc Gentium family includes a complete Greek font, supporting both
longdesc monotonic and polytonic forms. While some Greek characters do
longdesc closely resemble Latin ones, it is a separate design that
longdesc embraces the robust, distinctive character of the Greek script,
longdesc but does so within the design context of the whole typeface. As
longdesc a result, the two scripts can be successfully mixed in a
longdesc paragraph or page of text.
catalogue-alias gentium
catalogue-also gentium-otf
catalogue-contact-bugs https://lists.tug.org/gentium
