catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/charlesbaynham/globalvals
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/globalvals
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics misc-support
catalogue-version 1.1

name glosmathtools
shortdesc Mathematical nomenclature tools based on the glossaries package
longdesc This package can be used to generate a mathematical
longdesc nomenclature (also called list of symbols or notation). It is
longdesc based on the glossaries package. Its main features are: symbol
longdesc categories (e.g.: latin, greek) automatic but customizable
longdesc symbol sorting easy subscript management easy accentuation
longdesc management abbreviation support (with first use definition)
longdesc bilingual nomenclatures (for bilingual documents) bilingual
longdesc abbreviations The documentation is based on the ulthese class.
longdesc The package itself depends on glossaries, amsmath, amsfonts,
longdesc and etoolbox.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/franckgaga/glosmathtools
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/glosmathtools
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics etex glossary maths
catalogue-version 1.0.0

