name greek-inputenc
shortdesc Greek encoding support for inputenc
longdesc Input encoding definition files for UTF-8, Macintosh Greek, and
longdesc ISO 8859-7 enabling the use of literal characters for Greek
longdesc letters and symbols with 8-bit TeX engines (pdfLaTeX).
catalogue-contact-bugs https://codeberg.org/milde/greek-tex/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://codeberg.org/milde/greek-tex
catalogue-ctan /language/greek/greek-inputenc
catalogue-license lppl1.3
