name greenpoint
shortdesc The Green Point logo
longdesc A Metafont-implementation of the logo commonly known as Der
longdesc Grune Punkt (The Green Point). In Austria, it can be found on
longdesc nearly every bottle. It should not be confused with the
longdesc Recycle-logo, implemented by Ian Green.
catalogue-ctan /fonts/greenpoint
catalogue-license gpl
catalogue-topics font font-mf font-specialist

name gregoriotex
shortdesc Engraving Gregorian Chant scores
longdesc Gregorio is a software application for engraving Gregorian
longdesc Chant scores on a computer. Gregorio's main job is to convert a
longdesc gabc file (simple text representation of a score) into a
longdesc GregorioTeX file, which makes TeX able to create a PDF of your
longdesc score.
catalogue-contact-home https://gregorio-project.github.io/
catalogue-contact-support https://gregorio-project.github.io/contact.html
catalogue-ctan /support/gregoriotex
catalogue-license gpl3
catalogue-topics chords music
