longdesc This package is for students creating school submissions using
longdesc LaTeX. It is especially suitable for math, physics, statistics
longdesc and the like. It can easily be used for creating exercises,
longdesc too.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/Strauman/Handin-LaTeX-template/issues
