catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/gdiepen/latexbeamer-handoutWithNotes
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/handoutwithnotes
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics presentation
catalogue-version 1.3

name hands
shortdesc Pointing hand font
longdesc Provides right- and left-pointing hands in both black-on-white
longdesc and white-on-black realisation. The font is distributed as
longdesc Metafont source.
catalogue-ctan /fonts/hands
catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics font font-mf font-symbol

name handstroke
shortdesc Eye-catching hand-drawn underline
longdesc This LaTeX package provides the \handstroke command, which
longdesc underlines a word or a phrase with a line that looks as if it
longdesc were drawn by hand. A straight, ruler-perfect rule blends into
longdesc the text and is easy to overlook, whereas an uneven, hand-drawn
longdesc handstroke stands apart from the page and catches the reader's
longdesc eye. The line can optionally be tinted in any color.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/yegor256/handstroke
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/handstroke
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics pgf-tikz underline
catalogue-version 0.4.0

name hang
shortdesc Environments for hanging paragraphs and list items
longdesc This package provides environments for hanging paragraphs and
longdesc list items. In addition, it defines environments for labeled
longdesc paragraphs and list items.
catalogue-also hanging
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/hang
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics layout list
catalogue-version 2.1

name hanging
shortdesc Paragraphs with a hanging indent
longdesc The hanging package facilitates the typesetting of hanging
longdesc paragraphs. The package also enables typesetting with hanging
longdesc punctuation, by making punctuation characters active. This
longdesc facility is best suppressed (it can interfere with other
longdesc packages) - there are package options for suppressing each
longdesc individual punctuation character. Real attempts at hanging
longdesc punctuation should nowadays use the microtype package, which
longdesc takes advantage of the support offered in recent versions of
longdesc pdfTeX.
catalogue-also hang
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/LaTeX-Package-Repositories/herries-press
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/hanging
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics layout tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.2b

name hangulmath
shortdesc Hangul jamo as mathematical symbols
longdesc Mathematical notation draws almost entirely on Latin and Greek
longdesc letters. This package adds the 40 letters (jamo) of modern
longdesc Korean Hangul as math symbols: 14 basic consonants, 5 double
longdesc consonants, 10 basic vowels and 11 compound vowels. Each symbol
longdesc has an official name following the Revised Romanization of
longdesc Korean (\giyeok, \nieun, ...), and consonants have a
longdesc four-letter alias that is easy to remember (\giug, \niun,
longdesc \diud, \liul, ...). Vowels are written as pronounced with a
longdesc trailing h (\ah, \eoh, \uah). \hangulsum, \hangulint and
longdesc \hangullima turn any symbol into a sum-, integral- or
longdesc limit-like operator. The package requires XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX.
longdesc The symbol glyphs come from a bundled subset of Noto Sans CJK
longdesc KR (SIL OFL), so no Korean font needs to be installed.
catalogue-ctan /fonts/hangulmath
catalogue-license ofl lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics font font-cjk font-maths font-otf font-supp maths
catalogue-version 0.7

name hanoi
shortdesc Tower of Hanoi in TeX
longdesc The Plain TeX program (typed in the shape of the towers of
longdesc Hanoi) serves both as a game and as a TeX programming exercise.
longdesc As a game it will solve the towers with (up to) 15 discs (with
longdesc 15 discs, 32767 moves are needed).
catalogue-ctan /macros/plain/contrib/hanoi
catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics games
catalogue-version 20120101

name hanzibox
shortdesc Boxed Chinese characters with Pinyin above and translation below
longdesc This is a LaTeX package written to simplify the input of
longdesc Chinese with Hanyu Pinyin and translation. Hanyu Pinyin is
longdesc placed above Chinese with the xpinyin package, and the
longdesc translation is placed below. The package can be used as a
longdesc utility for learning to write and pronounce Chinese characters,
longdesc for Chinese character learning plans, presentations, exercise
longdesc booklets and other documentation work.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://gitee.com/nwafu_nan/hanzibox-l3/issues
