name hawkdraw
shortdesc Draw vector graphics using l3draw with a simple syntax
longdesc This LaTeX package allows the user to use a simple syntax
longdesc similar to TikZ to generate vector graphic output based on
longdesc l3draw and related LaTeX3 modules such as l3fp which provides
longdesc very precise calculations. The syntax is meant to be simple and
longdesc flexible but also coherent and logical with the aim of allowing
longdesc the user to quickly draw graphics. The package name relates to
longdesc the quickness and agility of hawks and the preciseness of their
longdesc eyesight. The package intends to define a set of user-level
longdesc commands that can be used for drawing simple graphics. It does
longdesc not aim be a substitute for the TikZ package or to offer a
longdesc similar scope of application.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/jasperhabicht/hawkdraw/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/jasperhabicht/hawkdraw
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/hawkdraw
