name homework
shortdesc A LaTeX class for writing your homework
longdesc The current document class is for writing homework. It has the
longdesc following features. Simple and clear interface. Built-in
longdesc support for many theorem-type environments, already configured
longdesc and ready to use. Multilingual support. Page numbers are of the
longdesc form Page [current] of [total], which can help you ensure that
longdesc there are no missing pages when you print your homework for
longdesc submission. Support writing problem statements and solutions
longdesc (or proofs) in different colors. Every statement and solution
longdesc has its own QED symbol, in hollow or solid shape, respectively.
longdesc You can mark the unfinished parts, and a report shall be
longdesc generated at the end of your document for reminding.
