name impe-framework
shortdesc A XeLaTeX framework for building documents from reusable components
longdesc IMPE is a modular XeLaTeX framework designed to keep document
longdesc setup simple even when the underlying typesetting is not.
longdesc Layouts, fonts, and optional features can be selected through a
longdesc small set of common interfaces, so ordinary documents do not
longdesc need to expose the framework's internal structure. It provides
longdesc ready-to-use classes for several document types while keeping
longdesc layouts, font configurations, and features reusable and
longdesc extensible. More specialized facilities, including multilingual
longdesc and script-specific typesetting, can be added when needed
longdesc without making the basic workflow more complicated.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/KelvinYangBK67/IMPE-LaTeX-System/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/KelvinYangBK67/IMPE-LaTeX-System
