name innerscript
shortdesc Small modifications to math formatting
longdesc This package optionally modifies four aspects of TeX's
longdesc automatic math formatting to improve typesetting: (1) it adds
longdesc extra space around relation and operation symbols in
longdesc superscripts and subscripts; (2) it removes extra space around
longdesc \left-\right delimiter pairs; (3) it adds extra space after
longdesc right delimiters in certain situations; and (4) it forces \left
longdesc and \right delimiters to completely cover their contents. Using
longdesc LuaLaTeX is required.
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/latex/innerscript
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics luatex maths tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.4a

name inputenx
shortdesc Enhanced input encoding handling
longdesc This package deals with input encodings. It provides a wider
longdesc range of input encodings using standard mappings, than does
longdesc inputenc; it also covers nearly all slots. In this way, it
longdesc serves as more uptodate replacement for package inputenc.
