longdesc This package will introduce the operations related to
longdesc installing TeX Live (introducing MacTeX in macOS), upgrading
longdesc packages, and compiling simple documents on Windows 11, Ubuntu
longdesc 24.04, and macOS systems, and mainly introducing command line
longdesc operations.
catalogue-contact-development https://github.com/OsbertWang
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/OsbertWang/install-latex-guide-zh-cn
catalogue-contact-support https://github.com/OsbertWang/install-latex-guide-zh-cn/issues
