name iptconf
shortdesc Class for IPT conference proceedings at Igor Sikorsky Kyiv Polytechnic Institute
longdesc his class provides a two-column, A4 document layout for papers
longdesc submitted to the annual conference of the Institute of Physics
longdesc and Technology (IPT / NN FTI) at Igor Sikorsky Kyiv Polytechnic
longdesc Institute.
