name jiffy
shortdesc A TikZ-based page-layout diagnostic tool for LaTeX
longdesc jiffy produces a graphical diagnostic of a LaTeX document's
longdesc page geometry. It displays the physical sheet, text block,
longdesc header, footer baseline, margin-note column, TeX's one-inch
longdesc reference lines, and the principal horizontal and vertical
longdesc layout dimensions. The package supports a miniature renderer
longdesc and a true 1:1 full-page overlay. In two-sided mode, jiffy
longdesc generates companion verso and recto diagrams followed by a
longdesc consolidated data sheet containing measured values, off-page
longdesc diagnostics, and document/typography information. Display
longdesc strings are provided for English, Vietnamese, Spanish, German,
longdesc French, and Dutch.
catalogue-also layout
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/squidmore/jiffy/issues
