name jourcl
shortdesc Cover letter for journal submissions
longdesc Paper submissions to journals are usually accompanied by a
longdesc cover letter. This package provides a LaTeX class and a
longdesc template for such a cover letter with the following main
longdesc features: Minimalistic design. Custom image. Pre-defined
longdesc commands for journal name, author, date, etc. Many macros
longdesc contained in this package speed up the process of preparing the
longdesc necessary ingredients for the cover letter. Macros for
longdesc recommending up to three reviewers and/or editors. ORCID logo
longdesc and link to the submitting author's ORCID page. Controls for
longdesc adding a Conflict of interest statement and declaration. Custom
longdesc greeting (e.g., Dear Editor for a regular submission, Dear
longdesc Editor-in-Chief for a submission to a journal's special issue,
longdesc etc.) Predefined valedictions for different types of
longdesc submissions (e.g., Yours sincerely, Yours faithfully, Best
longdesc regards, etc.)
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/firefly-cpp/cover-letter-latex
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/jourcl
catalogue-license cc-by-sa-4
catalogue-topics class doc-templ letter

name jourrr
shortdesc A LaTeX template for journal rebuttal letters
longdesc This package provides an elegant LaTeX template designed for
longdesc crafting professional rebuttal letters in response to editors
longdesc or reviewers. It consists of a LaTeX class and a template,
longdesc fine-tuned to support your publishing journey with several
longdesc pre-defined commands that drastically speed up the process of
longdesc preparing letters during the revision process. The repository
longdesc hosts a template for writing responses to editors/reviewers
longdesc comments for journal submissions written in LaTeX that is
longdesc minimalistic in one way while pre-defined with several commands
longdesc that drastically speed up the process of preparing letters
longdesc during the revision process. Main Features of this template:
longdesc With front page included Response ticks to mark as completed
longdesc Custom response color Minimalistic design Everything is
longdesc customizable Predefined commands for a journal name, submission
longdesc ID, author, editor, associate editor, date, etc. Many macros
longdesc included Predefined different valedictions for different types
longdesc of submissions (e.g., Yours sincerely, Yours faithfully, Best
longdesc regards, etc.) Custom greeting (e.g., Dear Editor or bDear
longdesc Editor-in-Chief" for regular submission, etc.) (Optional) Table
longdesc of contents, jump to the reply you wish to address Option to
longdesc add custom Signature (i.e. an image of your hand-written
longdesc signature)
catalogue-contact-announce https://github.com/firefly-cpp/latex-response-reviewers
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/firefly-cpp/latex-response-reviewers/issues
catalogue-contact-development https://github.com/firefly-cpp/latex-response-reviewers
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/firefly-cpp/latex-response-reviewers
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/firefly-cpp/latex-response-reviewers
catalogue-contact-support https://github.com/firefly-cpp/latex-response-reviewers/issues
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/jourrr
catalogue-license cc-by-sa-4
catalogue-topics class doc-templ letter

