longdesc JuliaMono is a monospaced font for scientific and technical
longdesc computing. There are font files for Regular, Italic, Bold and
longdesc BoldItalic in light, medium, black and extra bold version.
longdesc There are more than 12 thousand glyphs in every font file.
catalogue-ctan /fonts/juliamono
catalogue-license lppl1.3 ofl
catalogue-topics font-mono font-supp font-ttf tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 0.06c

name jumplines
shortdesc Articles with teasers and continuation later on
longdesc Jumplines is a package for typesetting (newspaper) articles
longdesc that show a teaser (some few lines of text/content) and are
longdesc continued at a later place, with optional hyperlinking and a
longdesc list of articles. It requires lualatex for colour support in
longdesc split boxes.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/jumplines
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics journalpub luatex
