name kanaparser
shortdesc Kana parser for LuaTeX
longdesc The package provides a kana parser for LuaTeX. It is a set of 4
longdesc macros that handle transliteration of text: from hiragana and
longdesc katakana to Latin from Latin and katakana to hiragana from
longdesc Latin and hiragana to katakana It can be used to write kana
longdesc directly using only the ASCII character set or for education
longdesc purposes. The package has support for obsolete and rarely used
longdesc syllables, some only accessible via the provided toggle macro.
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/generic/kanaparser
catalogue-license bsd
catalogue-topics japanese luatex parser
catalogue-version 1.0

name kanbun
shortdesc Typeset kanbun-kundoku with support for kanbun annotation
longdesc This package allows users to manually input macros for elements
longdesc in a kanbun-kundoku (Han Wen Xun Du ) paragraph. More
longdesc importantly, it accepts plain text input in the kanbun
longdesc annotation form when used with LuaLaTeX, which allows
longdesc typesetting kanbun-kundoku paragraphs efficiently.
