name karnaugh
shortdesc Typeset Karnaugh-Veitch-maps
longdesc The package provides macros for typesetting Karnaugh-Maps and
longdesc Veitch-Charts in a simple and user-friendly way. Karnaugh-Maps
longdesc and Veitch-Charts are used to display and simplify logic
longdesc functions manually. These macros can typeset Karnaugh-Maps and
longdesc Veitch-Charts with up to ten variables (=1024 entries).
catalogue-also askmaps karnaughmap karnaugh-map
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/karnaugh
