name keisennote
shortdesc TikZ-based Japanese-style notebook ruled lines for LaTeX
longdesc Typeset Japanese-style ruled notebook lines in LaTeX. It
longdesc supports full-page (\notefill) and short (\note) blocks.
longdesc Spacing, dot size, and color are adjustable. The package is
longdesc compatible with multicols.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/KKTeX/keisennote
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/keisennote
catalogue-license mit
