catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/labels4easylist
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics list
catalogue-version 1.0

name labelschanged
shortdesc Identify labels which cause endless may have changed warnings
longdesc Several conditions can cause LaTeX labels to keep changing, no
longdesc matter how many times a document is recompiled. This package
longdesc helps diagnose the cause of repeated Label(s) may have changed
longdesc warnings. The names and before/after definitions of changing
longdesc labels are printed at the end of each compile. Multiply-defined
longdesc labels are printed as well.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/bdtc/labelschanged
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/labelschanged
catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics label-ref misc-support tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.01

name labyrinth
shortdesc Draw labyrinths and solution paths
longdesc The labyrinth package provides code and an environment for
longdesc typesetting simple labyrinths with LaTeX, and generating an
longdesc automatic or manual solution path.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/labyrinth
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics games
catalogue-version 1.0

