shortdesc Legacy stub to allow loading PiCTeX as m-pictex
longdesc m-pictex.sty was a wrapper for a ConTeXt module making PiCTeX
longdesc more easily usable in classic TeX with no e-TeX extensions.
longdesc m-pictex.sty is here adjusted to be a stub loading pictex.sty.
longdesc This has not been needed in LaTeX or ConTeXt for decades, but
longdesc old documents may be using this name.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/LaTeX-Package-Repositories/latex-context-ppchtex/
catalogue-contact-support https://github.com/LaTeX-Package-Repositories/latex-context-ppchtex/issues
catalogue-ctan /obsolete/macros/latex/contrib/latex-context-ppchtex
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics graphics-in-tex graphics-supp obsolete

name latex-course
