name latex-doc-ptr
shortdesc A direction-finder for LaTeX resources available online
longdesc A brief set of recommendations for users who need online
longdesc documentation of LaTeX. The document supports the need for
longdesc documentation of LaTeX itself, in distributions. For example,
longdesc it could be used in the command texdoc latex, in the TeX Live
longdesc distribution.
catalogue-contact-repository https://gitlab.com/jim.hefferon/latex-doc-ptr
catalogue-ctan /info/latex-doc-ptr
catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics tut-latex

