shortdesc Chinese Introduction to TeX and LaTeX
longdesc The document is an introduction to TeX/LaTeX, in Chinese. It
longdesc covers basic text typesetting, mathematics, graphics, tables,
longdesc Chinese language & fonts, and some miscellaneous features
longdesc (hyperlinks, long documents, bibliographies, indexes and page
longdesc layout).
catalogue-ctan /info/latex-notes-zh-cn
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics chinese-doc
catalogue-version 1.20

name latex-papersize
shortdesc Calculate LaTeX settings for any font and paper size
longdesc The package's typical use is when preparing printed material
longdesc for users with low vision. The most effective way of doing this
longdesc is to print on (notional) small paper, and then to magnify the
longdesc result. This package calculates and applies the settings for
longdesc various font and paper sizes. Both a modern .sty file and a
longdesc legacy Python script is included.
