name latex2man
shortdesc Translate LaTeX-based manual pages into Unix man format
longdesc Latex2man is a tool to translate UNIX manual pages written with
longdesc LaTeX into the troff format understood by the UNIX man(1)
longdesc command. Alternatively HTML, Texinfo, or LaTeX code can be
longdesc produced too. Output of parts of the text may be suppressed
longdesc using the conditional text feature (for this, LaTeX generation
longdesc may be used). There is a LaTeX package (latex2man.sty) for
longdesc writing the man page and a Perl script (latex2man) that does
longdesc the actual translation.
catalogue-contact-home https://www.informatik-vollmer.de/software/latex2man.php
