longdesc This bundle, consisting of a simple wrapper class and some
longdesc packages, forms a small LaTeX/BibTeX documentation kit; the
longdesc author uses it for some of his own packages. The package is not
longdesc supported: users should not attempt its use unless they are
longdesc capable of dealing with problems unaided. (The actual purpose
longdesc of releasing the package is to make it possible for third
longdesc parties to compile the documentation of other packages, should
longdesc that be necessary.)
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/ltxdockit
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics doc-supp
catalogue-version 1.2d

