name luabreakurl
shortdesc Breakable URLs with configurable continuation marks for LuaLaTeX
longdesc luabreakurl is a LuaLaTeX package that allows URLs to break at
longdesc almost any character while preserving clickable hyperlinks.
longdesc Optional continuation marks are shown only when a line break
longdesc actually occurs.
