catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics ext-code graphics-plotfn luatex pgf-tikz physics
catalogue-version 1.1.1

name luadraw
shortdesc Lua-based mathematical graphs for LuaLaTeX
longdesc This package provides a LuaLaTeX environment for creating
longdesc mathematical graphs in two and three dimensions using Lua code.
longdesc The resulting graphics are drawn with TikZ and can be saved
longdesc automatically. The package combines the computational
longdesc capabilities of Lua with the graphical flexibility of TikZ,
longdesc making it suitable for programmatically generated diagrams,
longdesc function plots, and other mathematical illustrations.
