name luahyperbolic
shortdesc Hyperbolic geometry in the Poincare disk model
longdesc This package allows to draw pictures and do computations in
longdesc plane hyperbolic geometry, in the Poincare disk model.
longdesc Computations are done with Lua, and graphics are generated with
longdesc TikZ. The package is written in Lua and requires LuaLaTeX.
longdesc Features: Draw geodesic lines, segments, polygons, rays,
longdesc circles, horocycles, hypercycles. Label and mark segments,
longdesc angles Compute intersections of geodesics, circles, symmetries,
longdesc reflections, exponential maps, automorphisms Draw hyperbolic
longdesc triangle tilings with a simple LaTeX macro Example tiling :
longdesc https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dmegy/luahyperbolic/refs/head
longdesc s/main/triangle-tiling-2-4-5.png
