name luainputenc
shortdesc Replacing inputenc for use in LuaTeX
longdesc LuaTeX operates by default in UTF-8 input; thus LaTeX documents
longdesc that need 8-bit character-sets need special treatment. (In
longdesc fact, LaTeX documents using UTF-8 with traditional - 256-glyph
longdesc - fonts also need support from this package.) The package,
longdesc therefore, replaces the LaTeX standard inputenc for use under
longdesc LuaTeX. With a current LuaTeX, the package has the same
longdesc behaviour with LuaTeX as inputenc has under pdfTeX.
