name luatexbase
shortdesc Basic resource management for LuaTeX code
longdesc The LaTeX kernel (LaTeX2e 2015/10/01 onward) builds in support
longdesc for LuaTeX functionality, also available as ltluatex.tex for
longdesc users of plain TeX and those with older LaTeX kernel
longdesc implementations. This support is based on ideas taken from the
longdesc original luatexbase package, but there are interface
longdesc differences. This stub package provides a compatibility layer
longdesc to allow existing packages to upgrade smoothly to the new
longdesc support structure.
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/generic/luatexbase
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics luatex tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.3

name luatexja
shortdesc Typeset Japanese with Lua(La)TeX
longdesc The package offers support for typesetting Japanese documents
longdesc with LuaTeX. Either of the Plain and LaTeX2e formats may be
longdesc used with the package.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/luatexja/luatexja/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/luatexja/luatexja/wiki/Home(en)
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/luatexja/luatexja
