name luatruthtable
shortdesc Generate truth tables of boolean values in LuaLaTeX
longdesc This package provides an easy way for generating truth tables
longdesc of boolean values in LuaLaTeX. The time required for operations
longdesc is no issue while compiling with LuaLaTeX. The package supports
longdesc nesting of commands for multiple operations. It can be modified
longdesc or extended by writing custom Lua programs. There is no need to
longdesc install Lua on users system as TeX distributions (TeX Live or
longdesc MiKTeX) come bundled with LuaLaTeX.
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/latex/luatruthtable
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics logic luatex maths
catalogue-version 1.3

name luavlna
shortdesc Prevent line breaks after single letter words, units, or academic titles
longdesc In some languages, like Czech or Polish, there should be no
longdesc single letter words at the end of a line, according to
longdesc typographical norms. This package handles such situations using
longdesc LuaTeX's callback mechanism. In doing this, the package can
longdesc detect languages used in the text and insert spaces only in
longdesc parts of the document where languages requiring this feature
longdesc are used. Another feature of this package is the inclusion of
longdesc non-breakable space after initials (like in personal names),
longdesc after or before academic degrees, and between numbers and
longdesc units. The package supports both plain LuaTeX and LuaLaTeX.
longdesc BTW: vlna is the Czech word for wave or curl and also denotes
longdesc the tilde which, in TeX, is used for unbreakable spaces.
catalogue-also encxvlna xevlna
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/michal-h21/luavlna/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/michal-h21/luavlna
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/generic/luavlna
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics czech luatex polish slovak tagged-pdf typesetting
catalogue-version 0.1n

name luaxml
shortdesc Lua library for reading and serialising XML files
longdesc LuaXML is a pure Lua library for reading and serializing XML
longdesc files. The current release is aimed mainly at support for the
longdesc odsfile package. The documentation was created by automatic
longdesc conversion of original documentation in the source code.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/michal-h21/LuaXML
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/generic/luaxml
catalogue-license other-free
catalogue-topics foreign-import luatex tagged-pdf use-lua
catalogue-version 0.2c

name lucidcv
shortdesc ATS-safe customizable LuaLaTeX template for modern resumes/CVs
longdesc Lucid CV (lucidcv) is a modern LuaLaTeX class for single- and
longdesc two-column resumes (CVs) whose PDF output stays
longdesc machine-readable. It is based on the PlushCV design and
longdesc rewritten. Word spaces are real space characters and icons
longdesc extract as nothing, so Applicant Tracking Systems (ATSs) and
longdesc PDF text extractors read the text back in order. The output is
longdesc tagged PDF/A-2b. Colors, fonts, sizes and spacing can be
longdesc customized, and the bundled test suite (available on GitHub)
longdesc checks extraction with several PDF engines and layout variants.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/xGoldy/lucidcv/issues
catalogue-contact-development https://github.com/xGoldy/lucidcv/pulls
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/xGoldy/lucidcv
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/latex/lucidcv
catalogue-license lppl1.3c ofl mit
catalogue-topics doc-templ use-luatex
catalogue-version 1.0.0

name lucide-admonitions
shortdesc Provides environments for rendering admonition boxes in multiple languages
longdesc A LaTeX package for rendering admonition boxes with Lucide
longdesc icons. It provides predefined box types inspired by MkDocs and
longdesc Zensical, with customizable icons, colors, and titles. The
longdesc package supports standard LaTeX and KOMA-Script classes, and
longdesc offers optional box titles and page-breaking support via
longdesc tcolorbox. Titles can be automatically translated into multiple
longdesc languages using the translations package.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/priiduonu/lucide-admonitions/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/priiduonu/lucide-admonitions
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/lucide-admonitions
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics boxing
catalogue-version 0.1

