name luciole
shortdesc Accessibility-focused OpenType font for LuaTeX and XeTeX
longdesc This package provides four Unicode Math text fonts
longdesc Luciole-*.ttf and a companion math font Luciole-Math.otf. These
longdesc have been developed explicitly for visually impaired people and
longdesc are the result of a two-year collaboration between the Centre
longdesc Technique Regional pour la Deficience Visuelle (the Regional
longdesc Technical Center for Visual Impairment) and the type-design
longdesc studio typographies.fr. This project received a grant from the
longdesc Swiss Ceres Foundation and support from the DIPHE laboratory at
longdesc the Universite Lumiere Lyon 2.
