name lydtype
shortdesc Typing in the Lydian alphabet
longdesc This package aims to allow platform-agnostic typing in the
longdesc Lydian alphabet using LaTeX, in particular as a way to deal
longdesc with the fact that Overleaf does not support direct input of
longdesc certain characters outside of a given Unicode range. The
longdesc package was developed for use with LuaLaTeX and XeLaTeX,
longdesc functionality with other compilers is not guaranteed. The
longdesc package includes the Noto Sans Lydian font as developed by
longdesc Google.
