name mahjonggame
shortdesc Drawing Mahjong tiles and complete Mahjong game layouts with LaTeX3 and TikZ
longdesc This package uses LaTeX3 and TikZ to draw Mahjong tiles and
longdesc complete Mahjong game layouts. It provides compact tile
longdesc notation, rotated and stacked tiles, player-oriented game
longdesc layouts, automatic tile counting, Dora indicators, and
longdesc customizable game-table styles. The package is primarily
longdesc designed for Chinese-language Mahjong documentation.
