name maine-thesis
shortdesc A document class for University of Maine graduate theses
longdesc The maine-thesis class provides support for the formatting
longdesc requirements for graduate theses of the Graduate School at The
longdesc University of Maine. It sets default parameters for the report
longdesc class, modifies captions, references, and the table of
longdesc contents, and makes specific environments available. The
longdesc maine-thesis class reflects the guidelines published by the
longdesc Graduate School at The University of Maine. The Graduate School
longdesc at the University of Maine does not provide official support
longdesc for any thesis style class or template.
catalogue-contact-repository https://gitlab.com/maine-thesis/maine-thesis
