name make-paper-tarball
shortdesc Make a submission-ready tarball of an academic paper manuscript
longdesc make-paper-tarball is a script that prepares an academic paper
longdesc manuscript for submission. It performs the following tasks:
longdesc Check that the manuscript can be compiled. Identify source
longdesc files (e.g. figures, bibliography) and copy them to a temporary
longdesc directory. Rename graphic files after the number of the
longdesc figure/table that includes them, e.g. figure-1.png. Check that
longdesc figures and tables are cited in order. Insert LaTeX files
longdesc included by \input directly into the main LaTeX file. Insert
longdesc code listings included by \lstinputlisting directly into the
longdesc main LaTeX file. Insert BibTeX-generated bibliography directly
longdesc into the main LaTeX file. Strip out comments. Copy auxiliary
longdesc files to the tarball. Create an archive containing only the the
longdesc main LaTeX file, required source files, and specified auxiliary
longdesc files.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/kwwette/make-paper-tarball/issues
catalogue-contact-development https://github.com/kwwette/make-paper-tarball/pulls
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/kwwette/make-paper-tarball
