catalogue-license gpl
catalogue-topics cite-supp marginal
catalogue-version 1.0c

name marginalia
shortdesc Marginal content anywhere with automatic adjustment for LuaLaTeX
longdesc This LuaLaTeX package allows the placement of marginal content
longdesc (such as notes) anywhere, without \marginpar's limits, and
longdesc automatically adjusts positions to prevent overlaps or content
longdesc being pushed off the page, and offers key-value settings that
longdesc allow fine-grained customization.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://codeberg.org/ajcain/marginalia/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://codeberg.org/ajcain/marginalia
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/latex/marginalia
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics luatex marginal notes tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 0.84.6

name marginfit
shortdesc Improved margin notes
longdesc This package fixes various bugs with the margin paragraph
longdesc implementation of LaTeX. Those bugs include margin notes that
longdesc are attached to the wrong side as well as those that stick out
longdesc of the bottom of the page. This package provides a drop-in
longdesc replacement solution.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/marginfit
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics marginal tagged-pdf-partially
catalogue-version 1.1

name marginfix
shortdesc Patch \marginpar to avoid overfull margins
longdesc Authors using LaTeX to typeset books with significant margin
longdesc material often run into the problem of long notes running off
longdesc the bottom of the page. A typical workaround is to insert
longdesc \vshift commands by hand, but this is a tedious process that is
longdesc invalidated when pagination changes. Another workaround is
longdesc memoir's \sidebar function, but this can be unsatisfying for
longdesc short textual notes, and standard marginpars cannot be mixed
longdesc with sidebars. This package implements a solution to make
longdesc marginpars just work by keeping a list of floating inserts and
longdesc arranging them intelligently in the output routine.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/marginfix
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics marginal tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.2

name marginnote
shortdesc Notes in the margin, even where \marginpar fails
longdesc This package provides the command \marginnote that may be used
longdesc instead of \marginpar at almost every place where \marginpar
longdesc cannot be used, e.g., inside floats, footnotes, or in frames
longdesc made with the framed package.
catalogue-contact-home https://codeberg.org/komascript/marginnote
catalogue-contact-repository https://codeberg.org/komascript/marginnote.git
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/marginnote
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics marginal notes tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.5

