shortdesc Typesetting menu cards with LaTeX
longdesc This LaTeX package can be used for typesetting simple
longdesc restaurant menus.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/menucard
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics cooking doc-supp
catalogue-version 0.1

name menukeys
shortdesc Format menu sequences, paths and keystrokes from lists
longdesc This package is designed to format menu sequences, paths and
longdesc keyboard shortcuts automatically. There are several predefined
longdesc styles and one can define one's own styles in a flexible way.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/tweh/menukeys/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/tweh/menukeys
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/menukeys
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics doc-supp tagged-pdf-partially
catalogue-version 1.6.4

name mercatormap
shortdesc Spherical Mercator coordinate systems and Web Mercator tile integration
longdesc This package extends TikZ with tools to create map graphics.
longdesc The provided coordinate system relies on the Web Mercator
longdesc projection used on the Web by OpenStreetMap and others. The
longdesc package supports the seamless integration of graphics from
longdesc public map tile servers by a Python script. Also, common map
longdesc elements like markers, geodetic networks, bar scales, routes,
longdesc orthodrome pieces, and more are part of the package.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/T-F-S/mercatormap/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/T-F-S/mercatormap
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/T-F-S/mercatormap.git
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/mercatormap
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics cartography graphics pgf-tikz
catalogue-version 1.3.1

name merriweather
shortdesc LaTeX support for Merriweather and MerriweatherSans
longdesc This package provides the Merriweather and MerriweatherSans
longdesc families of fonts, designed by Eben Sorkin, with support for
longdesc LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX, and LuaLaTeX. Merriweather features a
longdesc very large x height, slightly condensed letterforms, a mild
longdesc diagonal stress, sturdy serifs and open forms. The Sans family
longdesc closely harmonizes with the weights and styles of the serif
longdesc family. There are four weights and italics for each.
catalogue-contact-home https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Merriweather
catalogue-ctan /fonts/merriweather
catalogue-license ofl lppl
catalogue-topics font font-body font-proportional font-sans font-serif font-supp font-t1enc font-ttf font-type1 tagged-pdf

name messagepassing
shortdesc Draw diagrams to represent communication protocols
longdesc This package provides an environment to easily draw diagrams to
longdesc represent communication protocols using message passing among
longdesc processes. Processes are represented as horizontal or vertical
longdesc lines, and communications as arrows between lines. The package
longdesc also provides multiple macros to decorate those diagrams, for
longdesc instance to annotate the diagram, to add crashes to the
longdesc processes, checkpoints, ...
catalogue-contact-repository https://framagit.org/Bromind/LaTeX-packages/-/tree/master
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/messagepassing
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics diagram pgf-tikz
catalogue-version 1.2

name metacapture
shortdesc A package for the capture of author-supplied metadata
longdesc Curation and indexing of metadata is a crucial part of journal
longdesc publishing. The metacapture package is one component in an open
longdesc source workflow implementation that is designed to automate the
longdesc production and copy editing of journal articles. It is used by
longdesc the iacrj document class for the journal IACR CiC, but can also
longdesc be used for other journals. It is intended primarily for use by
longdesc LaTeX document class designers, but may also be useful for
longdesc authors who may wish to change their document class in the
longdesc future. When a document that loads metacapture.sty is compiled,
longdesc it produces a YAML-like text file containing all metadata from
longdesc the document. The metacapture package accomplishes this by
longdesc providing replacements for the generic macros \title, \author
longdesc and \maketitle macros that have traditionally been used by
longdesc document classes. The metacapture package also provides several
longdesc implementations of the \maketitle macro n different styles,
longdesc partly as a way to demonstrate how to separate metadata capture
longdesc from styling of front matter. Document class designers can also
longdesc write their own implementation of \maketitle with their
longdesc preferred styling using the dictionary-like data structures
longdesc used to hold author metadata. The metacapture package is part
longdesc of a larger set of tools for implementing a journal publishing
longdesc workflow. There is also a companion open source implementation
longdesc of a publishing workflow written in Python that is used for
longdesc this journal and provides a simplified workflow for copy
longdesc editing and production. Further information on this workflow
longdesc can be found in two articles that were published by the
longdesc authors: Lowering the Cost of Diamond Open Access Journals, A
longdesc LaTeX publishing workflow
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/IACR/latex/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3Ametacapture.sty
catalogue-contact-development https://github.com/IACR/latex/tree/main/metacapture
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/IACR/latex/tree/main/metacapture
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/IACR/latex/tree/main/metacapture
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/metacapture
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics metadata
catalogue-version 0.9.1

name metafont
shortdesc A system for specifying fonts
longdesc The program takes a programmatic specification of a font, and
longdesc produces a bitmap font (whose properties are defined by a set
longdesc of parameters of the target device), and metrics for use by
longdesc TeX. The bitmap output may be converted into a format directly
longdesc usable by a device driver, etc., by the tools provided in the
longdesc parallel mfware distribution. Third parties have developed
longdesc tools to convert the bitmap output to outline fonts. The
longdesc distribution includes the source of Knuth's The METAFONTbook;
longdesc this source is there to read, as an example of writing TeX - it
longdesc should not be processed without Knuth's direct permission. The
longdesc mailing list tex-fonts@math.utah.edu is the best for general
longdesc discussion of Metafont usage; the tex-k@tug.org list is best
longdesc for bug reports about building the software, etc.
catalogue-alias mf
catalogue-also metapost
catalogue-contact-bugs https://lists.tug.org/tex-k
catalogue-contact-repository https://tug.org/svn/texlive/trunk/Build/source/texk/web2c/
catalogue-contact-support https://lists.tug.org/tex-k
catalogue-ctan /systems/knuth/dist/mf
catalogue-license knuth
catalogue-topics font-devel font-proc
catalogue-version 2.71828182

name metafont-beginners
shortdesc An introductory tutorial for Metafont
longdesc An old introduction to the use of Metafont, that has stood the
longdesc test of time. It focuses on using the program, rather than
longdesc designing fonts, but does offer advice about understanding
longdesc errors in other people's fonts.
catalogue-ctan /info/metafont/beginners
catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics mf-doc

