name mfnfss
shortdesc Packages to typeset oldgerman and pandora fonts in LaTeX
longdesc This bundle contains two packages: - oldgerm, a package to
longdesc typeset with old german fonts designed by Yannis Haralambous. -
longdesc pandora, a package to typeset with Pandora fonts designed by
longdesc Neena Billawala. Note that support for the Pandora fonts is
longdesc also available via the pandora-latex package.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/FrankMittelbach/historical-fmitex/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/FrankMittelbach/historical-fmitex/tree/master/mfnfss
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/mfnfss
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics font-supp tagged-pdf

name mfpic
shortdesc Draw Metafont/post pictures from (La)TeX commands
longdesc Mfpic is a scheme for producing pictures from (La)TeX commands.
longdesc Commands \mfpic and \endmfpic (in LaTeX, the mfpic environment)
longdesc enclose a group in which drawing commands may be placed. The
longdesc commands generate a Meta-language file, which may be processed
longdesc by MetaPost (or even Metafont). The resulting image file will
longdesc be read back in to the document to place the picture at the
longdesc point where the original (La)TeX commands appeared. Note that
longdesc the ability to use MetaPost here means that the package works
longdesc equally well in LaTeX and pdfLaTeX.
catalogue-also mkpic
catalogue-ctan /graphics/mfpic
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics graphics-in-tex tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 1.10

name mfpic4ode
shortdesc Macros to draw direction fields and solutions of ODEs
longdesc The package is a small set of macros for drawing direction
longdesc fields, phase portraits and trajectories of differential
longdesc equations and two dimensional autonomous systems. The Euler,
longdesc Runge-Kutta and 4th order Runge-Kutta algorithms are available
longdesc to solve the ODEs. The picture is translated into mfpic macros
longdesc and MetaPost is used to create the final drawing. The package
longdesc is was designed for use with LaTeX, but it can be used in plain
longdesc TeX as well.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/mfpic4ode
catalogue-license lppl1.2
catalogue-topics graphics-plotfn maths
catalogue-version 0.4

name mftinc
shortdesc Pretty-print Metafont source
longdesc The mft program pretty-prints Metafont source code into a TeX
longdesc file. The mftinc package facilitates incorporating such files
longdesc into a LaTeX2e document. In addition, mftinc provides routines
longdesc for improved comment formatting and for typesetting font
longdesc tables.
catalogue-also docmfp
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/mftinc
catalogue-license lppl1.2
catalogue-topics font-index listing
catalogue-version 1.0a

name mfware
shortdesc Supporting tools for Metafont: gftodvi, gftopk, gftype, mft
longdesc A collection of programs (as web source) for processing the
longdesc output of Metafont. They include: gftodvi (for making proof
longdesc sheets of letters); gftopk (translate gf bitmap files to pk
longdesc bitmaps); gftype (human-readable dump of gf files); mft
longdesc (prettyprint Metafont source).
catalogue-alias gftodvi gftopk gftype mft
catalogue-contact-bugs https://lists.tug.org/tex-k
catalogue-contact-repository https://tug.org/svn/texlive/trunk/Build/source/texk/web2c/
catalogue-contact-support https://lists.tug.org/tex-k
catalogue-ctan /systems/knuth/dist/mfware
catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics collection debug-supp font-util

