name mkjobtexmf
shortdesc Generate a texmf tree for a particular job
longdesc The package provides a Perl script, which runs a program and
longdesc tries to find the names of file used. Two methods are
longdesc available, option -recorder of (Web2C) TeX and the program
longdesc strace. Then it generates a directory with a texmf tree. It
longdesc checks the found files and tries sort them in this texmf tree.
longdesc The script may be used for archiving purposes or to speed up
longdesc later TeX runs.
catalogue-ctan /support/mkjobtexmf
catalogue-license artistic
catalogue-topics archival
catalogue-version 0.8

