name mla-paper
shortdesc Proper MLA formatting
longdesc The package formats articles using the MLA style (MLA = Modern
longdesc Language Association). The aim is that students and other
longdesc academics in the humanities should be able to typeset their
longdesc materials, properly, with minimal effort on their part.
catalogue-also mlacls
