name modernclassnotes
shortdesc Typesetting course notes, lecture handouts, and assignment worksheets
longdesc This package contains a .sty file and a document class that
longdesc provide a clean, modern, and highly configurable framework for
longdesc typesetting academic course notes, lecture summary handouts,
longdesc and assignment worksheets. Key features include: Three
longdesc specialized document modes: notes: For multi-lecture course
longdesc manuals, semester guides, and books with automated lecture
longdesc tracking (\lecture). handout: For compact 1-2 page
longdesc single-lecture summaries with integrated metadata banners.
longdesc worksheet: For homework assignments and problem sets, featuring
longdesc student ID fields and togglable solution keys
longdesc (showsolutions=true/false). Seven curated color palettes:
longdesc ocean, nord, midnight, emerald, burgundy, amethyst, and mono.
longdesc Rich pedagogical callout environments for mathematics (theorem,
longdesc lemma, proposition, corollary, proof, definition), explanations
longdesc (example, remark, note, warning, tip, takeaways), and
longdesc assessments (exercise, solution, codebox). Zero heavy external
longdesc dependencies: Built with a lightweight, native box engine for
longdesc seamless compilation out-of-the-box across TeX Live, MiKTeX,
longdesc and Overleaf.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/aurghya-0/Modern-Class-Notes-Latex/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/aurghya-0/Modern-Class-Notes-Latex
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/modernclassnotes
catalogue-license lppl1.3c mit
catalogue-topics class exercise notes
catalogue-version 1.1.0

name moderncv
shortdesc A modern curriculum vitae class
longdesc The class provides facilities for typesetting modern
longdesc curriculums vitae, both in a classic and in a casual style. It
longdesc is fairly customizable, allowing you to define your own style
longdesc by changing the colours, the fonts, etc. The template.tex file
longdesc can be used as an example.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/moderncv/moderncv/issues
