name modernnewspaper
shortdesc A modern, Unicode-first newspaper package for LaTeX
longdesc modernnewspaper is a Unicode-first LaTeX package for producing
longdesc newspaper-style documents. It supports multi-column layouts,
longdesc multilingual content (including right-to-left scripts),
longdesc Unicode-safe drop caps, column-safe images, and modern metadata
longdesc such as website URLs. The package is designed for XeLaTeX and
longdesc LuaLaTeX and is suitable for both print and digital newspapers.
catalogue-contact-announce https://github.com/Laitei40/modernnewspaper/discussions/categories/announcements
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/Laitei40/modernnewspaper/issues
