name modernposter
shortdesc A modern LaTeX poster theme
longdesc This class extends the a0poster class in that it adds support
longdesc to easily create posters without the need for taking care of
longdesc the layout at all. It allows to use \maketitle to generate a
longdesc fancy header containing the title information and also provides
longdesc macros to position various different types of text boxes in a
longdesc two-column layout. The color scheme is inspired by the
longdesc metropolis beamer theme.
catalogue-also beamerposter
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/derlerd/modernposter
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/modernposter
catalogue-license cc-by-sa-4
catalogue-topics class poster
catalogue-version 1.03.1

name modernruler
shortdesc Flexible ruler and annotation commands with key-value support and vertical writing compatibility
longdesc This package provides a versatile set of commands for drawing
longdesc rules and creating annotations in LaTeX. While standard LaTeX
longdesc rules can be rigid, this package introduces more flexible
longdesc alternatives: \mruleth (horizontal rules), \mruletv (vertical
longdesc rules), and \undernote (underlined annotations). Key Features:
longdesc Key-Value Interface: All commands support a consistent
longdesc key-value syntax for adjust dimensions (width, height, depth),
longdesc colors, and dash patterns (dash, dash-len, gap-len). Underline
longdesc Annotations: The \undernote command allows users to attach
longdesc descriptive notes to underlined text. It automatically handles
longdesc positioning, spacing between multiple notes, and provides
longdesc options for various border styles (solid or dashed boxes).
longdesc Vertical Writing Compatibility: Designed with multilingual
longdesc typesetting in mind, the package is compatible with vertical
longdesc writing modes, ensuring that rules and notes are oriented
longdesc correctly. Customization: Users can update package-wide dfaults
longdesc at any point in the document using a dedicated set of
longdesc \SetUNote... commands.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/KKTeX/modernruler
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/modernruler
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics misc-support notes rule
catalogue-version 2.2.0

name moderntimeline
shortdesc Timelines for use with moderncv
longdesc The package provides commands to configure and to draw time
longdesc line diagrams; such diagrams are designed to fit into
