name morse-simple
shortdesc Lightweight package to include short morse code strings
longdesc Insert strings of morse code into a document. For instance,
longdesc \cwWord{Paris} gives something like .--. .- .-. .. ..., only
longdesc with appropriate spacing. These strings don't require Metafont
longdesc or any other drawing program or package.
