name mousik
shortdesc Manual music notation with TikZ
longdesc This is a package for writing music in LaTeX. It is based on
longdesc TikZ and includes staves, clefs, key and time signatures, notes
longdesc and chords, rests, beams and tuplets, accidentals,
longdesc articulations, slurs and ties, dynamics and hairpins, and piano
longdesc notation. It uses short commands and allows the user to control
longdesc the position and shape of the musical elements. Everything is
longdesc written directly in LaTeX without an external music
longdesc preprocessor.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/celrm/mousik
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/mousik
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics music
