name mpcolornames
shortdesc Extend list of predefined colour names for MetaPost
longdesc The MetaPost format plain.mp provides only five built-in colour
longdesc names (variables), all of which are defined in the RGB model:
longdesc red, green and blue for the primary colours and black and
longdesc white. The package makes more than 500 colour names from
longdesc different colour sets in different colour models available to
longdesc MetaPost. Colour sets include X11, SVG, DVIPS and xcolor
longdesc specifications.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/metapost/contrib/macros/mpcolornames
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics colour
catalogue-version 0.20

name mpfonts
shortdesc Computer Modern Type 3 fonts converted using MetaPost
longdesc The Computer Modern fonts are available in Type 1 format, but
longdesc these renditions are somewhat thin and spindly, and produce
longdesc much lighter results than the originals. It is alternatively
longdesc possible to use Metafont bitmaps, but this has its
longdesc disadvantages in comparison with vector fonts. These fonts are
longdesc conversions to Type 3 fonts, done entirely in MetaPost; they
longdesc are vector fonts which are a direct conversion from the
longdesc original Metafont files, so they are the design most authentic
longdesc to the originals. However, these fonts, because they are
longdesc PostScript Type 3 fonts, are not suitable for on-screen
longdesc reading, and should probably only be used for printing. Note:
longdesc do NOT add the map file to updmap!
catalogue-ctan /fonts/mpfonts
catalogue-license knuth lppl1.3c ofl other-free pd
catalogue-topics font font-body font-cm font-maths font-mono font-proportional font-sans font-serif font-symbol-maths

name mpformulation
shortdesc Typesetting mathematical programs (optimization models)
longdesc Typesets linear, integer and nonlinear programs as in
longdesc operations research journals: objective, automatic subject to,
longdesc one constraint per line with its quantifier, per-constraint or
longdesc per-model numbering. Constraints too wide for the line are
longdesc reorganized automatically, which suits two-column journals.
longdesc Optional alignment on the relation symbol and left-aligned
longdesc quantifiers.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/fypc/mpformulation/issues
