longdesc The package provides a collection of professionally designed
longdesc page borders using TikZ. It is specifically created for
longdesc teachers and educators to enhance the aesthetic appeal of exam
longdesc papers, certificates, and educational documents. The package
longdesc offers various decorative styles that can be easily be
longdesc integrated into LaTeX documents, supporting both pdfLaTeX and
longdesc XeLaTeX engines.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/na-fancyborders
