longdesc This package provides a LaTeX class nanicolle.cls for
longdesc typesetting collection labels and identification labels in
longdesc Chinese style or in western style for plant herbarium
longdesc specimens. So far, documents using this class can only be
longdesc compiled with XeLaTeX. Note: The name of the package is a
longdesc compound of the Japanese nani (meaning what) and a truncated
longdesc form of the English collect, thus expressing the ideas of
longdesc identification/classification (taxonomy) and collection.
