longdesc North Dakota State University requirements. Updated (2022)
longdesc North Dakota State University LaTeX thesis class features
longdesc several functionalities, including not limited to, numbered and
longdesc non-numbered versions, overall justification, document point
longdesc sizes, fonts options, SI units, show frames, URL breaking, long
longdesc tables, subfigures, multi-page figures, chapter styles,
longdesc subfiles, algorithm listing, BibTeX and BibLaTeX support,
