name numerica
shortdesc Numerically evaluate mathematical expressions in LaTeX form
longdesc This package defines a command to wrap around a mathematical
longdesc expression in its LaTeX form and, once values are assigned to
longdesc variables, numerically evaluate it. The intent is to avoid the
longdesc need to modify the LaTeX form of the expression being
longdesc evaluated. For programs with a preview facility like LyX, or
longdesc compile-as-you-go systems, interactive back-of-envelope
longdesc calculations and numerical exploration are possible within the
longdesc document being worked on. The package requires the bundles
longdesc l3kernel and l3packages, and the amsmath and mathtools
longdesc packages.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/numerica
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics calculation maths tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 3.0.0

name numerica-plus
shortdesc Iteration and recurrence relations: finding fixed points, zeros and extrema of functions
longdesc The package defines commands to iterate functions of a single
longdesc variable, find fixed points, zeros and extrema of such
longdesc functions, and calculate the terms of recurrence relations.
longdesc numerica-plus requires the package numerica, which in turn
longdesc requires l3kernel , l3packages, and the amsmath and mathtools
longdesc packages.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/numerica-plus
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics calculation maths tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 3.0.0

name numerica-tables
shortdesc Create multi-column tables of mathematical functions
longdesc The package defines a command to create possibly multi-column
longdesc tables of mathematical function values. Key = value settings
longdesc produce a wide variety of table styles consistent with the
longdesc booktabs package (required). Also required are the packages
longdesc numerica, l3kernel, l3packages, amsmath and mathtools.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/numerica-tables
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics calculation maths tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 3.2.0

name numericplots
