name omgtudoc-asoiu
shortdesc A class for documents of the ASOIU department at Omsk State Technical University
longdesc This package provides a class for documents which are prepared
longdesc on the Automatic systems for information processing and control
longdesc (ASOIU) of Omsk State Technical University, Omsk, Russia. The
longdesc class is based on the article class and requires XeLaTeX or
longdesc LuaLaTeX for its proper working. Formatting complies with the
longdesc instructions issued on January 29, 2024 and at GOST 7.32-2017.
catalogue-ctan /macros/unicodetex/latex/omgtudoc-asoiu
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics article-like class std-conform
catalogue-version 1.1b

name onedown
shortdesc Typeset Bridge Diagrams
longdesc This is a comprehensive package to draw all sorts of bridge
longdesc diagrams, including hands (stand alone or arround a compass),
longdesc bidding tables (stand alone or in connection with
longdesc hands/compass), trick tables, and expert quizzes. Features:
longdesc Works for all fontsizes from \ssmall to \HUGE. Different fonts
longdesc for hands, bidding diagrams, compass, etc. are possible.
longdesc Annotations to card and bidding diagrams. Automated check on
longdesc consistency of suit and hands. Multilingual output of bridge
longdesc terms. Extensive documentation: User manual, Reference manual,
longdesc and Examples.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/onedown
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics games
catalogue-version 1.7

name onepgnote
shortdesc Space-efficient one-page notes for exams
longdesc An article-based LaTeX class that helps making one-page notes
longdesc for exams. It makes the one-page note very space efficient,
longdesc while maintaining the conspicuity of important texts. Another
longdesc feature is the simple implementation of this class. With only
longdesc 100+ lines of code, it achieves the above features, thanks to a
longdesc few powerful ideas. This makes it easy for others to understand
longdesc and improve the source code.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/guanyuming-he/onepgnote
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/onepgnote
catalogue-license gpl3
catalogue-topics class
catalogue-version 1.0.0

name onlinebrief24
shortdesc LaTeX class for DIN 5008 type-B business letters for use with onlinebrief24.de
longdesc This is a LaTeX letter class based on KOMA-Script scrlttr2. It
longdesc is calibrated against the onlinebrief24.de letter
longdesc specifications and provides: a plain letter layout a modern
longdesc layout with header, footer, and accent colors a guides mode for
longdesc technical layout inspection validated address-window inputs
longdesc verified pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX, LuaLaTeX workflows The package
longdesc currently supports one letter per document as the hardened use
longdesc case. Onlinebrief24.de is a hybrid mail service for business
longdesc customers: documents are submitted digitally, and the service
longdesc handles printing, enveloping, franking, and postal delivery.
longdesc The trademark holders have formally authorized the maintainer
longdesc to use the Onlinebrief24 mark in connection with this LaTeX
longdesc class.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/frluciano/latex-onlinebrief24
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/onlinebrief24
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics letter std-conform

name onlyamsmath
shortdesc Inhibit use of non-amsmath mathematics markup when using amsmath
longdesc This package inhibits the usage of plain TeX and (on demand) of
longdesc standard LaTeX mathematics environments. This is useful for
longdesc class writers who want to encourage their users to use the
longdesc environments provided by the amsmath package.
catalogue-also nag
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/onlyamsmath
catalogue-license lppl1
catalogue-topics latex-qual maths
catalogue-version 0.20

name onrannual
shortdesc Class for Office of Naval Research Ocean Battlespace Sensing annual report
longdesc This is an unofficial document class for writing ONR annual
longdesc reports using LaTeX; as ONR has had numerous problems with
longdesc LaTeX-generated PDF submissions in the past. A skeleton
longdesc document (and its PDF output) are included.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/onrannual
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics report-like
catalogue-version 1.1

name opbible
shortdesc Creating a study Bible with OpTeX
longdesc This package includes OpTeX macros which allow to create a
longdesc study Bible in many language variants. The main Bible text is
longdesc in separate files while the commentary apparatus can be written
longdesc in other files. TeX is able to join all these data into a
longdesc single print of a study Bible. Moreover, multiple language
longdesc variants and translation subvariants are provided.
catalogue-contact-home https://opbible.org
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/olsak/OpBible
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/optex/opbible
catalogue-license gpl
catalogue-topics luatex macro-gen theology
catalogue-version 0.31

name opcit
shortdesc Footnote-style bibliographical references
longdesc This package addresses the problem of expressing citations in a
longdesc style that is natural for humanities studies, yet does not
longdesc interfere with the flow of text (as author-year styles do). The
longdesc package differs from footbib in that it uses real footnotes,
longdesc potentially in the same series as any of the document's other
longdesc footnotes. Opcit also, as its name implies, avoids repetition
longdesc of full citations, achieving this, to a large extent,
longdesc automatically.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/opcit
catalogue-license lppl1
catalogue-topics bibtex-supp footnote
catalogue-version 1.1

name open-everyday-symbols
shortdesc A list of everyday symbols, to be extended by everybody
longdesc This is meant to be a community project: It's a list of
longdesc symbols/icons from an everyday context. It can literally be
longdesc everything, and thus does not aim at mathematical symbols or
longdesc the like. It's basically an icons portfolio - tiny at this
longdesc stage (basically merely providing the infrastructure for more
longdesc symbols), but we hope for contributions from the community.
longdesc Just create some symbols and make a pull request.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/ProfDrChaos/open-everyday-symbols/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/ProfDrChaos/open-everyday-symbols
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/open-everyday-symbols
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics graphics graphics-symb pgf-tikz
catalogue-version 1.1

name opencolor
shortdesc Definitions from the Open Color library
longdesc This package provides hexadecimal color definitions of the 130
longdesc colors included in the Open Color library.
catalogue-also colorweb
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/piazzai/opencolor/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/piazzai/opencolor
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/opencolor
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics colour
catalogue-version 1.0.3

name openmoji
shortdesc Use openmoji through LaTeX commands
longdesc This package provides commands like twemojis which allow to use
longdesc OpenMoji through LaTeX commands. This relies on images (PDF
longdesc from SVG), so no fancy unicode-font stuff is needed and it
longdesc should work on every installation.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/cpierquet/latex-packages/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/cpierquet/latex-packages/tree/main/openmoji
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/openmoji
catalogue-license lppl1.3c cc-by-sa-4
catalogue-topics graphics text-symbol
catalogue-version 17.0.0

name opensans
shortdesc The Open Sans font family, and LaTeX support
longdesc Open Sans is a humanist sans serif typeface designed by Steve
longdesc Matteson; the font is available from the Google Font Directory
longdesc as TrueType files licensed under the Apache License version
longdesc 2.0. The package provides support for this font family in
longdesc LaTeX. It includes the original TrueType fonts, as well as Type
longdesc 1 versions, converted for this package using FontForge for full
longdesc support with dvips
catalogue-ctan /fonts/opensans
catalogue-license apache2 lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics font font-sans font-ttf font-type1 tagged-pdf
