name opteng
shortdesc SPIE Optical Engineering and OE Letters manuscript template
longdesc With this template, and associated style and LaTeX packages, it
longdesc is possible to estimate the page length of manuscripts for
longdesc submission to the SPIE journals Optical Engineering and Optical
longdesc Engineering Letters. With a strict three-page limit, this is
longdesc particularly important for the latter. The template gives
longdesc simple instructions on how to prepare the manuscript.
catalogue-also spie
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/opteng
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics journalpub
