name ordinalpt
shortdesc Counters as ordinal numbers in Portuguese
longdesc The package provides a counter style (like \arabic, \alph and
longdesc others) which produces as output strings like primeiro (first
longdesc in Portuguese), segundo (second), and so on up to 1999th.
longdesc Separate counter commands are provided for different letter
longdesc case variants, and for masculine and feminine gender
longdesc inflections.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/ordinalpt
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics numbers portuguese
catalogue-version 2.1

name orientation
shortdesc Set page orientation with dvips/Ghostscript (ps2pdf)
longdesc This package provides commands for manual (per-page and
longdesc per-document) orientation of pages in a PDF created with
longdesc dvips/Ghostscript (ps2pdf). For future versions it is planned
longdesc to add support for other drivers, allowing for PDF orientation
longdesc to be set in (x)dvipdfmx and pdfmode pdfTeX using the same
longdesc commands from the user perspective.
