name oststud
shortdesc Templates for the student organization at OST FH, Switzerland
longdesc This package is made by the student organization at the
longdesc University of Applied Sciences of Eastern Switzerland
longdesc (Ostschweizer Fachhochschule) to provide an easy to use
longdesc interface for newbies and give a more consistent look and feel
longdesc to the works produced by the organization's members. This
longdesc package also contains hsrstud.{ins,dtx} which is the older
longdesc version of the oststud package before the school changed its
longdesc name in 2021. We would like to keep it for backwards
longdesc compatibility when compiling old documents that have not been
