name padcount
shortdesc Pad numbers with arbitrary characters
longdesc This package provides some simple macros which will pad numbers
longdesc (or, indeed, any expanded token) with your choice of character
longdesc (defaulting to 0) to your choice of number of places (defaults
longdesc to 2). This works not only on arabic numerals, but on any
longdesc expanded list of tokens passed to it. This makes it suitable
longdesc for, among other things, counters of all kinds.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/padcount
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics numbers
catalogue-version 1.0

name page-canons
shortdesc Classical page-layout canons with margin-note support
longdesc This package implements classical page-layout canons with
longdesc in-house margin-note and sidenote support. Its only declared
longdesc runtime dependency is geometry; all other functionality is
longdesc self-contained. Inclusions: four margin modes (symmetric,
longdesc antisymmetric, right, left); gutter support with two
longdesc calculation modes; support for bleed and trim; a fullwidth
longdesc environment; exported dimensions for margin-aware content.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/deltaquebec/canons/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/deltaquebec/canons
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/page-canons
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics geometry layout marginal
catalogue-version 3.9.4

name pagecolor
shortdesc Interrogate page color
longdesc This package provides the command \thepagecolor, which gives
longdesc the current page (background) color, i. e. the argument used
longdesc with the most recent call of \pagecolor{...}. The command
longdesc \thepagecolornone gives the same color as \thepagecolor, except
longdesc when the page background color is none (e.g., as a result of
longdesc using the \nopagecolor command). In that case \thepagecolor is
longdesc white and \thepagecolornone is none. When \nopagecolor is
longdesc unknown or broken (crop package), this package provides a
longdesc replacement. Similar to \newgeometry and \restoregeometry of
longdesc the geometry package \newpagecolor{...} and \restorepagecolor
longdesc are provided. For use with the crop package
longdesc \backgroundpagecolor{...} as well as
longdesc \newbackgroundpagecolor{...} and \restorebackgroundpagecolor
longdesc are provided.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/pagecolor
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics colour tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.2d

name pagecont
shortdesc Page numbering that continues between documents
longdesc The package provides the facility that several documents can be
longdesc typeset independently with page numbers in sequence, as if they
longdesc were a single document.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/pagecont
catalogue-license lppl1.2
catalogue-topics page-nos
catalogue-version 1.0

name pagegrid
shortdesc Print page grid in background
longdesc This package puts a grid on the paper. It was written for
longdesc developers of a class or package who have to put elements on
longdesc definite locations on a page (e.g. letter class). The grid
longdesc allows a faster optical check, whether the positions are
longdesc correct. If the previewer already offers features for
longdesc measuring, the package might be unnecessary. Otherwise it saves
longdesc the developer from printing the page and measuring by hand. The
longdesc package was part of the oberdiek bundle.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/pagegrid
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics background layout-show tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.6

name pagelayout
shortdesc Layout graphic rich documents
longdesc The pagelayout class enables you to layout pages declaratively
longdesc using simple macros for pages, covers, grids, templates, text,
longdesc and graphics to create graphic rich, perfectly typeset, and
longdesc print ready PDFs. The integration of Inkscape allows you to
longdesc create box shadows. The integration of ImageMagick allows you
longdesc to configure compression and sharpening for bitmap graphics to
longdesc export web, print or preview versions of your document.
longdesc Parallelized image optimization, caching, and a draft mode
longdesc enable fast PDF creation and a responsive workflow, even for
longdesc large documents with lots of photos and graphics. The
longdesc pagelayout class also integrates the PGF/TikZ and tcolorbox
longdesc LaTeX packages.
catalogue-alias xput
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/friedemannbartels/latex-pagelayout/issues
