name pdftoolbox
shortdesc A plain-pdfTeX toolbox for creating beautiful documents
longdesc pdfToolbox is a toolbox of various subpackages intended for
longdesc programming and creating beautiful plain-pdfTeX documents. It
longdesc is an amalgamation of the following subpackages (in the future
longdesc there will be an ability to access each one by itself): pdfData
longdesc - for storing and manipulating data; pdfDstruct - for managing
longdesc the layout and structure of your document; pdfGraphics - for
longdesc adding some color and illustrations to your document.
longdesc pdfToolbox currently only works with pdfTeX. It is not
longdesc compatible with any form of LaTeX, and currently does not work
longdesc with XeTeX or LuaTeX (though hopefully LuaTeX support will be
longdesc added in the future).
catalogue-ctan /macros/pdftex/plain/pdftoolbox
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics pdf-feat
catalogue-version 0.2

