name pgfkeysearch
shortdesc Find keys in a given path recursively
longdesc The command \pgfkeysvalueof, unlike \pgfkeys, does not use the
longdesc .unknown handler, but raises an error if a key is not defined
longdesc in the given path. It neither offers an option to search for
longdesc the key in other paths. This package defines commands that
longdesc allow to retrieve the value of a key, recursively searching for
longdesc it in a list of paths.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/alceu-frigeri/pgfkeysearch/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/alceu-frigeri/pgfkeysearch
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/pgfkeysearch
