name phosphoricons
shortdesc LaTeX support for Phosphor Icons
longdesc This package provides LaTeX support for Phosphor Icons Icons
longdesc can be typeset with a generic command (\ppIcon{acorn}) or with
longdesc generated per-icon commands (\ppAcorn), on pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX
longdesc and LuaLaTeX alike. The weight can be chosen as a package
longdesc option, mid-document, or per icon via an optional argument,
longdesc which also accepts key-value input. Two-layer duotone icons are
longdesc fully supported; the background layer color defaults to the
longdesc current text color mixed at 20% and can be set to any xcolor
longdesc expression. Icons inherit the surrounding text color and font
longdesc size. The bundled TrueType fonts are embedded directly under
longdesc pdfLaTeX and loaded without fontspec under the Unicode engines.
longdesc All bindings are auto-generated from the upstream release, so
longdesc the package tracks new Phosphor versions closely.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/braniii/phosphoricons/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/braniii/phosphoricons
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/braniii/phosphoricons
catalogue-ctan /fonts/phosphoricons
catalogue-license mit lppl1.3c
