catalogue-version 2.1.2-1

name photo
shortdesc A float environment for photographs
longdesc This package introduces a new float type called photo which
longdesc works similar to the float types table and figure. Various
longdesc options exist for placing photos, captions, and a photographer
longdesc line. In twocolumn documents, a possibility exists to generate
longdesc double-column floats automatically if the photo does not fit
longdesc into one column. Photos do not have to be placed as floats,
longdesc they can also be placed as boxes, with captions and
longdesc photographer line still being available.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/photo
catalogue-license lppl1
catalogue-topics float

