name pkgmeta
shortdesc Retrieve metadata from LaTeX packages and files without loading them
longdesc This package provides a small interface for retrieving metadata
longdesc declared by a LaTeX package or file without loading the target
longdesc file. It recognizes metadata declared by \ProvidesPackage,
longdesc \ProvidesFile, \ProvidesExplPackage, and \ProvidesExplFile. The
longdesc package provides access to package dates, version numbers,
longdesc release date components, and descriptions. With LuaTeX, the
longdesc target file is read as text; with XeTeX and pdfTeX, readprov is
longdesc used as the backend.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/gambi-shah/pkgmeta/issues
