name proba
shortdesc Shortcuts commands to symbols used in probability texts
longdesc This package includes some of the most often used commands in
longdesc probability texts, e.g. probability, expectation, variance,
longdesc etc. It also includes some short commands for set (blackboard)
longdesc or filtrations (calligraphic). It requires LaTeX2e and the
longdesc amsfonts package.
