name problib
shortdesc Create a library and catalog of problems
longdesc This package manages a library of problems for the exam class.
longdesc Each problem is stored in its own file with metadata such as
longdesc topics, tags and difficulty. Assignments pull problems from the
longdesc library by path. Every assignment records which problems it
longdesc used. A catalog document, compiled with LuaLaTeX, collects
longdesc those records to show when and where each problem was last
longdesc used.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/kylemonette/problib
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/problib
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics doc-mgmt exam use-luatex
