longdesc This package provides (re-)definitions of some LaTeX commands
longdesc that can be useful for the preparation of papers with the style
longdesc of the proceedings of symposia sponsored by the International
longdesc Association of Geodesy (IAG) published by Springer-Verlag.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/prociagssymp
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics confproc

name prodint
shortdesc A font that provides the product integral symbol
longdesc Product integrals are to products, as integrals are to sums.
longdesc They have been around for more than a hundred years, they have
longdesc not become part of the standard mathematician's toolbox,
longdesc possibly because no-one invented the right mathematical symbol
longdesc for them. The authors have remedied that situation by proposing
longdesc the symbol and providing this font.
catalogue-ctan /fonts/prodint
