name promec-ufrgs
shortdesc A LaTeX class for PROMEC/UFRGS theses and dissertations
longdesc The promec-ufrgs class extends abntex2 to provide the
longdesc formatting required by the Graduate Program in Mechanical
longdesc Engineering (PROMEC) at the Universidade Federal do Rio Grande
longdesc do Sul (UFRGS), Brazil, in compliance with Brazilian ABNT
longdesc standards (NBR 14724, 6023, 10520, 6024, 6027, 6028). It
longdesc packages package loading, the cover page, the approval page,
longdesc and the sequence of pre-textual elements into the class itself,
longdesc so that thesis/dissertation authors only need to edit their own
longdesc data and content files, without risking the ABNT-compliant
longdesc formatting.
