shortdesc Plotting ellipsoids in 3D
longdesc pst-ellipsoid is a complementary package for pst-solides3d
longdesc (PSTricks), representing ellipsoid solids in 3D.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-ellipsoid
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics graphics maths pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.02

name pst-eps
shortdesc Create EPS files from PSTricks figures
longdesc Pst-eps is a PSTricks-based package for exporting PSTricks
longdesc images on the fly to encapsulated PostScript (EPS) image files,
longdesc which can then be read into a document in the usual way.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-eps
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics graphics-prep pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 1.0

name pst-eqhz
