longdesc superposition of the horizontal and equatorial coordinate
longdesc systems, as previously demonstrated by Hyomin Kim Phys 322,
longdesc Equatorial Coordinate System
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-eqhz
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics astronomy graphics physics tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.01

name pst-eucl
shortdesc Euclidean geometry with PSTricks
longdesc The package allows the drawing of Euclidean geometric figures
longdesc using TeX pstricks macros for specifying mathematical
longdesc constraints. It is thus possible to build point using common
longdesc transformations or intersections. The use of coordinates is
longdesc limited to points which controlled the figure.
catalogue-also eukleides tkz-euclide
catalogue-contact-home https://pstricks.tug.org
