longdesc The package provides a version of graphicx that avoids loading
longdesc the graphics bundle's (original) keyval package, which clashes
longdesc with pstricks' use of xkeyval.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-graphicx
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics graphics-incl
catalogue-version 0.02

name pst-hertz
shortdesc Draws the electromagnetic field of a Hertzian dipole
longdesc Many authors have created visualizations of the electromagnetic
longdesc field radiated by a Hertzian dipole; the version by Raimund V.
longdesc Girwidz is the most comprehensive. This package offers several
longdesc options to plot the field of a Hertzian dipole. It runs with
longdesc lualatex or the sequenz latex - dvips - ps2pdf. The last
longdesc variant is to be preferred for animations, owing to the heavy
longdesc calculations.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-hertz
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics graphics physics pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.1

name pst-hsb
shortdesc Curves with continuous colours
longdesc This is a PSTricks-related package. It can plot lines and/or
longdesc curves with continuous colours. Only colours defined in the hsb
longdesc model are supported.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-hsb
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics colour pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.03

name pst-hyperboloid
shortdesc Rotating a hyperbola to show geometric objects
longdesc A hyperboloid is a surface generated by rotating a hyperbola
longdesc around one of its axes (a surface of revolution). Rotating a
longdesc hyperbola around its conjugate axis produces a one-sheeted
longdesc hyperboloid which shows parabolas, ellipses, and circles.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-hyperboloid
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics graphics maths pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.01

name pst-hypertiling
shortdesc Hyperbolic tilings with PSTricks
longdesc The hypertiling package is dedicated to the tiling of the
longdesc Poincare disk; in the future, it may potentially be expanded to
longdesc include other construction elements of hyperbolic geometry
longdesc within this disk.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-hypertiling
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics graphics maths pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.01

name pst-infixplot
shortdesc Using PSTricks plotting capacities with infix expressions rather than RPN
longdesc Plotting functions with pst-plot is very powerful but sometimes
longdesc difficult to learn since the syntax of \psplot and
longdesc \parametricplot requires some PostScript knowledge. The
longdesc infix-RPN and pst-infixplot styles simplify the usage of
longdesc pst-plot for the beginner, providing macro commands that
longdesc convert natural mathematical expressions to PostScript syntax.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-infixplot
catalogue-license lppl1
catalogue-topics graphics-plot pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.11

name pst-intersect
shortdesc Compute intersections of arbitrary curves
