catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-knot
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics decoration pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.2

name pst-labo
shortdesc Draw objects for Chemistry laboratories
longdesc Pst-labo is a PSTricks related package for drawing basic and
longdesc complex chemical objects. The documentation of the package is
longdesc illuminated with plenty of illustrations together with their
longdesc source code, making it an easy read.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-labo
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics chemistry graphics-use tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 2.08

name pst-layout
shortdesc Page layout macros based on PSTricks packages
longdesc The package provides a means of creating elaborate
longdesc (pseudo-tabular) layouts of material, typically to be overlaid
