catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 1.0

name pst-rubans
shortdesc Draw three-dimensional ribbons
longdesc The package uses PStricks and pst-solides3d to draw three
longdesc dimensional ribbons on a cylinder, torus, sphere, cone or
longdesc paraboloid. The width of the ribbon, the number of turns, the
longdesc colour of the outer and the inner surface of the ribbon may be
longdesc set. In the case of circular and conical helices, one may also
longdesc choose the number of ribbons.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-rubans
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics graphics pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 1.2

name pst-shell
shortdesc Plotting sea shells
longdesc pst-shell is a PSTricks related package to draw seashells in 3D
longdesc view: Argonauta, Epiteonium, Lyria, Turritella, Tonna,
longdesc Achatina, Oxystele, Conus, Ammonite, Codakia, Escalaria,
longdesc Helcion, Natalina, Planorbis, and Nautilus, all with different
longdesc parameters. pst-shell needs pst-solides3d and an up-to-date
longdesc PSTricks, which should be part of your local TeX installation,
longdesc otherwise get it from a CTAN server.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-shell
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics colour dvips-special graphics-in-tex pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible xetex
catalogue-version 0.04

name pst-sigsys
shortdesc Support of signal processing-related disciplines
longdesc The package offers a collection of useful macros for
longdesc disciplines related to signal processing. It defines macros for
longdesc plotting a sequence of numbers, drawing the pole-zero diagram
longdesc of a system, shading the region of convergence, creating an
longdesc adder or a multiplier node, placing a framed node at a given
longdesc coordinate, creating an up-sampler or a down-sampler node,
longdesc drawing the block diagram of a system, drawing adaptive
longdesc systems, sequentially connecting a list of nodes, and
longdesc connecting a list of nodes using any node-connecting macro.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-sigsys
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics engineering physics pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 1.4

name pst-slpe
shortdesc Sophisticated colour gradients
longdesc This PStricks package covers all the colour gradient
longdesc functionality of pst-grad (part of the base PSTricks
longdesc distribution), and provides the following facilities: it
longdesc permits the user to specify an arbitrary number of colours,
longdesc along with the points at which they are to be reached; it
longdesc converts between RGB and HSV behind the scenes; it provides
longdesc concentric and radial gradients; it provides a command \psBall
longdesc that generates bullets with a three-dimensional appearance; and
longdesc uses the xkeyval package for the extended key handling.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-slpe
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics colour pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 1.31

name pst-solarsystem
shortdesc Plot the solar system for a specific date
longdesc The package uses pstricks to produce diagrams of the visible
longdesc planets, projected on the plane of the ecliptic. It is not
longdesc possible to represent all the planets in their real
longdesc proportions, so only Mercury, Venus, Earth and Mars have their
longdesc orbits in correct proportions and their relative sizes are
longdesc observed. Saturn and Jupiter are in the right direction, but
longdesc not in the correct size.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-solarsystem
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics astronomy pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.15

name pst-solides3d
shortdesc Draw perspective views of 3D solids
longdesc The package is designed to draw solids in 3d perspective.
longdesc Features include: create primitive solids; create solids by
longdesc including a list of its vertices and faces; faces of solids and
longdesc surfaces can be colored by choosing from a very large palette
longdesc of colors; draw parametric surfaces in algebraic and reverse
longdesc polish notation; create explicit and parameterized algebraic
longdesc functions drawn in 2 or 3 dimensions; project text onto a plane
longdesc or onto the faces of a solid; support for including external
longdesc database files.
catalogue-contact-home https://tug.org/PSTricks/main.cgi/
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-solides3d
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics graphics-3d pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 4.36

name pst-soroban
shortdesc Draw a Soroban using PSTricks
longdesc The package uses PSTricks to draw a Japanese abacus, or
longdesc soroban. The soroban is still used in Japan today.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-soroban
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics diagram pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 1.0

name pst-spectra
shortdesc Draw continuum, emission and absorption spectra with PSTricks
longdesc The package is a PSTricks extension, based on a NASA lines
longdesc database. It allows you to draw continuum, emission and
longdesc absorption spectra. A Total of 16 880 visible lines from 99
longdesc elements can be displayed. The package requires the xkeyval
longdesc package for decoding its arguments.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-spectra
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics physics pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.91

name pst-spectrum
shortdesc Output of a color spectrum for different color models
longdesc To represent the spectrum of light decomposition, we have
longdesc several packages at our disposal with PSTricks: pst-spectra,
longdesc xcolor, and pstricks-add. All use the same source code by Dan
longdesc Bruton. This package provides an extended visible spectrum.
longdesc However, it is possible to obtain the representation of the
longdesc spectrum directly from the data of the >>International
longdesc Commission on Illumination<< (CIE), and we have the choice
longdesc between the data of (CIE 1931) and that of (CIE 1964). Then we
longdesc must choose a color space, sRGB, Adobe,etc.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-spectrum
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics physics pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 1.01a

name pst-sphericaltrochoid
shortdesc Create animations of a spherical trochoid
longdesc This package simulates the generation of a spherical trochoid
longdesc by a point on a circle rolling without sliding along the edge
longdesc of another circle, but on the same sphere. (See
longdesc https://demonstrations.wolfram.com/SphericalTrochoid/)
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/contrib/pst-sphericaltrochoid
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics graphics pstricks tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.01

name pst-spinner
shortdesc Drawing a fidget spinner
longdesc This package aims to propose a model of the fidget spinner
longdesc gadget. It exists under different forms with 2, 3 poles and
longdesc even more. We chose the most popular model: the triple Fidget
longdesc Spinner. You can run the PSTricks related documents with
longdesc XeLaTeX.
catalogue-contact-announce https://tug.org/PSTricks/
catalogue-contact-home https://tug.org/PSTricks/
catalogue-contact-repository https://archiv.dante.de/~herbert/TeXnik/
