name pst2pdf
shortdesc A script to compile PSTricks documents via pdfTeX
longdesc The script extracts the preamble of the document and runs all
longdesc \begin{postscript}...\end{postscript}
longdesc \begin{pspicture}...\end{pspicture} \pspicture...\endpspicture
longdesc separately through LaTeX with the same preamble as the original
longdesc document; thus it creates EPS, PNG and PDF files of these
longdesc snippets. In a final pdfLaTeX run the script replaces the
longdesc environments with \includegraphics to include the processed
longdesc snippets. Detail documentation is acquired from the document
longdesc itself via Perldoc.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pstricks/scripts/pst2pdf
catalogue-license gpl2
catalogue-topics graphics graphics-epspdf
catalogue-version 0.20

