name q-and-a
shortdesc Typesetting Q&A-style conversation made easier
longdesc Q-and-A is a LaTeX document class for you to typeset Q&A-style
longdesc conversation. It turns simple pure text Q&A dialog into a
longdesc carefully designed document. Notably, it features two themes,
longdesc ChatGPT-light and ChatGPT-dark, enabling you to format your Q&A
longdesc dialog in a way that closely resembles the interface of
longdesc ChatGPT.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/Jinwen-XU/Q-and-A
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/q-and-a
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics article-like class multilingual

name qcircuit
shortdesc Macros to generate quantum ciruits
longdesc The package supports those within the quantum information
longdesc community who typeset quantum circuits, using xy-pic package,
longdesc offering macros designed to help users generate circuits.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/CQuIC/qcircuit
catalogue-ctan /graphics/qcircuit
catalogue-license gpl2
catalogue-topics diagram-circ graphics-in-tex tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 2.6.0

name qcm
shortdesc A LaTeX2e class for making multiple choice questionnaires
longdesc QCM is a package for making multiple choices questionnaires
longdesc under LaTeX2e (QCM is the French acronym for this style of
longdesc test). A special environment allows you to define questions and
longdesc possible answers. You can specify which answers are correct and
longdesc which are not. QCM not only formats the questions for you, but
longdesc also generates a form (a grid that your students will have to
longdesc fill in), and a mask (the same grid, only with correct answers
longdesc properly checked in). You can then print the mask on a slide
longdesc and correct the questionnaires more easily by superimposing the
longdesc mask on top of students' forms. QCM can also typeset exam
longdesc corrections automatically, and comes with support for AUC-TeX.
catalogue-also multiple-choice
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/qcm
catalogue-license lppl1.1
catalogue-topics exam
catalogue-version 2.1

name qobitree
shortdesc LaTeX macros for typesetting trees
longdesc Provides commands \branch and \leaf for specifying the elements
longdesc of the tree; you build up your tree with those commands, and
longdesc then issue the \tree command to typeset the whole.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/qobitree
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics tree

name qpxqtx
shortdesc Polish macros and fonts supporting Pagella/pxfonts and Termes/txfonts

name qrbill
shortdesc Create QR bills using LaTeX
longdesc This LaTeX package provides support for creating QR-bills for
longdesc the new Swiss payment standards. This open source
longdesc implementation is intended to offer a free option to support
longdesc these regulations and can be adapted for international use.
longdesc Packages loaded by qrbill are expl3, fontspec (except if one is
longdesc using a custom font setup), graphicx, scrbase, qrcode, iftex,
longdesc l3keys2e, and numprint.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/peitex/qrbill/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/peitex/qrbill
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/qrbill
catalogue-license lppl1.3c bsd3
catalogue-topics invoice qrcode swiss
catalogue-version 2.01

name qrcode
shortdesc Generate QR codes in LaTeX
longdesc The package generates QR (Quick Response) codes in LaTeX,
longdesc without the need for PSTricks or any other graphical package.
catalogue-also pst-barcode
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/qrcode
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics barcode qrcode rule tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 1.51

name qrcodetikz
shortdesc Prettier QR codes
longdesc This package improves the display of QR codes provided by
longdesc qrcode. The Quick Response (QR) codes provided by package
longdesc qrcode show white borders on each square (from little to very
longdesc prominent, depending on the pdf viewer). This is because the QR
longdesc code is printed square by square, not the connected regions of
longdesc squares as such, and pdf screen viewers show these undesired
longdesc borders. This package overwrites the qrcode printing functions
longdesc to fill connected regions of the QR code using TikZ, allowing
longdesc prettier qrcodes on screen visualization, with possibility of
longdesc customization.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/qrcodetikz
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics pgf-tikz qrcode
catalogue-version 1.0

name qsharp
shortdesc Syntax highlighting for the Q# language
longdesc The package provides syntax highlighting for the Q# language, a
longdesc domain-specific language for quantum programming.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/msr-quarc/qsharp.sty/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/msr-quarc/qsharp.sty
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/qsharp
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics synt-hlt
catalogue-version 0.3.1901.1401

name qstest
shortdesc Bundle for unit tests and pattern matching
longdesc This is the public release of the qstest bundle (written for
longdesc DocScape Publisher) (C) 2006, 2007 QuinScape GmbH. The bundle
longdesc contains the packages makematch for matching patterns to
longdesc targets (with a generalization in the form of pattern lists and
longdesc keyword lists), and qstest for performing unit tests, allowing
longdesc the user to run a number of logged tests ensuring the
longdesc consistency of values, properties and call sequences during
longdesc execution of test code. Both packages make extensive use of in
longdesc their package documentation, providing illustrated examples
longdesc that are automatically verified to work as expected. Check the
longdesc README file for details.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/qstest
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics debug-supp

name qsymbols
shortdesc Maths symbol abbreviations
longdesc Provides macros for defining systematic mnemonic abbreviations,
longdesc starting with ` for math symbols and \" for arrows, using
longdesc standard symbols as well as those from the amsfonts bundle and
longdesc the stmaryrd package.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/qsymbols
catalogue-license gpl
catalogue-topics maths-symbol shortcut

name qtree
shortdesc Draw tree structures
longdesc The package offers support for drawing tree diagrams, and is
longdesc especially suitable for linguistics use. It allows trees to be
longdesc specified in a simple bracket notation, automatically
longdesc calculates branch sizes, and supports both DVI/PostScript and
longdesc PDF output by use of pict2e facilities. The package is a
longdesc development of the existing qobitree package, offering a new
longdesc front end.
catalogue-also tree-dvips
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/qtree
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics linguistic tagged-pdf-incompatible tree
catalogue-version 3.1b

