catalogue-ctan /fonts/qualitype
catalogue-license ofl gpl2+
catalogue-topics font font-body font-collection font-novelty font-otf font-proportional font-sans font-serif font-supp

name quantikz
shortdesc Draw quantum circuit diagrams
longdesc The purpose of this package is to extend TikZ with the
longdesc functionality for drawing quantum circuit diagrams.
