name qworld
shortdesc Drawing string diagrams for monoidal categories and quantum theory in TeX
longdesc This LaTeX package has been designed for the typesetting of
longdesc graphical languages grounded in monoidal category theory and
longdesc its extensions. It provides a declarative, LaTeX-native
longdesc interface for rendering string diagrams, eliminating the need
longdesc for any external graphics software or manual image management.
longdesc The package supports a wide spectrum of categorical structures
longdesc frequently encountered in categorical quantum mechanics,
longdesc algebraic structures, and diagrammatic reasoning, including but
longdesc not limited to: Monoidal and symmetric monoidal categories Dual
longdesc objects and pivotal / rigid categories Dagger categories
longdesc Frobenius algebras and Hopf algebras Braided, balanced, and
longdesc ribbon categories Internally, QWorld builds upon the TikZ
longdesc graphics framework, but introduces a domain-specific layer of
longdesc abstraction that aligns diagram syntax closely with categorical
longdesc semantics. This design facilitates accurate and transparent
longdesc visual representations of morphisms, tensor products, and
longdesc composition, thereby supporting both formal exposition and
longdesc pedagogical use. QWorld is intended for researchers and
longdesc educators working in categorical logic, quantum foundations,
longdesc topological quantum field theory (TQFT), and related domains
longdesc where graphical calculi constitute an essential mode of
longdesc reasoning.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/qworld
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics diagram diagram-circ graphics maths pgf-tikz physics
catalogue-version 1.1.2

name qyxf-book
shortdesc Book Template for Qian Yuan Xue Fu
longdesc qyxf-book is a LaTeX document class (template) developed by
longdesc Qian Yuan Xue Fu (QYXF), a student club of Xi'an Jiaotong
longdesc University (XJTU). Up to now, this template has been applied to
longdesc academic counselling material (course helpers) written by
longdesc members of QYXF, including Solutions to University Physics
longdesc Notes on Computing Methods Features of the template:
longdesc Minimalistic document style, as preferred for course helpers.
longdesc Several color schemes are offered, and it is easy to customize
longdesc your own scheme. Simple interfaces for users to customize the
longdesc style of preface, main part and so on. Currently the template
longdesc is only designed for Chinese typesetting.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://gitee.com/qyxf/qyxf-book/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://gitee.com/qyxf/qyxf-book
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/qyxf-book
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics book-pub chinese class
catalogue-version 3.1.0

name r_und_s
