name resolsysteme
shortdesc Work on linear systems using xint or pyluatex
longdesc This package provides some commands (in French) to perform
longdesc calculations on small (2x2 or 3x3 or 4x4) linear systems, with
longdesc xint or pyluatex: \DetMatrice or \DetMatricePY to diplay the
longdesc determinant of a matrix (with formatting options);
longdesc \MatriceInverse or \MatriceInversePY to display the invers of a
