name retosmatematicos
shortdesc LaTeX template for the Telegram group Retos Matematicos
longdesc This package provides the class RetoMatematico.cls, which is
longdesc used to typeset the final solutions of the mathematical
longdesc challenges published in the Telegram group Retos Matematicos
longdesc (by Jose Manuel Sanchez Munoz). Among its features, the class
longdesc sets the document size to letter paper, switches the font to
longdesc Palatino Linotype (via the mathpazo package), and places
longdesc information such as the group's ISSN and link in the page
longdesc margins. Further details and usage examples are available in
longdesc the package documentation.
