name returntogrid
shortdesc Semi-automatic grid typesetting
longdesc returntogrid offers a few commands to get something like an
longdesc simple, semi-automatic grid typesetting. It does more or less
longdesc what the existing gridset package does. The main differences to
longdesc gridset are that returntogrid works also with LuaLaTeX and that
longdesc it has also a command to do some horizontal movements to get to
longdesc tab positions.
catalogue-also grid gridset
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/u-fischer/returntogrid/issues
