name revbadge
shortdesc Multi-color highlight builder featuring block and inline revision badges
longdesc The revbadge package provides an elegant, column-safe framework
longdesc designed specifically for tracking major revisions and minor
longdesc modifications in academic manuscripts. This package can also be
longdesc used as a handy highlighting tool. The revbadge block
longdesc environment for handling long paragraphs, multi-line equations,
longdesc lists, and sections; revbadgemultiline shares the same purpose
longdesc but allows you to build multi-line badge labels; and the
longdesc \revbadgeinline macro for executing tight, mid-sentence word
longdesc corrections without disrupting standard line spacing. Both
longdesc components feature a dynamic colored badge mechanism that
longdesc labels modifications on the fly. The package provides native,
longdesc automated integration with hyperref and cleveref under a
longdesc unified highlight reference counter. Additionally, revbadge
longdesc comes pre-packaged with a vibrant, 24-theme colour palette
longdesc accessible via highly memorable 4-letter macro colour
longdesc identifiers (e.g., blue, gren, orng, purp, ylow, grey).
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/nablafx/revbadge
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/revbadge
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics colour editorial review-document
catalogue-version 1.2.1

