name ruler
shortdesc A typographic ruler for TeX
longdesc The file processes to produce (real) rulers; the author
longdesc suggests printing them on transparent plastic and trimming for
longdesc use as a real ruler. The rule widths are 0.05mm, which can be
longdesc challenging for (old) laser printers.
catalogue-also pointruler
catalogue-ctan /macros/generic/misc/ruler.tex
catalogue-license gpl
catalogue-topics misc-support
catalogue-version 1.1

name rulerbox
shortdesc Draw rulers around a box
longdesc This is a LaTeX package for drawing rulers around a box. This
longdesc might be useful when showing the absolute size of something in
longdesc electronic documents, or designating the relative scale in
longdesc printed materials.
catalogue-also fgruler
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/Mikumikunisiteageru/rulerbox/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/Mikumikunisiteageru/rulerbox
