name ruscap
shortdesc A Metafont for rustic capitals
longdesc This package contains the source for ruscap: a font for rustic
longdesc capitals - an ancient Roman calligraphic script - created with
longdesc Metafont.
catalogue-ctan /fonts/ruscap
catalogue-license ofl
catalogue-topics font font-archaic font-calligraphic font-mf
catalogue-version 1.0

name russ
shortdesc LaTeX in Russian, without babel
longdesc The package aims to facilitate Russian typesetting (based on
longdesc input using MicroSoft Code Page 1251). Russian hyphenation is
longdesc selected, and various mathematical commands are set up in
longdesc Russian style. Furthermore all Cyrillic letters' catcodes are
longdesc set to letter, so that commands with Cyrillic letters in their
longdesc names may be defined.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/russ
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics russian

name rutitlepage
shortdesc Radboud University Titlepage Package
longdesc This is an unofficial LaTeX package to generate titlepages for
longdesc the Radboud University, Nijmegen. It uses official vector logos
longdesc from the university. This package requires the following other
longdesc LaTeX packages: geometry, graphicx, ifpdf, keyval, iflang, and,
longdesc optionally, babel-dutch.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/dopefishh/rutitlepage/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/dopefishh/rutitlepage
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/rutitlepage
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics logo titlepage
catalogue-version 3.0

name rviewport
shortdesc Relative Viewport for Graphics Inclusion
longdesc Package graphicx provides a useful keyword viewport which
longdesc allows to show just a part of an image. However, one needs to
longdesc put there the actual coordinates of the viewport window.
longdesc Sometimes it is useful to have relative coordinates as
longdesc fractions of natural size. For example, one may want to print a
longdesc large image on a spread, putting a half on a verso page, and
longdesc another half on the next recto page. For this one would need a
longdesc viewport occupying exactly one half of the file's bounding box,
longdesc whatever the actual width of the image may be. This package
longdesc adds a new keyword rviewport to the graphicx package specifying
longdesc Relative Viewport for graphics inclusion: a window defined by
longdesc the given fractions of the natural width and height of the
longdesc image.
catalogue-also graphicx
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/rviewport
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics graphics-incl
catalogue-version 1.0

name rvwrite
shortdesc Increase the number of available output streams in LaTeX
longdesc The package addresses, for LaTeX documents, the severe
longdesc limitation on the number of output streams that TeX provides.
longdesc The package uses a single TeX output stream, and writes
longdesc marked-up output to this stream. The user may then post-process
longdesc the marked-up output file, using LaTeX, and the document's
longdesc output appears as separate files, according to the calls made
longdesc to the package. The output to be post-processed uses macros
longdesc from the widely-available ProTeX package.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/rvwrite
catalogue-license lppl1
catalogue-topics macro-supp
catalogue-version 1.2

name rwth-ci
shortdesc LaTeX templates using CI of RWTH Aachen University
