shortdesc A LaTeX class for SBL style print ready books
longdesc This package provides a LaTeX class for producing print ready
longdesc books conforming to the style required by the Society of
longdesc Biblical Literature. It depends on sblfonts for language
longdesc support, biblatex-sbl for referencing, sblidx for indexing and
longdesc biblatex-sbl for Scripture references.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/dcpurton/sbltex/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/dcpurton/sbltex
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/dcpurton/sbltex/tree/main/sblbook
