shortdesc Font and language set up for SBL style documents
longdesc This package provides a LaTeX package for setting up font and
longdesc language support for documents conforming to the requirements
longdesc of the Society of Biblical Literature. Greek and Hebrew
longdesc languages are supported using the SBL fonts. If these fonts are
longdesc not available then fonts included with TeX Live are used.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/dcpurton/sbltex/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/dcpurton/sbltex
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/dcpurton/sbltex/tree/main/sblfonts
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/sblfonts
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics font-absent font-supp multilingual theology
