name sblidx
shortdesc A LaTeX package for SBL style indices
longdesc This package provides a LaTeX package for creating indices in
longdesc line with the requirements of the Society of Biblical
longdesc Literature. Indices for ancient sources (via biblatex-sbl),
longdesc modern authors (via biblatex-sbl) and subjects are supported.
longdesc Number ranges are compressed and indexed items in notes are
longdesc indicated using n. and nn.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/dcpurton/sbltex/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/dcpurton/sbltex
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/dcpurton/sbltex/tree/main/sblidx
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/sblidx
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
