name secretx
shortdesc Put security classification marks in a document
longdesc This package provides a set of macros for marking paragraphs in
longdesc a document with a leading string and modifying the header and
longdesc the footer of each page. It includes environmentS for marking
longdesc large sections of text and environments for boxing figures and
longdesc tables. This is the spiritual successor to secret.sty but adds
