catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics maths
catalogue-version 0.6

name sesstime
shortdesc Session and timing information in lecture notes
longdesc This LaTeX2e package makes it possible to add timing marks to
longdesc lecture notes in order to help managing the time available for
longdesc presenting a given section of the document. It also provides
longdesc tools to record and estimate the progress throughout the
longdesc course.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/sesstime
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics teaching
catalogue-version 1.1.4

name setbuilder
shortdesc Mathematical sets with correctly scaled braces and separator
longdesc The package provides a \set command for set-builder notation:
longdesc \set{x \in \mathbb{R} \given x^2 < 2}. The separator (a
longdesc vertical bar, or a colon with the colon option) is typeset with
longdesc correct thin spaces, which automatically vanish in sub- and
longdesc superscripts. The starred form \set* scales the braces and the
longdesc separator together; \set[\Big] sets a fixed size. A
longdesc synonym=<name> package option defines the same command under a
longdesc different name, e.g. when \set is already taken by another
longdesc package. The package is based on mathtools.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/vssekorin/setbuilder/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/vssekorin/setbuilder
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/setbuilder
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics maths
catalogue-version 0.2.0

name setdeck
shortdesc Typeset cards for Set
longdesc The package will typeset cards for use in a game of Set.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/setdeck
catalogue-license gpl3
catalogue-topics games pgf-tikz
catalogue-version 0.1

name setspace
shortdesc Set space between lines
longdesc Provides support for setting the spacing between lines in a
longdesc document. Package options include singlespacing,
longdesc onehalfspacing, and doublespacing. Alternatively the spacing
longdesc can be changed as required with the \singlespacing,
longdesc \onehalfspacing, and \doublespacing commands. Other size
longdesc spacings also available.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/latex-package-repositories/setspace
catalogue-contact-support https://github.com/latex-package-repositories/setspace/issues
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/setspace
catalogue-license lppl1.3
