name show-pdf-tags
shortdesc Extract PDF tags from tagged PDF files
longdesc This package provides a tool to make the structure of tagged
longdesc PDF files visible. It parses a PDF file and extracts most
longdesc tagging related information to turn it into either a visual
longdesc tree structure or an XML document representing the tags. The
longdesc package is released together with a collection of schemas which
longdesc can be used to check that the resulting XML structure follows
longdesc specified rules.
