catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics class dissertation

name simplebnf
shortdesc A simple package to format Backus-Naur form (BNF)
longdesc This package provides a simple way for typesetting grammars in
longdesc Backus-Naur form (BNF). The included bnf environment parses BNF
longdesc expressions (possibly annotated), so users can write readable
longdesc BNF expressions in their documents. It features a flexible
longdesc configuration system, allowing for the customization of the
longdesc domain-specific language (DSL) used in typesetting the grammar.
longdesc Additionally, the package comes with sensible defaults. The
longdesc package requires expl3, xparse, mathtools, and tabularray..
catalogue-also backnaur
catalogue-contact-announce https://github.com/Zeta611/simplebnf/releases
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/Zeta611/simplebnf/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/Zeta611/simplebnf
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/simplebnf
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics formal-spec
catalogue-version 1.3.0

name simplecd
shortdesc Simple CD, DVD covers for printing
longdesc The package provides printable cut-outs for various CD, DVD and
longdesc other disc holders. The name of the package comes from its
longdesc implementation and ease of use; it was designed just for text
longdesc content, but since the text is placed in a \parbox in a tabular
longdesc environment cell, a rather wide range of things may be placed.
