catalogue-version 1.1.1

name simpler-wick
shortdesc Simpler Wick contractions
longdesc In every quantum field theory course, there will be a chapter
longdesc about Wick's theorem and how it can be used to convert a very
longdesc large product of many creation and annihilation operators into
longdesc something more tractable and normal ordered. The contractions
longdesc are denoted with a square bracket over the operators which are
longdesc being contracted, which used to be rather annoying to typeset
longdesc in LaTeX as the only other package available was simplewick,
longdesc which is rather unwieldy. This package provides a simpler
longdesc syntax for Wick contractions.
catalogue-also simplewick
catalogue-contact-home https://jpellis.me/projects/simpler-wick
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/JP-Ellis/simpler-wick
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/simpler-wick
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics physics tagged-pdf-partially
catalogue-version 1.0.0

name simples-matrices
shortdesc Define matrices by given list of values
longdesc Macros to define and write matrices whose coefficients are
longdesc given row by row in a list of values separated by commas.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/simples-matrices
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics maths matrix
catalogue-version 1.0.1

name simplesystemtex
shortdesc An automated file & block management system for large-scale LaTeX
longdesc This LaTeX3 package has been specifically designed for
longdesc large-scale, integrated typesetting tasks such as books,
longdesc theses, or extensive lecture notes. The core design philosophy
longdesc of this package is to maximize the separation of content and
longdesc structure. It provides an automated file and block management
longdesc system that frees content creators from constantly managing
longdesc global document structure and stylistic details. Key features
longdesc include: Automated subfile management: Section files are
longdesc automatically added to the TOC upon import. A flexible Block
longdesc System for theorems, definitions, and proofs. Dynamic
longdesc cross-referencing that generates and manages anchors
longdesc automatically. Automated generation of block indexes (e.g.,
longdesc List of Theorems). Highly customizable styling via dynamic
longdesc display arguments and conditional statements.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/JokerXin2025/SimpleSystemTeX/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/JokerXin2025/SimpleSystemTeX
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/simplesystemtex
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics book-pub optimise
catalogue-version 1.0.0

