name spotxcolor
shortdesc Modern spot color support for the xcolor package
longdesc This package provides robust spot color (e.g., DIC, PANTONE)
longdesc support for the xcolor package across all major TeX engines. It
longdesc resolves structural PDF issues found in the legacy spotcolor
longdesc package and provides an explicit fallback mechanism for
longdesc dvipdfmx (which is not fully supported by the colorspace
longdesc package). Supported major drivers: pdftex, luatex, dvipdfmx
longdesc (including ptex/uptex), xetex.
