name statusstamp
shortdesc Reproducible document status stamps for LaTeX
longdesc This package provides customizable distressed or clean status
longdesc stamps for LaTeX documents, with page overlays or inline stamps
longdesc and configurable appearance, placement, layering, dates, and
longdesc repeatable wear patterns.
