name staves
shortdesc Typeset Icelandic staves and runic letters
longdesc This package contains all the necessary tools to typeset the
longdesc magical Icelandic staves plus the runic letters used in
longdesc Iceland. Included are a font in Adobe Type 1 format and LaTeX
longdesc support.
catalogue-ctan /language/staves
catalogue-license lppl1.3b
catalogue-topics font font-rune font-type1 icelandic

name stdclsdv
shortdesc Provide sectioning information for package writers
longdesc The stdclsdv package is designed for package writers who need
longdesc to know what sectioning divisions are provided by the
longdesc document's class. It also provides a version of \CheckCommand
longdesc that sets a flag rather than printing a warning.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/LaTeX-Package-Repositories/herries-press
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/stdclsdv
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics macro-supp
