catalogue-version 2.0.5

name stepgreek
shortdesc A free Times/Elsevier-style Greek font
longdesc This is a beta version of the STEP Greek font. Only a regular
longdesc face is available at present, though there are plans to add
longdesc italic, bold and bold italic in the future. The font only
longdesc supports LGR in TeX and is meant to serve as a Greek complement
longdesc to a Times-like font such as STEP. The font supports polytonic
longdesc Greek.
catalogue-ctan /fonts/stepgreek
catalogue-license ofl
catalogue-topics font font-greek font-supp font-type1
catalogue-version 3.0b1

name stex
shortdesc An infrastructure for semantic preloading of LaTeX documents
longdesc The sTeX package collection is a version of TeX/LaTeX that
longdesc allows to markup TeX/LaTeX documents semantically without
longdesc leaving the document format, essentially turning it into a
longdesc document format for mathematical knowledge management (MKM).
