name storecmd
shortdesc Store the name of a defined command in a container
longdesc The package provides macros for command definition that save
longdesc the name of the command being defined in a file or a macro
longdesc container. The list could be useful for spelling exceptions in
longdesc text editors that do not support TeX syntax.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/storecmd
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics macro-supp
catalogue-version 0.0.2

