name subfloat
shortdesc Sub-numbering for figures and tables
longdesc This package enables sub-numbering of floats (figures and
longdesc tables) similar to the subequations-environment of the amsmath
longdesc package. The subfloat package is not to be confused with the
longdesc subfig package which generates sub-figures within one normal
longdesc figure, and manages their placement; subfloat only affects
longdesc captions and numbering.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/subfloat
catalogue-license lppl1
catalogue-topics subfloat tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 2.14

name substances
shortdesc A database of chemicals
longdesc The package provides the means to create a database-like file
longdesc that contains data of various chemicals. These data may be
longdesc retrieved in the document; an index of the chemicals mentioned
longdesc in the document can be created..
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/substances
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics chemistry
catalogue-version 0.2a

name substnote
shortdesc Substitution notation with a switchable convention
longdesc The package provides a single command for the notation of
longdesc substitution, \subst{\varphi}{x}{t}, and lets the convention be
longdesc chosen once in the preamble. Seven conventions are supported,
longdesc among them the two mirror-image readings of the slash, the
longdesc assignment colon, the arrow and the up-down form with the
longdesc variable above the term. Simultaneous substitutions are written
longdesc as two comma lists paired by index, and lists of different
longdesc lengths are reported as an error. The delimiters are selected
longdesc with a key and scale to their contents in the starred form, and
longdesc the colon of the assignment convention is centred on the
longdesc mathematical axis. The commands are mode-aware and robust, so
longdesc they may be used in section titles and captions. The package
longdesc requires only a recent LaTeX kernel and loads nothing else.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/vssekorin/substnote/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/vssekorin/substnote
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/substnote
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics maths
catalogue-version 0.1.0

name substr
shortdesc Deal with substrings in strings
longdesc The package provides commands to deal with substrings of
longdesc strings. Macros are provided to: determine if one string is a
longdesc substring of another, return the parts of a string before or
longdesc after a substring, and count the number of occurrences of a
longdesc substring.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/substr
catalogue-license lppl1
catalogue-topics macro-supp tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.2

name subsupscripts
shortdesc A range of sub- and superscript commands
longdesc The package provides a comprehensive and flexible set of
longdesc commands for combinations of left and right sub- and
longdesc superscripts.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/subsupscripts
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics maths physics subsup-pos
catalogue-version 1.0

name subtext
shortdesc Easy text-style subscripts in math mode
longdesc This LaTeX package gives easy access to text-style subscripts
longdesc in math mode by providing an optional argument to _. This is
longdesc implemented by using the \text{} command from the amstext
longdesc package.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/subtext
catalogue-license gpl3
catalogue-topics maths
catalogue-version 1.1

name sudoku
shortdesc Create sudoku grids
longdesc The sudoku package provides an environment for typesetting
longdesc sudoku grids. A sudoku puzzle is a 9x9 grid where some of the
longdesc squares in the grid contain numbers. The rules are simple:
longdesc every column can only contain the digits 1 to 9, every row can
longdesc only contain the digits 1 to 9 and every 3x3 box can only
longdesc contain the digits 1 to 9. More information, including help and
longdesc example puzzles, can be found at sudoku.org.uk. This site also
longdesc has blank sudoku grids (or worksheets), but you will not need
longdesc to print them from there if you have this package installed.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/sudoku
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics games sudoku
catalogue-version 1.0

name sudokubundle
shortdesc A set of sudoku-related packages
longdesc The bundle provides three packages: printsudoku, which provides
longdesc a command \sudoku whose argument is the name of a file
longdesc containing a puzzle specification; solvesudoku, which attempts
longdesc to find a solution to the puzzle in the file named in the
longdesc argument; and createsudoku, which uses the random package to
longdesc generate a puzzle according to a bunch of parameters that the
longdesc user sets via macros. The bundle comes with a set of
longdesc ready-prepared puzzle files.
catalogue-also sudoku
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/sudokubundle
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics games sudoku
catalogue-version 1.0a

