longdesc This package allows to slant (shear) short pieces of text to
longdesc the left or to the right by an arbitrary angle, thus creating
longdesc for example fake italics or upright italics. Several back-ends
longdesc that do the actual shearing are supported, though currently the
longdesc pdfLaTeX back-end works best concerning output quality and
longdesc processing speed.
