name tamefloats
shortdesc Experimentally use \holdinginserts with LaTeX floats
longdesc LaTeX's figures, tables, and \marginpars are dangerous for
longdesc footnotes (and probably also \enlargethispage). Here is a
longdesc proposal (a patch package) to help, by using \holdinginserts in
longdesc a simple way. It replaces the original problem with a new one -
longdesc it is an experiment to find out whether the new problem is less
longdesc bad (or it is just a contribution to the discussion, maybe just
longdesc a summary of previous work). The files provide further
longdesc information.
catalogue-contact-support https://www.webdesign-bu.de/uwe_lueck/contact.html
