name terminaltrees
shortdesc Evenly spaced leaves and rounded branches for Forest trees
longdesc terminaltrees adds a layout style to forest for trees with
longdesc evenly spaced terminal leaves on a shared baseline. It centers
longdesc each parent between its first and last immediate children and
longdesc draws rounded side branches. Label measurements determine
longdesc spacing automatically. The package uses ordinary forest bracket
longdesc syntax. An optional fittedterminaltree environment shrinks the
longdesc whole tree to the existing page layout, subject to a minimum
longdesc label size. It can move the tree to the next page but does not
longdesc change the paper size or split trees across pages.
