name texdoc
shortdesc Documentation access for TeX Live
longdesc texdoc is a Lua script providing easy access to the
longdesc documentation in TeX Live: PDF, DVI, plain text files, and
longdesc more. Viewing and other configuration can be extensively
longdesc customized. It is distributed with TeX Live; MiKTeX provides a
longdesc program by the same name to do the same job, but its
longdesc implementation is unrelated.
