name texdraw
shortdesc Graphical macros, using embedded PostScript
longdesc TeXdraw is a set of macro definitions for TeX, which allow the
longdesc user to produce PostScript drawings from within TeX and LaTeX.
longdesc TeXdraw has been designed to be extensible. Drawing segments
longdesc are relocatable, self-contained units. Using a combination of
longdesc TeX's grouping mechanism and the gsave/grestore mechanism in
longdesc PostScript, drawing segments allow for local changes to the
longdesc scaling and line parameters. Using TeX's macro definition
longdesc capability, new drawing commands can be constructed from
longdesc drawing segments.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/texdraw
catalogue-license cc-by-4
catalogue-topics graphics-in-tex
catalogue-version v2r3

name texecole
shortdesc A French-prose document composition language
longdesc This package provides a new LuaLaTeX document class for
longdesc teachers who want print-ready worksheets without writing LaTeX.
longdesc Documents are written in a French-only prose tag language (no
longdesc anglicisms), which the class translates to LaTeX at compile
longdesc time. It covers layout frames and grids, tables, images, a math
longdesc mini-language (fractions, sums, integrals, derivatives,
longdesc matrices), function plotting, plane and solid geometry, and
longdesc statistics/probability diagrams. An internal computation engine
longdesc handles most needs; Python (SymPy/SciPy) can be used for
longdesc extended symbolic and numeric computation. texecole est une
longdesc classe LuaLaTeX construite autour d'un langage de balises en
longdesc prose francaise - sans anglicisme - qui permet de creer
longdesc simplement des documents de grande qualite tout en beneficiant
longdesc de toute la puissance de LaTeX. Chaque document texecole est
longdesc traduit en code LaTeX a la compilation. texecole n'a pas pour
longdesc objectif de remplacer LaTeX, mais d'en faciliter l'acces et
longdesc d'en permettre l'apprentissage progressif. Il s'adresse a tous
longdesc : collegiens, lyceens, etudiants, enseignants, chercheurs,
longdesc ingenieurs, auteurs de documentation, et plus generalement a
longdesc toute personne souhaitant produire des documents scientifiques,
longdesc techniques ou pedagogiques. texecole couvre les cadres et
longdesc grilles a zones nommees, les tableaux, les images, les listes,
longdesc un mini-langage mathematique (fractions, sommes, integrales,
longdesc derivees, matrices et systemes lineaires), les graphiques de
longdesc fonctions, la geometrie plane et les solides, ainsi que les
longdesc statistiques et probabilites. Un moteur de calcul interne
longdesc couvre l'essentiel des besoins ; Python (SymPy et SciPy) peut
longdesc etre appele en complement pour le calcul formel et numerique
longdesc etendu.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/gdubard/texecole/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/gdubard/texecole
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/latex/texecole
catalogue-license gpl3+
catalogue-topics class french luatex simplified struc-mkup teaching
catalogue-version 1.1

