name texware
shortdesc Basic utility programs for use with TeX
longdesc Basic utility programs from the original TeX project at
longdesc Stanford, comprising: dvitype, which converts a TeX output
longdesc (DVI) file to a plain text file (see also the DVI structure
longdesc topic); pooltype, which converts a TeX-suite program's pool
longdesc (string) file into human-readable form; and tftopl and pltotf,
longdesc which convert between binary TeX font metric (TFM) files and
longdesc human readable property list (PL) files.
