name threadcol
shortdesc Organize document columns into PDF article thread
longdesc The package combines a document's columns into a PDF article
longdesc thread. PDF readers that support this mechanism (probably Adobe
longdesc Acrobat/Reader only) can be instructed to scroll automatically
longdesc from column to column, which facilitates on-screen reading of
longdesc two-column documents. Even for single-column documents,
longdesc threadcol supports the creation of multiple article threads,
longdesc which help organize discontiguous but logically related regions
longdesc of text into a form that the user can scroll through as if its
longdesc contents were contiguous.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/threadcol
catalogue-license lppl1.3
