name tikz-kalender
shortdesc A LaTeX based calendar using TikZ
longdesc For usage see the example files tikz-kalender-example1.tex,
longdesc tikz-kalender-example2.tex, tikz-kalender-example3.tex, and
longdesc *.events. The Code is inspired by this document and is subject
longdesc to the >>Creative Commons attribution license (CC-BY-SA)<<. The
longdesc class tikz-kalender requires the package TikZ and the TikZ
longdesc libraries calc and calendar.
