name tikzphysics
shortdesc TikZ-native shapes and anchors for classical physics diagrams
longdesc The package extends TikZ with reusable shapes, styles, keys,
longdesc and geometric anchors for physics diagrams. It provides
longdesc mechanics, contact surfaces and tracks, polar and Cartesian
longdesc differential elements, solid shell and slice constructions,
longdesc fluid mechanics, optical mirrors and lenses, waves,
longdesc thermodynamics, and thermal physics/heat transfer apparatus.
longdesc Features use ordinary TikZ node, path, and pic syntax with
longdesc reusable default styles. Integer percentage anchors compose
longdesc larger diagrams, and reference cards expose keys and anchors.
longdesc Diagrams default to black and white and inherit native TikZ
longdesc stroke widths.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/tikzphysics
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
