catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/tokglobalstack
catalogue-license agpl3 lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics macro-supp
catalogue-version 1.0

name tokgroupmark
shortdesc Restoring tokens after closing multiple groups
longdesc This package aims to solve the problem of how certain tokens
longdesc can be preserved beyond a variable number of nested groups.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/alceu-frigeri/tokgroupmark/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/alceu-frigeri/tokgroupmark
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/tokgroupmark
catalogue-license agpl3 lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics macro-supp
catalogue-version 1.0

name tokmap
shortdesc Iterate over a token list expandably, without dropping spaces or braced groups
longdesc Usage: \tokmap <command> { <tokens> } applies command over the
longdesc token list tokens. Space tokens, left and right braces are
longdesc replaced with the marker tokens \tokmap@space, \tokmap@bgroup,
longdesc and \tokmap@egroup respectively (which are \ifx-equal to
longdesc themselves exclusively). For convenience, command may contain
longdesc multiple tokens. It is assumed that { and } are the only
longdesc characters with category codes 1 (beginning of group) and 2
longdesc (end of group) respectively. Expandable. This package may be
longdesc used in LaTeX by \usepackage{tokmap}, or in plain TeX and other
longdesc formats by \input{tokmap}. See the visualtoks package for an
longdesc example application.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/plante3/tokmap
catalogue-ctan /macros/generic/tokmap
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics macro-gen macro-iterate
catalogue-version 1.0

name tokstools
shortdesc Tools for manipulating tokens
longdesc This package is still in the experimental stage. Therefore, its
longdesc behavior is not guaranteed to match the description in the
longdesc manual, and bugs of varying severity may occur. Additionally,
longdesc some features, as well as their syntax, may be subject to
longdesc change. It requires any modern engine that supports eTeX
longdesc primitives and can therefore be used with either TeX or LaTeX.
longdesc The tokstools package provides tools for manipulating tokens
longdesc and implements PEG-style grammars in TeX. Predefined elementary
longdesc patterns can be combined to form grammars that search for
longdesc matches within tokens. Two categories of macros are provided:
longdesc those operating on individual tokens (\toksdo, \tokscount, and
longdesc \printtoks); those operating on tokens that have matched a
longdesc grammar (\ifpegmatch, \pegcount, and \pegreplace)
catalogue-ctan /macros/generic/tokstools
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics parser tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 0.2

