catalogue-version 1.0a

name totcount
shortdesc Find the last value of a counter
longdesc The package records the value that was last set, for any
longdesc counter of interest; since most such counters are simply
longdesc incremented when they are changed, the recorded value will
longdesc usually be the maximum value.
catalogue-also lastpage totpages
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/totcount
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics counter-mgmt macro-supp tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.2

name totpages
shortdesc Count pages in a document, and report last page number
longdesc The package counts the actual pages in the document (as opposed
longdesc to reporting the number of the last page, as does lastpage).
longdesc The counter itself may be shipped out to the DVI file. The
longdesc package uses the everyshi package for its task.
catalogue-also count1to
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/totpages
catalogue-license lppl1.1
catalogue-topics label-ref tagged-pdf typesetting
catalogue-version 2.00

name tpic2pdftex
shortdesc Use tpic commands in pdfTeX
longdesc This AWK script converts pic language, embedded inline
longdesc (delimited by .PS and .PE markers), to \pdfliteral commands. It
longdesc is now maintained as part of TeX Live.
catalogue-ctan /graphics/tpic2pdftex
catalogue-license gpl
catalogue-topics graphics-prep

