name transition-metals
shortdesc Hybridization diagrams for transition metal complexes
longdesc This package provides tools for drawing hybridization diagrams
longdesc for transition-metal complexes. From a compact complex
longdesc specification, it automatically derives the d-electron count,
longdesc spin state, magnetic behaviour, effective atomic number, and
longdesc the orbitals involved in hybridization.
