name tui
shortdesc Thesis style for the University of the Andes, Colombia
longdesc Doctoral Dissertations from the Faculty of Engineering at the
longdesc Universidad de los Andes, Bogota, Colombia. The class is
longdesc implemented as an extension of the memoir class. Clase de Tesis
longdesc doctorales para ingenieria, Universidad de los Andes, Bogota.
