name turabian-formatting
shortdesc Formatting based on Turabian's Manual
longdesc The turabian-formatting package provides Chicago-style
longdesc formatting based on Kate L. Turabian's A Manual for Writers of
longdesc Research Papers, Theses, and Dissertations: Chicago Style for
longdesc Students and Researchers (9th edition).
catalogue-also turabian biblatex-chicago
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/turabian-formatting
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics class dissertation

name turkce-sayi
shortdesc Automatic Turkish suffix handling for reference numbers
longdesc When a number in a Turkish document is generated by a
longdesc cross-reference (\ref, \pageref, \cite), the correct form of
longdesc any appended suffix depends on how that number is pronounced,
longdesc an information that is not available at the time of editing.
longdesc Specifying a suffix works for some numbers, but for others it
longdesc silently results in incorrect output. This package solves this
longdesc problem at compile time via LuaTeX. It determines the
longdesc phonological properties of the Turkish name of the number and
longdesc applies the appropriate transformation rules.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/sonatsuer/turkce-sayi-latex/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/sonatsuer/turkce-sayi-latex
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/latex/turkce-sayi
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics turkish
catalogue-version 1.0

name turkmen
shortdesc Babel support for Turkmen
longdesc The package provides support for Turkmen in babel, but
longdesc integration with babel is not available.
catalogue-ctan /language/turkmen
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics multilingual-addon tagged-pdf turkmen
catalogue-version 0.2

name turnstile
shortdesc Typeset the (logic) turnstile notation
longdesc Among other uses, the turnstile sign is used by logicians for
longdesc denoting a consequence relation, related to a given logic,
