name unipersian
shortdesc Persian language support for LaTeX, LuaLaTeX, and XeLaTeX using Babel
longdesc This package provides a convenient interface for typesetting
longdesc Persian as the main language, with English text in LaTeX, based
longdesc on the Babel package and using LuaTeX (recommended), XeTeX
longdesc (fallback), or pdfTeX (last resort) as the underlying engine.
longdesc It provides Persian captions and numerals, bidirectional text
longdesc support, and adaptations for common document classes and
longdesc Beamer.
