longdesc The package allows the user to define shorthand aliases for
longdesc single Unicode characters, and also provides support for such
longdesc aliases in RTL-text. The package requires an TeX-alike system
longdesc that uses Unicode input in a native way: current examples are
longdesc XeTeX and LuaTeX.
