name unizgklasa
shortdesc A LaTeX class for theses at the Faculty of Graphic Arts in Zagreb
longdesc This class is intended for generating graduate and final theses
longdesc according to the instructions of the Faculty of Graphic Arts,
longdesc University of Zagreb. It does not necessarily correspond to the
longdesc requirements of each component of the University, but is
longdesc designed as an idea for linking and uniformizing the look of
longdesc all graduate papers. Anyone who likes it is welcome to use it.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/unizgklasa
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics class croatian dissertation
catalogue-version 1.0

name unravel
shortdesc Watching TeX digest tokens
longdesc The aim of this LaTeX package is to help debug complicated
longdesc macros. This is done by letting the user step through the
longdesc execution of some TeX code, going through the details of nested
longdesc expansions, performing assignments, as well as some simple
longdesc typesetting commands. To use this package, one should normally
longdesc run TeX in a terminal. The unravel package requires up-to-date
longdesc versions of the l3kernel, l3packages and l3experimental
longdesc bundles.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/blefloch/latex-unravel
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/unravel
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics debug-supp macro-supp tagged-pdf
