name updatemarks
shortdesc Extract and update marks from boxes
longdesc This package can help you update marks if you put your title in
longdesc boxes. You can use
longdesc \usepackage[minipage,multicol,tcolorbox]{updatemarks} in the
longdesc preamble of your document so that marks in these environments
longdesc can be found by LaTeX. You can use \ExtractMarks or
longdesc \ExtractSplitMarks to save marks, and \UpdateMarks to reinsert
