name upmendex
shortdesc Multilingual index processor
longdesc The package is a multilingual index processor with the
longdesc following features: Mostly compatible with makeindex and upper
longdesc compatible with mendex. Supports UTF-8 and works with upLaTeX,
longdesc XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX. Supports Latin (including non-English),
longdesc Greek, Cyrillic, Korean Hangul and Chinese Han (Hanzi
longdesc ideographs) scripts, as well as Japanese Kana. Supports four
longdesc kinds of sort orders (Pinyin, Radical-Stroke, Stroke and
longdesc Zhuyin) for Chinese Han scripts (Hanzi ideographs). Support
longdesc Brahmic (Bengali, Devanagari, Gurmukhi, Gujarati, Kannada, Lao,
longdesc Malayalam, Oriya, Sinhala, Tamil, Telugu, Thai), Arabic and
longdesc Hebrew scripts (experimental). Applies International Components
longdesc for Unicode (ICU) for sorting process.
