name usebib
shortdesc A simple bibliography processor
longdesc The package is described by its author as a poor person's
longdesc replacement for the more powerful methods provided by BibLaTeX
longdesc to access data from a .bib file. Its principle commands are
longdesc \bibinput (which specifies a database to use) and \usebibdata
longdesc (which typesets a single field from a specified entry in that
longdesc database.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/usebib
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics biblio tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.0a

name useclass
shortdesc Load classes as packages
longdesc This package enables the usage of classes as packages. It was
longdesc originally designed for the l3doc class, which is employed for
longdesc documenting LaTeX code with numerous useful features. However,
longdesc employing the l3doc class as a package is not convenient when
longdesc using the developing class as the style for the document.
longdesc Therefore, this package provides a simple interface for
longdesc utilizing classes as packages.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/huangyxi/useclass/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/huangyxi/useclass
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/useclass
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics doc-supp
catalogue-version 1.1

name user-persona
shortdesc Typesetting User Persona sheets for UX and HCI (Human-Computer Interaction)
longdesc This package provides a structured environment and command set
longdesc for typesetting professional user persona sheets in LaTeX. A
longdesc user persona is a research-grounded representation of a target
longdesc user group, synthesizing observed behaviours, goals, and
longdesc frustrations into a humanized archetype (Cooper, 1999). The
longdesc package is intended for User Experience (UX) researchers,
longdesc Human-Computer Interaction (HCI) practitioners, and product
longdesc designers who maintain documentation within a LaTeX workflow.
longdesc The central persona environment produces a two-column layout
longdesc comprising a portrait image, an identity table, a pull-quote,
longdesc and a set of colour-coded content cards. Cards may be placed in
longdesc the left column, right column, or as a full-width span below
longdesc both columns. Predefined semantic colours are supplied for
longdesc common persona sections (Goals, Behaviours, Pain Points,
longdesc Context). Inline pill labels and icon badges are supported via
longdesc \personapill and \personabrand (using fontawesome5).
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/fractuscontext/user-persona/issues/
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/fractuscontext/user-persona/
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/user-persona
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics doc-templ graphics-use layout project-mgmt
catalogue-version 1.0.0

name ushort
shortdesc Shorter (and longer) underlines and underbars
longdesc Some engineers need underlined or twice underlined variables
longdesc for which the usual \underline is too long. This package
longdesc provides a generic command for creating underlines of various
longdesc sizes and types.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/ushort
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics tagged-pdf-partially underline
