name vruler
shortdesc Numbering text
longdesc The package offers facilities for adding a columns of numbering
longdesc to the general text so that the text can be properly
longdesc referenced. The vertical ruler can be scaled and moved freely.
longdesc The package may be used either with LaTeX or with plain TeX.
catalogue-also lineno numline
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/vruler
catalogue-license lppl1
catalogue-topics layout tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 2.3

name vscodeicons
shortdesc Use vscode icons through LaTeX commands
longdesc This package inspired by twemojis provides commands to use the
longdesc icons from the vscode-icons project through LaTeX commands.
longdesc This relies on images (PDF from SVG), so no fancy unicode-font
longdesc stuff is needed and it should work on every installation.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/cpierquet/latex-packages/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/cpierquet/latex-packages/tree/main/vscodeicons
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/vscodeicons
catalogue-license lppl1.3c cc-by-sa-4 mit
catalogue-topics graphics text-symbol
catalogue-version 12.19.0

name vtable
shortdesc Vertical alignement of table cells
longdesc The package allows vertical alignement of table cell by
longdesc providing: Z, L, C, R, J and I column types \nextRow and \lb
longdesc commands \setMultiColRow, \setMultiColumn, \setMultiRow and
longdesc \tableFormatedCell commands for tabular and similar
longdesc environment.
catalogue-contact-repository https://bitbucket.org/OpCode-eu-org/LaTeX-libs/
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/vtable
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics table
catalogue-version 1.0

name vwcol
shortdesc Variable-width multiple text columns
longdesc The package provides a crude environment (vwcol) for
longdesc typesetting multicolumn paragraph text of various column widths
longdesc on a single page.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/vwcol
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics multicol tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 0.2

name wadalab
shortdesc Japanese font packages from Wadalab
longdesc These are font bundles for the Japanese Wadalab fonts which
longdesc work with the CJK package. All subfonts now have glyph names
longdesc compliant to the Adobe Glyph List, making ToUnicode CMaps in
longdesc PDF documents (created automatically by dvipdfmx) work
longdesc correctly. All font bundles now contain virtual Unicode
longdesc subfonts.
catalogue-also cjk-fonts
catalogue-ctan /fonts/wadalab
catalogue-license other-free
catalogue-topics font font-cjk font-type1

name wallcalendar
shortdesc A wall calendar class with custom layouts
longdesc This package provides a wall calendar class with custom layouts
longdesc and support for internationalization. It comes with the
longdesc following layouts: Full page photo, the calendar days overlaid
longdesc with opacity Full page photo, the photo above the calendar days
longdesc Small landscape photo, with a calendar grid Year planner
longdesc Thumbnails and captions Varnish mask There is also support for
longdesc loading event marks from a CSV file.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/profound-labs/wallcalendar
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/latex/wallcalendar
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics calendar class luatex use-lua
catalogue-version 1.6.0

name wallpaper
shortdesc Easy addition of wallpapers (background images) to LaTeX documents, including tiling
longdesc This collection contains files to add wallpapers (background
longdesc images) to LaTeX documents. It uses the eso-pic package, but
longdesc provides simple commands to include effects such as tiling. An
longdesc example is provided, which works under both LaTeX and pdfLaTeX.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/wallpaper
catalogue-license lppl
catalogue-topics layout-page tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 1.10

name wargame
shortdesc A LaTeX package to prepare hex'n'counter wargames
longdesc This package can help make classic Hex'n'Counter wargames using
longdesc LaTeX. The package provides tools for generating Hex maps and
longdesc boards Counters for units, markers, and so on Counter sheets
longdesc Order of Battle charts Illustrations in the rules using the
longdesc defined maps and counters The result will often be a PDF (or
longdesc set of PDFs) that contains everything one will need for a game
longdesc (rules, charts, boards, counter sheets). The package uses NATO
longdesc App6 symbology for units. The package uses NATO App6 symbology
longdesc for units. The package uses TikZ for most things. The package
longdesc supports exporting the game to a VASSAL module See also the
longdesc README.md file for more, and of course the documentation
longdesc (including the tutorial in tutorial/game.pdf).
catalogue-contact-repository https://gitlab.com/wargames_tex/wargame_tex
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/wargame
catalogue-license cc-by-sa-4
catalogue-topics games pgf-tikz symbol-supp
catalogue-version 0.8

name warning
shortdesc Global warnings at the end of the logfile
longdesc This package is obsolete. For LaTeX-format 2020-10-01 and
longdesc newer: Instead of \addglobalwarning{ something } use
longdesc \AddToHook{enddocument/info}{ something } and do not load the
longdesc warning package. For older formats this package provides a
longdesc command that generates a list of warnings that are printed out
longdesc at the very end of the logfile. This is useful for warnings
longdesc such as Rerun for this or that reason or This is a draft,
longdesc change it before the final run.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/warning
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics comp-supp
catalogue-version 0.11

name warpcol
shortdesc Relative alignment of rows in numeric columns in tabulars
longdesc Defines a tabular column type for formatting numerical columns
longdesc in LaTeX. The column type enables numerical items to be right
longdesc justified relative to each other, while centred beneath the
longdesc column label. In addition, macros are provided to enable
longdesc variations on this column type to be defined. Usage of the
longdesc package is superficially similar to that of dcolumn; however,
longdesc the alignment scheme is different, and the packages have
longdesc different, though overlapping, applications.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/warpcol
catalogue-license lppl1
catalogue-topics table tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 1.0c

name was
shortdesc A collection of small packages by Walter Schmidt
longdesc A bundle of packages that arise in the author's area of
longdesc interest: compliance of maths typesetting with ISO standards;
longdesc symbols that work in both maths and text modes commas for both
longdesc decimal separator and maths; and upright Greek letters in
longdesc maths.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/was
catalogue-license collection
catalogue-topics collection

name wasy
shortdesc The wasy fonts (Waldi symbol fonts)
longdesc This font contains all lasy characters (by L.Lamport, copyright
longdesc notice in lasychr.mf), and a lot more symbols. Provided are the
longdesc Metafont files for 5-10pt, and bold and slanted 10pt fonts,
longdesc together with a .tex and .pdf documentation, and a file for
longdesc using the fonts in a PLAIN-TeX document. Type-1 fonts by
longdesc Michael Sharpe and Taco Hoekwater are available as separate
longdesc package wasy-type1. Support under LaTeX is provided by Axel
longdesc Kielhorn's wasysym package.
catalogue-alias wasy2
catalogue-also wasy-type1 wasysym
catalogue-ctan /fonts/wasy
catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics font font-mf font-symbol
catalogue-version 2.5

name wasy-type1
shortdesc Type 1 versions of wasy fonts
longdesc Converted (Adobe Type 1) outlines of the wasy fonts.
catalogue-alias wasy2-ps
catalogue-also wasy wasysym
catalogue-ctan /fonts/wasy-type1
catalogue-license pd
catalogue-topics font font-symbol font-type1
catalogue-version 001.002

name wasysym
shortdesc LaTeX support for the wasy fonts
longdesc The wasy (Waldi Symbol) font by Roland Waldi provides many
longdesc glyphs like male and female symbols and astronomical symbols,
longdesc as well as the complete lasy font set and other odds and ends.
longdesc This package implements an easy to use interface for these
longdesc symbols.
catalogue-also wasy wasy-type1
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/wasysym
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics font-supp tagged-pdf-partially
catalogue-version 2.4

name web
shortdesc The original literate programming system
longdesc The system processes web files in two ways: firstly to
longdesc rearrange them to produce compilable code (using the program
longdesc tangle), and secondly to produce a TeX source (using the
longdesc program weave) that may be typeset for comfortable reading.
catalogue-ctan /systems/knuth/dist/web
catalogue-license knuth
catalogue-topics litprog
catalogue-version 4.5

