catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/brianchase/windycity/issues
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/brianchase/windycity
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/biblatex-contrib/windycity
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics biblatex

name wintools.windows
shortdesc utilities provided only for Windows
longdesc Common utilities, mainly from the w32tex distribution.

name wiseref
shortdesc Cross-references with configurable type names, affixes, and number formats
longdesc The package formats references to one or more labels, with
longdesc per-type affixes, number formats, built-in language profiles,
longdesc optional sorting and ranges, and selectable hyperlink scope. It
longdesc supports pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX, and LuaLaTeX.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/hithesis/wiseref
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/wiseref
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics hyper label-ref
catalogue-version v1.2026a

name withargs
shortdesc In-place argument substitution
longdesc The \withargs command provides a clean way to populate a
longdesc template (containing #1, #2, etc.) using LaTeX argument
longdesc substitution. It also allows you to carefully control argument
longdesc expansion using a LaTeX3-style argument specification. Uses
longdesc range from creating readable string templates (akin to C's
longdesc printf function) to performing otherwise complex token-list
longdesc manipulation.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/mhelvens/latex-withargs
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/withargs
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics macro-supp
catalogue-version 0.3.1

name witharrows
shortdesc Aligned math environments with arrows for comments
longdesc This package provides an environment WithArrows which is
longdesc similar to the environment aligned of amsmath (and mathtools),
longdesc but gives the possibility to draw arrows on the right side of
longdesc the alignment. These arrows are usually used to give
longdesc explanations concerning the mathematical calculus presented.
longdesc The package requires the following other LaTeX packages: expl3,
longdesc footnote, l3keys2e, tikz, and xparse.
catalogue-ctan /macros/generic/witharrows
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics macro-gen maths maths-syseqn pgf-tikz tagged-pdf-incompatible
catalogue-version 2.9a

name wnri
shortdesc Ridgeway's fonts
longdesc Fonts (as Metafont source) for Old English, Indic languages in
longdesc Roman transliteration and Puget Salish (Lushootseed) and other
longdesc Native American languages.
catalogue-ctan /fonts/wnri
catalogue-license gpl
catalogue-topics font font-mf font-specialist

