name xdvipsk-support
shortdesc LuaLaTeX packages for the xdvipsk binary (dvips extension)
longdesc This LaTeX package bundle offers support for xdvipsk, an
longdesc extension of the dvips binary. xdvipsk supports BMP, PCX, TIFF,
longdesc JPEG, and PNG formats and performs scaling, rotating, trim, and
longdesc viewport operations like EPS images. The xdvispk.def driver for
longdesc the graphics package offers a LaTeX interface. However, it
longdesc lacks clipping, trimming, and viewport operations. The LuaLaTeX
longdesc package xdvipskmaps provides OpenType font support for xdvipsk.
longdesc It generates map files containing information about OpenType
longdesc fonts used in DVI files.
catalogue-ctan /macros/luatex/latex/xdvipsk-support
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics dvi-print
