name xellipsis
shortdesc Extremely configurable ellipses with formats for various style manuals
longdesc The xellipsis package provides a system for configuring
longdesc (almomst) every possible aspect of ellipses, including
longdesc preceding and proceeding characters; the character itself;
longdesc distances before and after each of these; and number of
longdesc characters. It comes with both a compatibility option for
longdesc standard LaTeX \ldots as well as preset package options for the
longdesc Chicago Manual of Style (Turabian); the Bluebook; and MLA
longdesc guidelines.
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/xellipsis
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics typesetting
catalogue-version 2.0

name xepersian
shortdesc Persian for LaTeX, using LuaTeX or XeTeX
longdesc This package provides a convenient interface for typesetting
longdesc Persian and English texts in LaTeX, using the LuaTeX or the
longdesc XeTeX engine. The name XePersian is derived from the words
longdesc experience and persian and captures the author's philosophy of
longdesc writing the package for the best Persian typesetting experience
longdesc in TeX.
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/xepersian/xepersian/issues
catalogue-ctan /macros/unicodetex/latex/xepersian
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
