name xjyutping
shortdesc Automatically add Cantonese Jyutping to Traditional Chinese characters
longdesc xjyutping is a packaged that adds Cantonese Jyutping (Yue Pin )
longdesc on top of Traditional Chinese Characters. Pronunciation is
longdesc determined through looking at context and cross referencing
longdesc with existing vocabulary. The package supports XeLaTeX and
longdesc LuaLaTeX. It was inspired by the project xpinyin which adds
longdesc mandarin pinyin to Simplified Characters. The code is under the
longdesc LPPL 1.3c and the data under CC BY-SA 4.0.
