longdesc This package extends listings with an easier front-end for code
longdesc blocks: language-sensitive highlighting of numbers (including
longdesc hexadecimal literals, exponents and type suffixes), a drop-in
longdesc minted environment, per-language wrapper macros and
longdesc environments, non-selectable line numbers based on accsupp,
longdesc language badges, and opinionated definitions for a set of
longdesc common languages that are loaded on demand.
