name yagusylo
shortdesc A symbol loader
longdesc The name is by way of being an acronym for Yet Another Grand
longdesc Unified Symbols Loader... The package allows the user to access
longdesc a symbol without loading the package that usually provides it;
longdesc this has the advantage of avoiding the name clashes that so
