name zbmath-review-template
shortdesc Template for a zbMATH Open review
longdesc This package contains a template for zbMATH Open reviews. It
longdesc will show what your review will look like on zbMATH Open and
longdesc you can test whether your LaTeX-Code will compile on our
longdesc system. The template has to be compiled using XeLaTeX and
longdesc relies on scrartcl, scrlayer-scrpage, amsfonts, amssymb,
longdesc amsmath, babel, enumitem, etoolbox, fontspec, gensymb,
longdesc geometry, graphicx, mathrsfs, mathtools, stmaryrd, textcomp,
longdesc tikz-cd, xcolor, and xparse.
catalogue-ctan /macros/xetex/latex/zbmath-review-template
catalogue-license gpl3 cc-by-sa-4
catalogue-topics doc-templ xetex
catalogue-version 2.1

name zebra
shortdesc Writing revision toolkits
longdesc This package provides inline note-taking macros (\todo,
longdesc \comment, \fixed, \note, \placeholder) for collaborative paper
longdesc writing. Notes are colour-coded, numbered, and marked in the
longdesc margin for quick scanning. A summary table and clickable note
longdesc list are appended at the end of the document. Custom note types
longdesc and margin symbols are supported. Note: This package was
longdesc previously distributed as zebra-goodies. The old name still
longdesc works, but prints a deprecation warning - zebra is the name of
longdesc the package author's lab.
catalogue-alias zebra-goodies
catalogue-contact-development https://github.com/xueruini
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/xueruini/zebra
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/zebra
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics editorial marginal notes
catalogue-version 2.1.0

name zeckendorf
shortdesc Knuth Fibonacci multiplication, Zeckendorf and Bergman representations of big integers
longdesc This package extends the \xinteval syntax to do algebra in
longdesc Q(phi) (where phi is the golden ratio), and compute Fibonacci
longdesc numbers, Zeckendorf representations of positive integers and
longdesc Bergman phi-representations of the positive elements of Z[phi].
longdesc The $ character is used to compute the Knuth Fibonacci
longdesc multiplication. The package can be used either in a LaTeX
longdesc document, or with Plain eTeX, or on the command line in an
longdesc interactive session using eTeX. Being based upon xintexpr, it
longdesc allows to compute with arbitrarily big integers, the reasonable
longdesc use being with integers of at most a few hundreds of digits.
catalogue-ctan /macros/generic/zeckendorf
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics arithmetic calculation tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 0.9d

name zed-csp
shortdesc Typesetting Z and CSP format specifications
longdesc The package supports real-time CSP and incorporates the
longdesc functionality of Spivey's original Z package, written for LaTeX
longdesc 2.09.
catalogue-also objectz
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/zed-csp
catalogue-license other-free
catalogue-topics formal-spec

name zennote
shortdesc Streamline your note-taking process!
longdesc This package aims to provide you with an easy interface to
longdesc speed up the process when organizing and producing elegant
longdesc notes. All the tables, figures, equations, and listings are
longdesc labelled according to the notenumber with the \titlebox
longdesc command. The noteframe environment helps you generate fancy
longdesc colored boxes to emphasize the important information (e.g.
longdesc Theorems, Equations, Proofs, etc.) in your document. You can
longdesc customize the style and color to denote different categories,
longdesc too.
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/futurelyf/zennote
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/zennote
catalogue-license cc-by-4
catalogue-topics notes
catalogue-version 1.0.0

name zhlineskip
shortdesc Line spacing for CJK documents
longdesc This package supports typesetting CJK documents. It allows
longdesc users to specify the two ratios between the leading and the
longdesc font size of the body text and the footnote text. For CJK
longdesc typesetting, these ratios usually range from 1.5 to 1.67. This
longdesc package is also capable of restoring the math leading to that
longdesc of the Latin text (usually 1.2 times the font size). Finally,
longdesc it is possible to achieve the Microsoft Word multiple line
longdesc spacing style using zhlineskip.
catalogue-contact-development https://github.com/CTeX-org
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/CTeX-org/ctex-kit
catalogue-contact-support https://github.com/CTeX-org/ctex-kit/issues
catalogue-ctan /language/chinese/zhlineskip
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics chinese tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 1.0g

