catalogue-ctan /macros/xetex/generic/zhspacing
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics chinese multilingual-addon tagged-pdf-unsupported

name ziffer
shortdesc Conversion of punctuation in maths mode
longdesc The package modifies the behaviour of characters in maths mode
longdesc so that: . is used as a one-thousand separator (as is common in
longdesc Germany) , is used as a decimal separator (as is common in
longdesc Germany) -- is represented with spacing as appropriate to such
longdesc constructs as 1.000,--. These conversions may be switched on
longdesc and off.
catalogue-also icomma
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/ziffer
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics numbers tagged-pdf
catalogue-version 2.1

